1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sybil Devereux1
2 CONT *'''F, #30486, b. circa 1440, d. before 1499
2 CONT *Father      Sir Walter Devereux, Sheriff of Herefordshire & Gloucestershire, Constable of Wigmore, Keeper of Leominster b. c 1412, d. 22 Apr 1459
2 CONT *Mother     Elizabeth Merbury b. c 1412, d. b 1459
2 CONT *'''     Sybil Devereux was born circa 1440 at of Weobley, Herefordshire, England. She married Sir James Baskerville, son of Sir John Baskerville and Elizabeth Touchet, in 1454. Sybil Devereux died before 1499.
2 CONT *'''Family      Sir James Baskerville b. c 1436, d. 22 Jan 1499
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Sir Walter Baskerville+ b. 1462, d. 4 Sep 1508
2 CONT **Elizabeth Baskerville+2 b. c 1464
