2 CONT **(Miss) Baskerville3 b. c 1467
2 CONT **(Miss) Baskerville3 b. c 1468
2 CONT **Philip Baskerville3 b. c 1470
2 CONT **Richard Baskerville3 b. c 1471
2 CONT **Henry Baskerville+ b. c 1473
2 CONT **Edmund Baskerville3 b. c 1474
2 CONT **Johanna Baskerville3 b. c 1476
2 CONT **Thomas Baskerville3 b. c 1477
2 CONT **Ralph Baskerville3 b. c 1479
2 CONT **John Baskerville3 b. c 1490
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S9419] Unknown author, Some Early English Pedigrees, by Vernon M. Norr, p. 16; Wallop Family, p. 57.
2 CONT * 2.[S61] Unknown author, Family Group Sheets, Family History Archives, SLC.
2 CONT * 3.[S11588] Some Early English Pedigrees, by Vernon M. Norr, p. 16.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1015.htm#i30486 __________________
2 CONT *'''Catherine DEVEREUX
2 CONT *'''Born: ABT 1438, Weobley, Herefordshire, England
2 CONT *'''Died: ABT 1499
2 CONT *Father: Walter DEVEREUX (Sir)
2 CONT *Mother: Elizabeth MERBURY
