2 CONT http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=selvage1&id=I12390
2 CONT
2 CONT ID: I12390 View Post-em! Name: ELIZABETH BASKERVILLE Sex: F Birth: ABT 1464 in England Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES DIFFER AS TO WHO WERE THE PARENTS OF ELIZABETH. HERE IT IS CONSIDERED THAT SHE WAS DAUGHTER OF SIR JAMES BASKERVILLE AND HIS WIFE KATHERINE DEVEREUX, BUT THIS CONCLUSION NEEDS DOCUMENTED PROOF.
2 CONT
2 CONT GenServe files, 23 July 1998: ALDB7KB; CANC6GA; and SMIA7MT.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth is generally shown with a birth circa 1495. Given as the daughter of ? Baskerville (circa 1470 - ) and Sybil Devereux (circa 1474 - ) in a number of sources.
2 CONT
2 CONT Attribution of James Baskerville and Katherine Devereux as parents is doubtful if her date of birth was circa 1495 (from several sources) as this would mean her mother was nearly 60 years of age at her birth, at which time her fat
2 CONC her had been dead for nearly a decade. With this date of birth in mind, attribution to ? Baskerville and mother Sybil Devereux would be more reasonable, with ? Baskerville possibly being a son of Sir James Baskerville. On the othe
2 CONC r hand, if daughter Katherine is actually the grandmother of John Scudamore who married daughter Sybil, then Elizabeth must have been born earlier that 1495, in which case she could well be the daughter of Sir James Baskerville.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wendy, 7 June 2000, post to GenForum Baskerville Genealogy Forum. From the pedigree chart C of the Harley Manuscripts at the British Museum: Elizabeth Baskerville, daughter of Sir John [sic] Baskerville Knight, married Watkin Vaug
2 CONC han of Hergest or Tredkeintyn, England. Eight children: Walter Vaughan Roger Vaughan Oliver Vaughan James Vaughan of Hergest Katharen Vaughan, married Richard Mynors Anne Vaughan, married John Aberhall of Herefordshire Sibell Vaug
2 CONC han, married John Seudamore of Homelacey Elizabeth Vaughan, married John Lewis of Powis.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wendy, 2 December 2000, post to GenForum Baskerville Genealogy Forum. From the pedigree chart for the Vaughans of Hergest, Harley Manuscripts, British Museum: Elizabeth, daughter of Sir James Baskerville Knight, married Watkins Va
2 CONC ughan of Hergest, son of Sir thomas Vaughan of Hergest and Ellen, daughter of Gethin of Lleywein. Children: James Vaughan of Hergest, married Elizabeth Crostos, daughter of Sir Edward Crostos, Knight. Their child: Charles Vaughan 
2 CONC married (1) Elizabeth Baskerville, daughter of James Baskerville, Knight (possibly four children); married (2) Margaret Vaughan, daughter of Sir William Vaughan, Knight (one son). Katharen Vaughan, married Richard Mynors. Anne Vau
2 CONC ghan, married John Aberhall of Herefordshire. Sibell Vaughan, married John Seudamore of Homelacey. Elizabeth Vaughan, married John Lewis of Powis.
2 CONT
2 CONT Larry D. Hamilton Coats, 8 September 2000, post to GenForum Baskerville Genealogy Forum. The following descendancies are given:
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir James Baskerville + Sibyl [Katherine] Devereaux [..] = name adopted here Sybil [Elizabeth] Baskerville + Watkin Vaughan Sibyl Vaughan + John Scudamore
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir James Baskerville + Sibyl Devereaux Sybil [Elizabeth] Baskerville + Watkin Vaughan Katherine Vaughan + Sir Richard Mynors Alice Mynors + William Scudamore John Scudamore + Sibyl Vaughan
2 CONT
2 CONT Doubt was expressed as these lines would suggest that one generation may be missing.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.moonrakers.com/baskerville/CHESTER/wga2.html, 6 October 2002. Elizabeth born circa 1464 [this date of birth is provisionally accepted here]. Of Combe, Herefordshire, England, and Holt, Warwickshire, England. Mother Kath
2 CONC erine (Sibyl) Devereux. She married Walter Vaughan in 1483. Given these dates, the lineages given up by Larry Coats might be restated as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir James Baskerville + Sibyl [Katherine] Devereaux {[..] = name adopted here} Sybil [Elizabeth] Baskerville [~1464 - ] + Watkin [Walter] Vaughan [1459 - ] Sibyl Vaughan [bef. 1510 - ] + John Scudamore [~1518]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir James Baskerville + Sibyl Devereaux Sybil [Elizabeth] Baskerville [~1464 - ] + Watkin [Walter] Vaughan [1459 - ] Katherine Vaughan [est. 1484 - ] + Sir Richard Mynors Alice Mynors [est. 1501 - ] + William Scudamore [1458 - } J
2 CONC ohn Scudamore [~1518 - ] + Sibyl Vaughan [bef. 1510 - ]
2 CONT
2 CONT This chronology will fit essentially by making one critical assumption, that Sibyl, wife of John Scudamore, was nearly a decade only than her husband.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bob Baskerville, post to GenForum Baskerville Surname Forum, 27 October 1999. Elizabeth, daughter of Sir James Baskerville, married Vaughan de Hergest.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~dust/d_511.htm., 6 October 2002. Married Walter Vaughan in 1483. _UID: 39DC8E62B7154B268E9507FF2CD05FF3B96A
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Sir JAMES BASKERVILLE b: ABT 1430 in Eardisley, Herefordshire, England  Mother: KATHERINE DEVEREUX b: ABT 1438 in Eardisley, Herefordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 WATKIN (WATCYN) VAUGHAN b: ABT 1440 in Hergest, Kington, Herefordshire, England Married: 1483 in England Children Has No Children Anne VAUGHAN b: AFT 1483 Has No Children Elizabeth VAUGHAN b: AFT 1483 Has Children James
2 CONC  VAUGHAN b: AFT 1483 Has Children KATHERINE VAUGHAN b: AFT 1483 Has Children Oliver VAUGHAN b: AFT 1483 Has Children Roger VAUGHAN b: AFT 1483 Has No Children Thomas VAUGHAN b: AFT 1483 Has No Children Walter VAUGHAN b: AFT 1483 H
2 CONC as Children SYBIL VAUGHAN b: ABT 1494 in Hergest, Kington, Herefordshire, England
2 CONT --------------------
