2 CONT *Description:	
2 CONT *Short title: Grosse v Megges.
2 CONT *Plaintiffs: Robert Grosse of Muckleford, Dorset, yeoman.
2 CONT *Defendants: '''Nicholas Megges and his wife Jane.
2 CONT *Subject of decree: Copyhold lands held of the manor of Bradford Peverell, and common of pasture, in Muckleford, Dorset.
2 CONT *Date of decree: 22 November 4 Eliz.
2 CONT *Date:	1561 Nov 22
2 CONT *Held by:	The National Archives, Kew
