2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Elizabeth BROMWICH
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: Elizabeth MERBURY ABT 1425/1432, Herefordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Richard DEVEREUX
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Catherine DEVEREUX
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Isabel DEVEREUX (b. 1440)
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Anne DEVEREUX (C. Pembroke)
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Thomas DEVEREUX (b. 1442)
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Walter DEVEREUX (1º B. Ferrers of Chartley)
