2 CONT +++++++++++++==Elizabeth Merbury==
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Merbury (c. 1412) was an English noblewoman.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth was the daughter''' of Sir John Merbury, by his first wife, Alice Pembridge. '''She was married to Walter Devereux (1411–1459) about 1432 in Herefordshire, England. Together, they had several children:[1]
2 CONT *Anne Devereux
2 CONT *Richard Devereux (c. 1426, Chartley, Herefordshire, England)
2 CONT *Thomas Devereux (c. 1428, Chartley, Herefordshire, England)
2 CONT *Walter Devereux, 7th Baron Ferrers of Chartley
2 CONT *John Devereux (c. 1434, Weobley, England)
2 CONT *Katherine (Sibyl) Devereux (c. 1438). Married firstly James Baskerville about 1464
2 CONT *Isabel Devereux (c. 1440, Weobley, England)
2 CONT
2 CONT From: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elizabeth_Merbury
2 CONT
2 CONT _________________
2 CONT *'''Elizabeth Merbury1,2,3,4,5,6
2 CONT *'''F, #19349, b. circa 1412, d. before 1459
2 CONT *Father	John Merbury, Esq., Justice of South Wales, Sheriff & Escheater of Herefordshire, Steward of Brecon2,4,5,6 b. c 1387, d. 29 Jan 1438
2 CONT *Mother	Alice Pembrugge2,3,6 b. 1372, d. 1415
2 CONT *'''     Elizabeth Merbury was born circa 1412 at of Lyonshall & Weobley, Herefordshire, England; Age 26 in 1438.2,3 She married Sir Walter Devereux, Sheriff of Herefordshire & Gloucestershire, Constable of Wigmore, Keeper of Leom
2 CONC inster''', son of Walter Devereux, Esq. and Elizabeth Bromwich, '''circa 1432; They had 2 sons''' (Sir Walter, Lord Ferrers of Chartley; & Sir John) '''and 1 daughter''' (Anne, wife of Sir William Herbert, 1st Earl of Pembroke, 1s
2 CONC t Lord Herbert).2,3,4,5,6 '''Elizabeth Merbury died before 1459.
2 CONT *'''Family     Sir Walter Devereux, Sheriff of Herefordshire & Gloucestershire, Constable of Wigmore, Keeper of Leominster''' b. c 1412, d. 22 Apr 1459
2 CONT *'''Children	
2 CONT **Sir John Devereux, Sheriff of Herefordshire d. a 1489
2 CONT **Sir Walter Devereux, Lord Ferrers+7,3,4,5,6 b. c 1432, d. 22 Aug 1485
2 CONT **Anne Devereux+8,3,9,10,6 b. c 1433, d. a 25 Jun 1486
2 CONT **Isabel Devereux b. c 1437
2 CONT **Sybil Devereux+ b. c 1440, d. b 1499
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *[S5979] Unknown author, Lineage and Ancestry of HRH Prince Charles by Paget, Vol. II, p. 440; Plantagenet Ancestry of 17th Century Colonists, by David Faris, p. 103; Wallop Family, p. 57.
2 CONT *[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 250.
2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 3.
2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 163-164.
2 CONT *[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. II, p. 575-576.
2 CONT *[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. V, p. 249.
2 CONT *[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 310.
2 CONT *[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 395.
2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 388.
2 CONT *[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. III, p. 278.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p644.htm#i19349 _______________
2 CONT *'''Elizabeth Merbury1
2 CONT *F, #438000
2 CONT *Last Edited=22 Aug 2013
2 CONT *'''     Elizabeth Merbury is the daughter''' of Sir John Merbury.1 '''She married Sir Walter Devereux''', son of Sir Walter Devereux and Maud Bromwich.1
2 CONT  *'''     Her married name became Devereux.
2 CONT *'''Children of Elizabeth Merbury and Sir Walter Devereux
2 CONT **Anne Devereux+2
2 CONT **Sir Walter Devereux, 1st Lord Ferrers (of Chartley)+3 b. c 1432, d. 22 Aug 1485
2 CONT *Citations
