2 CONT *'''Anne Devereux1
2 CONT *F, #158297
2 CONT *Last Edited=22 Aug 2013
2 CONT *'''     Anne Devereux is the daughter of Sir Walter Devereux and Elizabeth Merbury.2 She married William Herbert, 1st Earl of Pembroke, son of Sir William ap Thomas and Gladys Gam.
2 CONT *'''      Her married name became Herbert.
2 CONT *'''Children of Anne Devereux and William Herbert, 1st Earl of Pembroke
2 CONT ** 1.Lady Catherine Herbert+3 d. b 8 May 1504
2 CONT ** 2.Lady Maud Herbert+1 b. 1448, d. a 1485
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S125] Richard Glanville-Brown, online <e-mail address>, Richard Glanville-Brown (RR 2, Milton, Ontario, Canada), downloaded 17 August 2005.
2 CONT * 2.[S1916] Tim Boyle, "re: Boyle Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 16 September 2006. Hereinafter cited as "re: Boyle Family."
2 CONT * 3.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Exti
2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume VII, page 167. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p15830.htm#i158297
