2 CONT *''''''     Sir John Baskerville was born on 12 February 1403 at Eardisley, Herefordshire, England. He married Cicily Devereux, daughter of Walter Devereux, Esq. and Maud Bromwich, circa 1433.2 Sir John Baskerville married Elizabe
2 CONC th Touchet, daughter of Sir John Touchet, 4th Lord Audley, Keeper of Llandovery & Brecknock Castles and Elizabeth Stafford, circa 1435.2,3 Sir John Baskerville died on 23 December 1455 at age 52.
