1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Admitted to the Middle Temple. Became High Sheriff of Dorset in 1606 and had knighthood conferred upon him at Whitehall on February 8, 1606. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John Ryves married 1st, Ann Napper, daughter of Sir Robert Napper of Middlemarch, co. Dorset, but he had no issue by her. He married 2nd, 13 May 1617, Dorothy Hastings, daughter of the Earl of Huntingdon, and died 3 January 16
2 CONC 25 without issue. 
2 CONT Lady Dorothy remarried after the death of Sir John Ryves, THOMAS TREGONWELL, ESQ.
