2 CONT *[jrlovett.ged]
2 CONT *'''!Will dated 7 Aug 1579
2 CONT *'''Nicholas Meggs or Megges was 70 in 1579.
2 CONT *Most pedigrees say that PEVEREL was the oldest son of Lawrence, but '''Nicholas names his grandchildren twice in his will, always in this order:''' (girls 1st) Jane, AGNES (my ancestor), Percivall, Peverell, Andrew, Hugh and Chri
2 CONC stopher.
2 CONT *Names "Lawrence Megges my sonne." He continues: "unto my son''' Lawrence Meggs whom I make and ordaine my executor. But if it happen Lawrence my son to dye; then I will that Percivall Meggs be my executor."
2 CONT *!Par reg of Winterbourne Steepleton show it was Percivall Megges who md Mary Lawrence contrary to most pedigrees. 1623 Visit. of Dorset shows this to be true.
2 CONT *Peverel pedigree in "The Parish Registers of Bradford Peverel, Co. Dorset" by Rev. Richard Grosvenor Bartelot F.S.A. page 58 (FHL 942.3 3 v26 br)
2 CONT *Meggs pedigree in Hutchins "History of Dorset" by Hutchins vol. II page 535
2 CONT *'''Will of Nicholas Meggs from P.C.C. for 1579 folio 46 Bako n dated 7 Aug 1579 (FHL 091958)
2 CONT *Will of Lawrence Meggs from P.C.C. for 1598 folio 75 Lewy n dated 10 Oct 1598 pr. 25 Oct 1598 (FHL 092003)
2 CONT *Parish registers of Winterbourne Steepleton rec'd by corres. with Dorset
2 CONT *County Record Office 15 April 1988
2 CONT *Wife's General Notes
2 CONT *[jrlovett.ged]
2 CONT *'''Jane Peverel''' was age 4 in 1524.
2 CONT *General Notes for Child Lawrence Meggs
2 CONT *[jrlovett.ged]
2 CONT *!Lawrence Meggs or Megges
2 CONT *!Will dated 10 Oct 1598
2 CONT *!End. Ref. # is F509405
2 CONT *Will of Lawrence Meggs mentions his Uncle Henry Meggs & hi s son Percival who have mistreated him. P. 51 of book by Bartelot tells of Lawrence Meggs suing Henry & Percival Meggs for trying to restrain him as a lunatic. This was 6
2 CONC  Nov 1592. Peverel & Hugh Meggs sons of the plaintiff were among those mentioned.
2 CONT *'''Nicholas Meggs named all the children of his son''' Lawrence in his will : Jane & Agnes first, then Percival, Peverel, Andrew, Hugh & Christopher. 
2 CONT *Note that Percival was named BEFORE Peverel: most pedigrees say Peverel was the eldest and was the son who married May Lawrence. The marriage at Winterbourne
2 CONT *Steepleton says PERCIVAL married Mary Lawrence.
2 CONT *Meggs pedigree in Hutchins; "History of Dorset" vol. II pag e 535 (FHL 908407)
2 CONT *"The Parish Registers of Bradford Peverel, Co. Dorset" by Rev. Richard Grosvenor Bartelot F.S.A. pages 33 & 58a (FHL 942.33 v26 br)
2 CONT *!Parish registers of Winterbourne Steepleton by corres. with Dorset County
2 CONT *Record Office rec'd 15 Apr 1988
2 CONT *!Will of Lawrence Meggs from P.C.C. for 1598 folio 75 Lewy n dated 10 Oct 1598 (FHL 092003)
