2 CONT b. c.1617, 1st s. of Robert Perrott of Moreton-on-Lugg, Herefs. by Fortuna, da. of Richard Tomkyns of Monnington-on-Wye, Herels., wid. of Walter Pembridge of Mansell Gamage, Herefs. educ. Brasenose, Oxf. matric. 21 Feb. 1634, aged
2 CONC  16; G. Inn 1635-at least 1639, called 1651. m. (1) bef. 5 Sept. 1643, Jane (d. 9 Jan. 1667), da. and coh. of Thomas Lloyd of Cilciffeth, Pemb., 3s. d.v.p.; (2) Hester, da. of George Barlow of Slibech, Pemb., 1da.; (3) 1668, Susan
2 CONC na, da. of Sir Francis Norreys of Weston on the Green, Oxon., s.p. suc. to Pemb. estate of Sir James Perrott† 1637, fa. 1657; kntd. 14 Aug. 1660.1
