1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Walter Devereux, Esq.1,2,3
2 CONT *''''''M, #23240, b. circa 1387, d. 1420
2 CONT *Father      Sir Walter Devereux, Sheriff of Herefordshire, Constable of Builth Castle2,4 b. c 1359, d. 20 Jun 1401
2 CONT *Mother      Agnes Crophull2,4 b. c 1372, d. 3 Feb 1436
2 CONT *''''''     Walter Devereux, Esq. was born circa 1387 at of Weobley & Bodenham, Herefordshire, England.2 He married Elizabeth Bromwich, daughter of Sir Thomas Bromwich and Alice Oldcastle, circa 1410 at of Weobley & Bodenham, Here
2 CONC fordshire, England; They had 1 son, Sir Walter.3 Walter Devereux, Esq. died in 1420 at of Newbold Verdon, Leicestershire, England.2,3
2 CONT *''''''Family       Eliabeth Bromwich b. c 1391
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Sir Walter Devereux, Sheriff of Herefordshire & Gloucestershire, Constable of Wigmore, Keeper of Leominster+5,3 b. c 1412, d. 22 Apr 1459
2 CONT **Cicily Devereux+ b. c 1415, d. c 1434
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S7299] Unknown author, The Royal Descents of 500 Immigrants, by Gary Boyd Roberts, p. 303; Wallop Family, p. 272.
2 CONT * 2.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 249.
2 CONT * 3.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 3.
2 CONT * 4.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 2.
2 CONT * 5.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 249-250.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p774.htm#i23240
2 CONT *_______________
2 CONT *''''''Sir Walter Devereux1
2 CONT *''''''M, #437996, b. 1387, d. 1420
2 CONT *Last Edited=17 Jul 2010
2 CONT *''''''     Sir Walter Devereux was born in 1387.1 He was the son of Sir Walter Devereux and Agnes Crophill.2 He married Elizabeth Bromwich, daughter of Sir Thomas Bromwich.1 He died in 1420.1
2 CONT *''''''Children of Sir Walter Devereux and Elizabeth Bromwich
2 CONT ** 1.Elizabeth Devereux1
2 CONT ** 2.Sir Walter Devereux+2 b. 1411, d. fr 22 Apr 1459 - 23 Apr 1459
2 CONT *Citations
