1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth (Maud) Bromwich is the daughter of Sir Thomas Bromwich. (She was called Maud in Burke's Peerage.) She married Sir Walter Devereux (II), son of Sir Walter Devereux and Agnes Crophill.
2 CONT
2 CONT *''''''Maud Bromwich1,2,3 
2 CONT *''''''F, #23241, b. circa 1391
2 CONT *Father      Sir Thomas Bromwich2,3 b. c 1361
2 CONT *Mother      Alice Oldcastle b. c 1368
2 CONT *''''''     Maud Bromwich was born circa 1391. She married Walter Devereux, Esq., son of Sir Walter Devereux, Sheriff of Herefordshire, Constable of Builth Castle and Agnes Crophull, circa 1410 at of Weobley & Bodenham, Herefordsh
2 CONC ire, England; They had 1 son, Sir Walter.3
2 CONT *''''''Family      Walter Devereux, Esq. b. c 1387, d. 1420
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Sir Walter Devereux, Sheriff of Herefordshire & Gloucestershire, Constable of Wigmore, Keeper of Leominster+4,3 b. c 1412, d. 22 Apr 1459
2 CONT **Cicily Devereux+ b. c 1415, d. c 1434
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S7300] Unknown author, Some Early English Pedigrees, by Vernon M. Norr, p. 65; The Lineage and Ancestry of HRH Prince Charles, by Gerald Paget, Vol. II, p. 442; Wallop Family, p. 272.
2 CONT * 2.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 249.
2 CONT * 3.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 3.
2 CONT * 4.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 249-250.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p774.htm#i23241
2 CONT *____________________
2 CONT *''''''Maud Bromwich1 
2 CONT *F, #437998
2 CONT *Last Edited=17 Jul 2010
2 CONT *''''''     Maud Bromwich is the daughter of Sir Thomas Bromwich.2 She married Sir Walter Devereux, son of Sir Walter Devereux and Agnes Crophill.1
2 CONT *''''''      Her married name became Devereux.
2 CONT *''''''Children of Maud Bromwich and Sir Walter Devereux
2 CONT ** 1.Elizabeth Devereux1
2 CONT ** 2.Sir Walter Devereux+2 b. 1411, d. fr 22 Apr 1459 - 23 Apr 1459
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 2, page 1875. Hereinafter cited as Burke's 
2 CONC Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT * 2.[S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p43800.htm#i437998
2 CONT *_____________
2 CONT *''''''Walter DEVEREUX
2 CONT *Born: 1387
2 CONT *Died: 1420
2 CONT *Father: Walter DEVEREUX
2 CONT *Mother: Agnes CROPHULL
2 CONT *''''''Married: Elizabeth BROMWICH ABT 1409, Herefordshire, England
2 CONT *Children:
