2 CONT * Born in 1391 - Salisbury, Wiltshire, England
2 CONT * Deceased in 1423 - Bodenham, Herefordshire, England, aged 32 years old
2 CONT
2 CONT * ''''''Parents'''''' ''''''Thomas (SIR) Bromwich'''''', born in 1361 - Salisbury, Wiltshire, England, Deceased in 1394 - Salisbury, Wiltshire, England aged 33 years old Married in 1385, Salisbury, Wiltshire, England, to ''''''Cat
2 CONC herine Lady of Abergavenny, Monmouthshire, Wales Oldcastle'''''', born in 1362 - Abergavenny, Monmouthshire, Wales, Deceased in 1391 aged 29 years old
2 CONT
2 CONT * Spouses, children, grandchildren and great-grandchildren Married in 1418, Herefordshire, England, to 
2 CONT * Husband Walter (SIR) D'EVEREUX, born in 1387 - Bodenham, Herefordshire, England, Deceased in 1435 aged 48 years old (Parents : M Walter D'EVEREUX 1357-1403 &  F Agnes CROPHULL 1366-1436) With
2 CONT * Child  Elizabeth D'EVEREUX 1419-1475  married about 1432, Hereford, Herefordshire, England, to John (SIR ) MILBOURNE ca 1400-1435
