2 CONT *'''     John Merbury, Esq., Justice of South Wales, Sheriff & Escheater of Herefordshire, Steward of Brecon was born circa 1387 at of Lyonshall, Herefordshire, England.2 He married Alice Pembrugge, daughter of Sir John Pembrugge 
2 CONC and Sibel Essath, in 1400.11,3,9 John Merbury, Esq., Justice of South Wales, Sheriff & Escheater of Herefordshire, Steward of Brecon married Agnes Crophull, daughter of Sir Thomas de Crophull and Sibilla de la Bere, before March 1
2 CONC 417; No issue.12,13,4,6,8,10 John Merbury, Esq., Justice of South Wales, Sheriff & Escheater of Herefordshire, Steward of Brecon died on 29 January 1438 at of Lyonshall & Weobley, Herefordshire, England.12,13,4,6,8,10
