2 CONC rgaret, wife of Richard Clyve; Mary, wife of Sir Thomas Lacon; Anne, wife of Sir Thomas Cornwall; & Elizabeth, wife of Thomas Trentham, Esq.).2,7,3,4,5 Elizabeth Devereux married Sir Thomas Leighton, Sheriff of Shropshire, son of 
2 CONC John Leighton, Esq., Sheriff & Escheater of Shropshire, Steward of Bishop's Castle, Constable of Oswestry Castle and Ankaret Burgh, in 1494.10,7,4,5,6 Elizabeth Devereux died in 1516 at of Wattlesborough, Shropshire, England; Buri
2 CONC ed in the church of Burford, Shropshire.7,4,5
