1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Devereux, 8th Baron Ferrers of Chartley
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT John Devereux, 8th Baron Ferrers of Chartley (1463 - 3 May 1501) was an English Peer.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the eldest son and heir of Anne Ferrers, 7th Baroness Ferrers of Chartley by her husband and consort Walter Devereux, Lord Ferrers of Chartley.
2 CONT
2 CONT His mother died of natural causes in 1468 but his father remained the jure uxoris Baron for the remainder of his life. His father died in the Battle of Bosworth Field (22 August 1485). He was fighting for Richard III of England un
2 CONC der John Howard, 1st Duke of Norfolk.
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard III was killed in the battle and his opponent succeeded him as Henry VII of England. However John was allowed to succeed to the titles and estates of his father. He would remain loyal to the Henry VII for the rest of his l
2 CONC ife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT He was first married to Cecily Bourchier. She was a daughter of William Bourchier, Viscount Bourchier and Anne Woodville.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Bourchier was a son of Henry Bourchier, 1st Earl of Essex and Isabel Plantagenet. Anne Woodville was a daughter of Richard Woodville, 1st Earl Rivers and Jacquetta of Luxembourg.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Baron and his first wife would have two children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford (1488 – 17 September 1558).
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann Devereux (born c. 1490). Married first Henry Clifford and secondly David Owen. She was mother of Walter Clifford, Nicholas Clifford, Joan Clifford, Dorothea Clifford, Lettice Clifford, Henry Owen, John Owen and Elizabeth Owen.
2 CONT
2 CONT His first wife died in 1493. He married secondly Elizabeth Langham. They reportedly had two sons.
2 CONT
2 CONT External links
2 CONT
2 CONT A genealogical profile of him
2 CONT
2 CONT A listing of the Devereux family
2 CONT
2 CONT A listing of descedants for his daughter
2 CONT *______________________
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Sir John "8th Baron Ferrers Chartley" Devereux Born 1463 in Chartley, Herefordshire, England.map ANCESTORS Son of Walter Devereux IV and Anne (Ferrers) Devereux Brother of Elizabeth (Devereux) Leighton, Catherine Devereux, Thomas 
2 CONC Devereux, Sybil Devereux and	Katherine Devereux Husband of Cecily (Bourchier) Devereux - married 1477 in Chartley, Staffordshire, Englandmap DESCENDANTS Father of Walter Hereford (Devereaux) Devereux KG and Anne (Devereux) Owen Di
2 CONC ed 7 May 1501 in Chartley Hall, Staffordshire, England
