1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Primary Sources
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000033963823442& Inquisitions Post Mortem] for John Tuchet, Knight. His various IPMs give three different death dates, 19, 20 and 27 Dec. 1408. James his son and heir was aged 10 yea
