2 CONC ley and Margery de Grey, before 1398; They had 1 son (Sir John, 5th Lord Audley) and 2 daughters (Margaret, wife of Sir John Luttrell, & of Robert Coker, Esq; & Elizabeth, wife of Sir John Baskerville).2,3,4,5,6 Elizabeth Stafford
