1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Richard Rowdon, Esq., Alderman of Gloucester1,2
2 CONT *''''''M, #143611, b. circa 1465
2 CONT *''''''     Richard Rowdon, Esq., Alderman of Gloucester was born circa 1465 at of Rowdon, Herefordshire, England.1,2
