1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==concerns==
2 CONT '''Date and place of birth have been reported to be the following.  It is unclear which (if any) are correct.  Further research is warranted:
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''1428 at Fountaine (should be Fonthill Giffard?), Wiltshire, England <attestation unknown>
2 CONT * '''circa 1445 at Fountel Giffart (should be Fonthill Giffard?), Wiltshire, England <attestation unknown>
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Surname has also been reported to be '''[https://www.geni.com/surnames/marvin Marvin]'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been (erroneously?) reported to be 1465 at an unspecified location <attestation unknown>.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==sources==
2 CONT * ''The visitation of Wiltshire 1565'' Author Harvey, William, fl. 1565,Marshall, George W. (George William), 1839-1905.  [https://archive.org/details/visitationofwilt00harvrich/page/14 Pages 14-15].
2 CONT * ''Fasciculus Mervinensis, notes historical, genealogical, and heraldic of the ...'' by William Richard Drake (sir.)
2 CONT ** https://books.google.com/books?id=PZUNAAAAQAAJ&pg=PA9&lpg=PA9&dq=jane+baskerville+1565&source=bl&ots=985ii3CRh0&sig=yi8UDInrG8FVRdygRV6tfP-tHvI&hl=en&sa=X&ei=zGNvVfa9IMvWoAT6xYDwBQ&ved=0CCsQ6AEwAw#v=onepage&q=jane%20baskerville
2 CONC %201565&f=false
2 CONT ** https://archive.org/stream/fasciculusmervi00sirgoog#page/n18/mode/1up
2 CONT
