2 CONT Lady Edith Latimer Mordaunt BIRTH	unknown DEATH	1 Sep 1504 BURIAL	 All Saints Churchyard Turvey, Bedford Borough, Bedfordshire, England  MEMORIAL ID	59547913
2 CONT
2 CONT Edith was a coheir of Sir Nicholas Latymer of Duntish in Dorset. She was the widow of John Greene of Stotfold. She gave birth to at least two sons and a daughter.
2 CONT
