1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Margery or Margaret Towse or Toose 
2 CONT * Born: ABT 1496         at: of Poundisford,Somerset,Eng   
2 CONT * Died: 14 FEB 1550      at:   
2 CONT * Burial: [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GScid=2244840&GRid=77079597& Taunton, St Mary's Cemetery Taunton Taunton Deane Borough Somerset, England]
2 CONT * Daughter of John Toose and Joan Toose (Combes)
2 CONT * Wife of Roger Hill, of Taunton
2 CONT
2 CONT ===biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Hill-2291
2 CONT
2 CONT the family estate at Poundisford was inherited by Robert Hill, Roger's first-born by his 2nd wife, Margery Toose, younger sister of Alice (Toose) Hill, who must have died between 1518 and 1522.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1523, Roger Hill married Margery Toose. They had 5 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Robert Hill b: 1525 in Somerset, England
2 CONT * William Hill, b: 1527 in Poundisford, Somerset, England
2 CONT * Edward Hill b: 1528 in England
2 CONT * Margaret Hill b: 1530 in Shepton Mallet, Somerset, England
2 CONT * Alice Hill b: 1531 in Poundisford, Somerset, England
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Family Members'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Father''' John Toose 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mother''' Joan Toose
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse''' Roger Hill, of Taunton
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Robert Hill, MP, of Taunton and Bagborough
2 CONT
2 CONT * Alice Hill; William Hill
2 CONT
2 CONT * Mary Hill
