1 NOTE  The Toose family is revealed in The Visitation of Somerset (visSom,page 111), which shows Alexander Toose and his unnamed first wife(uxor prima) as parents of Johannes (John) Toose. Alexander latermarried the widow of John Combes
2 CONC  (relicta Johannis Combes), who was the mother by her prior husband (John Combes) of Johanna (Joan)Combes. John Toose of Taunton subsequently married Joan Combes, his stepsister, and they were the parents of Margeria (Margery) Too
2 CONC se, who married Roger Hill. (Why this pedigree is in latin is not explained.)
