2 CONT 3. WILLIAM**(-2)3 HILL (ROGER**(-32 )HILL, WILLIAM**(-4)1 HILL) was born 1515 in OF, POUNDSFORD, S, ENGLAND (OR BORN-1525), and died June 06, 1592 in POUNDSFORD, OF PITMINSTER, ENGLAND (OR DIED-1594). He married (1) ANNE TROWBRIDG
2 CONC E 1540 in PITMINSTER, ENGLAND. She was born Abt. 1520 in OF COLYTON, DEVONSHIRE, ENGLAND, and died 1560 in PITMINSTER, ENGLAND. He married (2) LUCY RYVES Abt. 1563 in OF, POUNDSFORD, SOMMERSET, ENGLAND, daughter of JOHN RYVES and 
2 CONC ANN HARVEY. She was born 1530 in OF, POUNDSFORD, SOMMERSET, ENGLAND.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About WILLIAM**(-2) HILL:
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: GRANTED COAT OF ARMS IN 1570
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of WILLIAM**(-2) HILL and ANNE TROWBRIDGE are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. ROGER4 HILL, b. Abt. 1542, PITMINSTER, ENGLAND; ELDEST SON INHERITED POUNDSFORD; d. 1609, POUNDSFORD, OF PITMINSTER, ENGLAND; m. MARY (?) HILL.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. ALEXANDER HILL, b. Abt. 1544, PITMINSTER, ENGLAND; 2ND SON; m. ALICE HANSARD; b. OF LYME REGIS.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About ALEXANDER HILL:
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Resided in Taunton, England
2 CONT
2 CONT More About ALICE HANSARD:
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: HAD CHILDREN
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. ELIZABETH HILL, b. Abt. 1546, PITMINSTER, ENGLAND; d. d.s.p.; m. <nowiki>----</nowiki> HOBBS.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About ELIZABETH HILL:
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: MARR#2- --- MURIFEY; MARR#3 <nowiki>----</nowiki> MARTIN
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. WILLIAM HILL, b. Abt. 1548, PITMINSTER, ENGLAND; d. d.s.p..
2 CONT
2 CONT v. ROBERT HILL, b. Abt. 1550, PITMINSTER, ENGLAND; d. d.s.p..
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. HENRY HILL, b. Abt. 1552, PITMINSTER, ENGLAND; d. d.s.p..
2 CONT
2 CONT vii. AMBROSE HILL, b. Abt. 1554, PITMINSTER, ENGLAND; d. d.s.p..
2 CONT
2 CONT viii. GABRIEL HILL, b. Abt. 1556, PITMINSTER, ENGLAND; d. LIVING 1592; d.s.p..
2 CONT
2 CONT ix. SUSAN HILL, b. Abt. 1558, PITMINSTER, ENGLAND; d. d. s. p..
2 CONT
2 CONT x. ELEANOR HILL, b. Abt. 1560, PITMINSTER, ENGLAND; d. ALIVE 1592; m. <nowiki>----</nowiki> GRAVITT, Aft. 1592.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of WILLIAM**(-2) HILL and LUCY RYVES are:
2 CONT
2 CONT xi. LUCY (-1)4 HILLS, b. 1565, POUNDISFORD, SOMERSET, ENGLAND; m. LAWRENCE WILLIAMS, Abt. 1585, POUNDISFORD, SOMMERSET, ENGLAND.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. xii. BENJAMIN (-1) HILLS, b. Abt. 1563, POUNDISFORD, SOMERSET, ENGLAND; d. Bef. February 27, 1656/57, LIVING UNMARRIED IN 1656.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. xiii. THOMAS**(-1) HILLS, b. Abt. 1568, OF, UPMINSTER, E, ENGLAND; d. 1629, Resided in CHARD, ENGLAND.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. xiv. JOHN (-1) HILL, b. Abt. 1571, POUNDISFORD, SOMERSET, ENGLAND; d. Bef. 1629, ENGLAND; ALIVE 1592.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Hill - Lucy Ryves
2 CONT
2 CONT William Hill was born at of Poundesford, Sommerset, England 1523. His parents were Roger Hill and Margery .
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Lucy Ryves at England . Lucy Ryves was born at of Poundesford, Sommerset, England Abt 1530 daughter of John Ryves and Fem. Ryves .
2 CONT
2 CONT They were the parents of 1 child: John Hill born Abt 1571.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Hill died 6 Jun 1592 at England
