1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT A son of Sir Roger Hill of Taunton, Somerset, he apparently moved to Worcestershire after his brother,  John Hill, married Lady Joane Hadleyof Wolverley, Worcestershire.  Edward Hill married Alice Hansard of Somerset around 1555 a
2 CONC nd their daughter "Lady" Judith Hill was born in 1556.  No death record  or will  has been found but his death is estimated at around 1600.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
