2 CONT * 4. SP12/179/58; HMC Rutland, 163, 183; HMC Hatfield, xiii. 343; Lansd. 104, f. 51 seq.; 134, f. 196; APC, xiv. 239.
2 CONT * 5.CSP Span. 1580-6, pp. 601-4; CSP Dom. 1598-1601, p. 181; 1591-4, pp. 209, 246; 1611-18, p. 254; 1625-6, pp. 342, 394; Reynold, Ancient Diocese of Exeter, 233; G. Oliver, Coll. Illus. Catholic Rel. in South West, 18; Devon RO, 
2 CONC Tingey 1614; E. W. Cleaveland, Hist. Courtenay Fam. 301.
