1 NOTE {geni:about_me} George Tuchet, 1st Earl of Castlehaven From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Arms of Tuchet: Ermine, a chevron gules George Tuchet, 1st Earl of Castlehaven (c. 1551 – 1617),was the son of Henry Tuchet, 10th Baron Audley (died 1563) and his wife, née Elizabeth Sneyd.
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded his father as 11th Baron Audley and 8th Baron Tuchet on 30 December 1563, and served in the Parliament of England from 30 September 1566 to 5 April 1614. He was a Fellow of Magdalen College, Oxford. He was Governor of
2 CONC  Utrecht in the Netherlands, and Governor of Kells, County Meath, Ireland. He was wounded at the Battle of Kinsale, 24 December 1601. He resided primarily in Ireland and was summoned by writ to the Irish House of Lords 11 March 16
2 CONC 13/1614.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was created 1st Baron Audley of Orier (County Armagh) and 1st Earl of Castlehaven (County Cork) on 6 September 1616 in the Peerage of Ireland.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the late 1570s or early 1580s he married Lucy Mervyn, who died on 20 February 1616, only child of Sir James Mervyn and of his wife Amy Clark.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had seven children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor Tuchet (1590–1652), who married 1st: Sir John Davies,[2] attorney of the king. 2nd: Sir Archibald Douglas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mervyn (1593–1631)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Ferdinando Tuchet K.B., who married widow of Sir John Rodney.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Tuchet, who married Edward Blount Esq.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Tuchet, who married 1st: Sir John Stawel. 2nd: Sir Thomas Griffin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Tuchet, who married Sir Thomas Thynne.
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian Tuchet, who married Sir Henry Mervyn.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 29 August 1611, at St. Mary-le-Strand, Middlesex, he married his second wife, Elizabeth Noel (d. 1644), the daughter of Sir Andrew Noel (d. 1607) and his wife, née Mabel Harington. The couple had no children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Comment :- Contradiction on this page Lucy Mervyn died 20 Feb 1616, he married his 2nd wife Elizabeth Noel on 29 August 1611 ?
2 CONT
2 CONT Added to Geni by Janet Milburn 4/27/18
2 CONT
2 CONT __________________________________________
