2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Dunch is the daughter of Walter Dunch and Deborah Pilkington.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Sir William Button, 1st Bt., son of William Button and Jane Lamb.[1] Her married name became Button.[1]
2 CONT
