2 CONT
2 CONT Dorset. In addition to the lands in Dorsetshire he held lands in North Cheriton and Pointington, Co. Somerset.
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert died in 1551 and was buried in the old church of St. Peter and St. Paul in Blandford Forum, which was destroied by fire in 1731.
