1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born in 1544 adn died in 1576. Buried at Ewerne Courtney on 27 July. It appears that he may have been sick for quite some time before he died. He left a wife Margaret Gillot and a son, John, who was 11 at the time 
2 CONC of his father's death.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret (daughter of William Gillot (Gillette), of the Isle of Purbeck. She remarried after the death of Robert to another man named Robert Swayne. By him, she had four more sons: John, Robert, Richard, Matthew, Elizabeth (marrie
2 CONC d George Mervyn) and Margaret (married Richard Galston).
