2 CONC John Hawley." https://books.google.com/books?id=GmqlIibS95IC&pg=PA224.
2 CONT * [^2]: William Harvey, The Visitation of Dorsetshire, A.D. 1565, ed. Walter C. Metcalfe (Exeter: William Pollard & Co., 1887), 31. This source confirms the descent from John of Exeter to his daughter Ann/Agnes. https://archive.or
2 CONC g/stream/visitationofdors00harvuoft#page/31/mode/1up.
2 CONT * [^3]: "Ann Coplestone," Geni.com, accessed March 9, 2026. Note: While the site lists a 1510 birth for Ann, the biological dates of the parents (b. 1422/1425) and her status as heir of John of Exeter require a revised estimate of
2 CONC  c. 1485. https://www.geni.com/people/Ann-Coplestone/6000000006444594817.
2 CONT
