2 CONT * [^2]: John Lambrick Vivian, The Visitations of the County of Devon: Comprising the Herald's Visitations of 1531, 1564, & 1620 (Exeter: H.S. Eland, 1895), 224. https://books.google.com/books?id=GmqlIibS95IC&pg=PA224
2 CONT * [^3]: "Thomas Meggs Family History Records," Ancestry Community Trees, accessed March 9, 2026. "Death: 22 JUL 1559 Ancient Manor, Holway, Dorset, England." https://www.ancestry.com/genealogy/records/thomas-meggs-24-4st48h
2 CONT * [^4]: "John Coplestone, of Exeter," Geni.com, accessed March 9, 2026. https://www.geni.com/people/John-Coplestone-III/6000000006110677998
2 CONT
