1 NOTE There was also a Mary Cruwys married to William Churchill of Muston, Dorset in the mid 1500�s who were ancestors of John Churchill (the Duke of Marlborough) and Sir Winston Churchill of WWII fame. If William and Mary are the same 
2 CONC couple in both lineages, then they represent the connection between my line and Sir Winston�s line. It seem to be too much of a coincidence that there would be two different couples of so similar names in the same town at about th
