2 ADDR
3 CITY Burghill
3 CTRY England
1 TITL Sir
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Milbourne was the son of Piers (or Peter) Milbourne and Elizabeth Eylesford. He was born c.1404 in Tillington, Herefordshire, England and died in either 1435. He married (1) Agnes Aubrey and (2) Elizabeth Deve
2 CONC reaux.
2 CONT
2 CONT A verse about John Milbourne's burial:
2 CONT
2 CONT John Milbourne, who was Peter's heir, / A Squire was he, and lyeth here. / And eke his wife, Lord Devereux daughter / Who here was buried forty years later.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources disagree on vital points in John Milbourne's life. Either he died in Austria-Hungary in 1435 (possible - the last crusade in that area ended in 1437) or he died in Herefordshire, England in 1435. In either case, he was bur
2 CONC ied in Herefordshire, as shown in the verse above. Either he had one child (Simon) with Elizabeth Deveraux or he had three (William, Simon and Jane). Certainly the third child, Jane, has a suspect date of birth of 1438.  Jane is d
2 CONC ocumented through the History of Parliament as his daughter, so we know there were at least two children. NOTE: The History of Parliament says Jane is the daughter of John Milbourne of London. Our John Milbourne is not "of London"
2 CONC  but he died 3 years after Jane was born. John's wife died in 1475, so that means he died in 1435 (40 years earlier). I believe The Peerage lists children by order of inheritance, not order of birth.
2 CONT
2 CONT See also:
2 CONT * http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/MILBOURNE.htm#John MILBOURNE (Esq.)1
2 CONT * http://www.branches-n-twigs.com/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I18392&tree=allfam#cite3
2 CONT * http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1509-1558/member/englefield-sir-thomas-1455-1514
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Agnes ( Eleanor) MILBOURNEPrint Family Tree
2 CONT * Born in 1428 - Herefordshire, England
2 CONT * Deceased - England
2 CONT
2 CONT * ''''''Parents''''''
2 CONT * ''''''John (SIR ) MILBOURNE'''''', born about 1400 - Tillington, Herefordshire, England, Deceased 7 September 1435 - Burghill, Herefordshire, England aged about 35 years old , buried in 1435 - Burghill, Herefordshire, England Ma
2 CONC rried before 1426, England, to
2 CONT * ''''''Agnes AUBREY'''''', born about 1406 - England, Deceased before 1435 - Herefordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT * Spouses, children, grandchildren and great-grandchildren
2 CONT * Married to Thomas WALWYN, born after 1431 - Herefordshire, England, Deceased 23 November 1471 - Kent, England (Parents : M Thomas WALWYN 1405-1471 &  F Isabel BASKERVILLE /1394-1500) with
2 CONT * Children M John WALWYN 1462-  married in 1485, Herefordshire, England, to Gladys Verch (MORGAN) DAFYDD ca 1464-1516 with
2 CONT * M John Walwyn ca 1485-
2 CONT * M Thomas WALWYN ca 1486-1516 married to Eleanor (Verch John) VAUGHAN 1486-1529 
2 CONT
2 CONT Referennce
2 CONT
2 CONT https://gw.geneanet.org/belfast8?lang=en&p=agnes+eleanor&n=milbourne
2 CONT
2 CONT www.findagrave.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Sr John Milborne
2 CONT BIRTH 1400
2 CONT Herefordshire, England
2 CONT DEATH 7 Sep 1435 (aged 34–35)
2 CONT Burghill, Herefordshire Unitary Authority, Herefordshire, England
2 CONT BURIAL
2 CONT Church of St. Mary the Virgin
2 CONT Burghill, Herefordshire Unitary Authority, Herefordshire, England 
2 CONT MEMORIAL ID 105092688 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Milborne, Esq., of Tillington, Burghill and Munsley, Herefordshire, of Burghill and Bulley, Gloucestershire and of Holme Spinney in Beckingham, Lincolnshire. Son and heir to Peter de Milborne and Elizabeth Eylesford, daughter
2 CONC  of Sir John.
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Elizabeth Devereux, daughter of Sir Walter Devereux and Agnes Crophill, married before 1422. They had nine children.
2 CONT
