2 CONT ===Simon Milbourne, Esq.
2 CONT *Sheriff of Herefordshire1,2,3,4,5
2 CONT *M, b. circa 1435, d. 14 August 1522
2 CONT *Father John Milbourne, Esq.2,4 b. c 1404, d. 7 Sep 1435 
2 CONT *Mother Elizabeth Devereux2,4 b. c 1397, d. 1475 
2 CONT
