2 CONT *Children 
2 CONT **◦Sybil Milbourne+2 b. c 1468, d. 26 Nov 1537
2 CONT **◦Agnes Milbourne+2 b. c 1470, d. 1533
2 CONT **◦Elizabeth Milbourne+6,5 b. 1470, d. 1525
2 CONT **◦Alice Milbourne b. c 1472
