2 CONT Simon Milbourne, Esq., Sheriff of Herefordshire was born circa 1435 at of Tillington, Burghill, Almeley, Munsley, & Howton in Kenderchurch, Herefordshire, England.2 He married Jane Baskerville, daughter of Ralph Baskerville, Esq. 
2 CONC and Anne Blackett, circa 1460; They had 13 daughters (Sibyl, wife of Richard Hackluyt, Esq., & of Sir John Breynton; Elizabeth, wife of Sir Thomas Monington, & of John Whittington; Alice, wife of Henry Mill, & of Thomas Baskervill
2 CONC e, Esq; Blanche, wife of James Whitney, Esq., & of Sir William Herbert; Katherine, wife of Thomas Barton; Anne, wife of William Rudhall, Esq; Agnes, wife of Thomas Walwyn, Esq; Jane, wife of Sir Richard Cornwall; Joyce, wife of Th
2 CONC omas Hyett; Margaret, wife of Richard Bishop; Juliane; Eleanor, wife of John Moore, Esq; & Jane).4 Simon Milbourne, Esq., Sheriff of Herefordshire died on 14 August 1522 at of Icomb, Worcestershire, England.2,4
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
