1 NOTE {geni:about_me} It appears Sir Laurence was very involved in the fighting against the rebellion of Owain Glendywr in Wales with his brother John. Owain Glyn Dwr (anglicised as Owen Glendower) led a Welsh revolt against the English
2 CONC  crown between 1400 and 1409 and was the last to claim the title of independent prince of Wales.
