2 CONT *John Leighton of Streeton, later of Wattlesborough and Loton, Sheriff of Shropshire (d 1493)
2 CONT *   m. Ankeret Burgh (dau of Sir John Burgh of Wattlesborough)
2 CONT **     1. Sir Thomas Leighton of Wattlesborough or Watlesborough, Sheriff of Shropshire (b 1454)
2 CONT **     Visitation shows that Sir Thomas married twice. As Elizabeth Devereux was married before her marriage to Sir Thomas, we presume that she was his second wife so that his first marriage was to ...
2 CONT **       m1. Anna Baker (dau of Roger Baker of Salop)
