2 CONT **       m2. Elizabeth Devereux (dau of Sir Walter Devereux, Lord Ferrers of Chartley)
2 CONT ***'''          J. John Leighton of Wattlesborough or Watlesborough (d 1532)
2 CONT ***'''             m1. Matilda Harewell (dsp, dau of John Harewell) probably Matilda here
2 CONT ***'''             m2. Joyce Sutton (dau of Edward Sutton, 2nd Lord of Dudley)
2 CONT ****               i. Sir Edward Leighton of Wattlesborough, Sheriff of Shropshire then Montgomeryshire (d 1593) 
