2 CONC rince of Wales and Anne Talbot, circa 1497; They had 3 sons (Roger, Richard, & Reginald) and 4 daughters (Jane, Joan, Mary, & Dorothy).3,4 Sir Robert Corbet, Sheriff of Shropshire died on 11 April 1513 at Moreton Corbet, Shropshir
2 CONC e, England; Buried at Moreton Corbet, Shropshire.3
