1 NAME Walter /Devereux/ 1st Viscount Hereford, 9th Baron Ferrers of Chartley, KG
2 GIVN Walter
2 SURN Devereux
2 NSFX 1st Viscount Hereford, 9th Baron Ferrers of Chartley, KG
