2 NICK 1st Viscount Hereford
1 NAME Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1488
2 ADDR
3 ADR2 Stowe-by-Chartley
3 CITY Stowe
3 CTRY England
1 BURI
2 DATE FEB 1558
2 PLAC Stowe Church
2 ADDR
