1 OCCU Known as "The Star of Abergavenny"; Legend has it she was so beloved by her people that 3000 knights, nobles and weeping peasantry followed her body from Coldbrook House to the Herbert Chapel of St. Mary's Priory Church where she 
2 CONC was buried.
