2 CONT
2 CONT Gwladus Verch. Star of Abergavenny. Dafydd. Baroness of Bredwardine. was born in 1378 in Breconshire, Wales. She had one son with Sir Roger Vaughan Baron of Bredwardine in 1400. She died in 1454 in Abergavenny, Monmouthshire, Wale
2 CONC s, having lived a long life of 76 years.
