1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See Peter Bartrum, https://cadair.aber.ac.uk/dspace/bitstream/handle/2160/5005/Godwin%208.png?sequence=1&isAllowed=y (January 31, 2018; Anne Brannen, curator)
