2 CONT Elizabeth verch William
2 CONT
2 CONT F,  b. circa 1427
2 CONT
2 CONT      Elizabeth was born circa 1427 at Raglan, Montgomeryshire, Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She was the daughter of Sir William ap Thomas.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She married Sir Henry Stradling, son of Sir Edward Stradling and Joan Beaufort.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name became Stradling.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Elizabeth verch William and Sir Henry Stradling
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.Thomas Stradling+1 b. 1454, d. 9 Aug 1480
