2 CONT
2 CONT 23. Elizabeth HERBERT (Gwladus VERCH DAFYDD4, Dafydd Gam AP LLEWELYN3, Mawd Verch IEUAN2, Ieuan Ap RHYS1) was born ABT 1427 in Ragland, Monmouth, England. She married Henry Harry STRADLING ABT 1447 in St. Donats Castle, Glamorgan,
2 CONC  Wales, son of Edward STRADLING and Jane PLANTAGENET. He was born 1430 in St. Donats Castle, Glamorgan, Wales, and died 1451 in Famagusta, Cyprus.  
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children of Elizabeth HERBERT and Henry Harry STRADLING are:+ 39   i. Thomas STRADLING was born 1454 in St. Donant's Cas, Glenmorganshire, Wales, and died 8 SEP 1480 in St. Donats, Cardiff, Glamorgan, Wales. 
2 CONT
2 CONT   40   ii. Charles STRADLING was born ABT 1457 in St. Donat's, Glamorganshire, Wales. 
2 CONT
2 CONT   41   iii. Jane STRADLING was born ABT 1459 in Of St Donat's, Glamorganshire, Wales, and died Deceased. She married Miles Ap HARRY. He died Deceased.  
2 CONT
2 CONT   42   iv. Elizabeth STRADLING was born ABT 1461 in Of St Donat's, Glamorganshire, Wales, and died Deceased. She married Richard FLEMING. He died Deceased.  
2 CONT
2 CONT  http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=REG&db=dblocher&id=I384913
