2 CONT *'''Lady Anne Stafford1
2 CONT *'''F, #107554, b. 1483, d. 1544
2 CONT *Last Edited=27 Mar 2009
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.02%
2 CONT *'''  Lady Anne Stafford was born in 1483 at Brecknock Castle, Brecknock, Breconshire, Wales.3 She was the daughter of Henry Stafford, 2nd Duke of Buckingham and Katherine Woodville.1 She married, firstly, Sir Walter Herbert in 15
2 CONC 03.1,3 She married, secondly, George Hastings, 1st Earl of Huntingdon, son of Sir Edward Hastings, 2nd Lord Hastings and Mary Hungerford, 5th Baroness Botreaux, circa December 1509.4 She died in 1544.
2 CONT *'''      From 1503, her married name became Herbert.1,3 From circa December 1509, her married name became Hastings.4 As a result of her marriage, Lady Anne Stafford was styled as Countess of Huntingdon on 8 December 1529.
2 CONT *'''Children of Lady Anne Stafford and George Hastings, 1st Earl of Huntingdon
2 CONT ** 1.Francis Hastings, 2nd Earl of Huntingdon+5 d. 23 Jun 1560
2 CONT ** 2.Lady Mary Hastings6 d. Mar 1532/33
2 CONT ** 3.Henry Hastings5
2 CONT ** 4.Sir Thomas Hastings7 b. 1515, d. 1558
2 CONT ** 5.William Hastings5 b. 1518, d. 1556
2 CONT ** 6.Lady Dorothea Hastings+5 b. 1519
2 CONT ** 7.Edward Hastings, 1st and last Baron Hastings of Loughborough+5 b. c 1520, d. 5 Mar 1571/72
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Families: The Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 130. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Families.
2 CONT * 2.[S3409] Caroline Maubois, "re: Penancoet Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 2 December 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Penancoet Family."
2 CONT * 3.[S3470] Marian Hastings, "re: Hastings Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 31 December 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Hastings Family."
2 CONT * 4.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Exti
2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume VI, page 655. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT * 5.[S37] Volume 2, page 2005. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT * 6.[S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume II, page 137.
2 CONT * 7.[S8] Volume 1, page 16. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S8]
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p10756.htm#i107554 ______________________________
2 CONT *'''Anne STAFFORD (C. Huntingdon)
