2 CONT *'''Died: 1544
2 CONT *'''Buried: Stoke Pogis, Buckinghamshire, England
2 CONT *Notes: See her Biography.    http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/Bios/AnneStafford(CHuntingdon).htm
2 CONT *Father: Henry STAFFORD (2° D. Buckingham)
2 CONT *Mother: Catherine WOODVILLE (D. Buckingham/D. Bedford)
2 CONT *'''Married 1: Walter HERBERT (Sir Knight) AFT 1489 
2 CONT *'''Married 2: George HASTINGS (1° E. Huntingdon) Dec 1503
2 CONT *Children: 
2 CONT **1. Francis HASTINGS (2º E. Huntingdon)
2 CONT **2. William HASTINGS (ABT 1510, Huntingdon, Brewick, Scotland)
2 CONT **3. Catherine HASTINGS
2 CONT **4. Thomas HASTINGS (Sir)
2 CONT **5. Edward HASTINGS (1° B. Hastings of Loughborough)
2 CONT **6. Henry HASTINGS (b. ABT 1508, Huntingdon, Berwick, Scotland)
2 CONT **7. Mary HASTINGS (B. Berkeley)
2 CONT **8. Dorothy HASTINGS
2 CONT *'''Associated with: William COMPTON (Sir Knight)
2 CONT *'''Associated with: HENRY VIII TUDOR (King of England)
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/STAFFORD1.htm#Anne STAFFORD (C. Huntingdon) _______________________________
2 CONT *HASTINGS, Sir Thomas (c.1515-58), of Stoke Poges, Bucks.
2 CONT *b. c.1515;, 2nd s. of '''George Hastings, 1st Earl of Huntingdon, by Anne, da. of Henry Stafford''', 2nd Duke of Buckingham; bro. of Edward. m. Winifred, da. of Henry Pole, Lord Montagu, s.p. Kntd. 2 Oct. 1553.1
2 CONT *From: http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1509-1558/member/hastings-sir-thomas-1515-58 _______________________
2 CONT *HASTINGS, Edward (by 1519-72), of Loughborough, Leics. and Stoke Poges, Bucks.
2 CONT *b. by 1519, 3rd s. of '''George Hastings, 1st Earl of Huntingdon, by Anne, da. of Henry Stafford''', 2nd Duke of Buckingham, bro. of Sir Thomas. m. Joan, da. of John Harington of Bagworth, Leics., wid. of George Villers, s.p.; 1s
2 CONC . illegit. Kntd. 15 Sept. 1547, KG nom. 23 Apr., inst. 25 May 1555; cr. Baron Hastings of Loughborough 19 Jan. 1558.1
