1 NOTE KNOWN AS "HARRY"; 4TH EARL OF NORTHUMBERLAND; KG; MURDERED
1 NOTE 5TH EARL OF NORTHUMBERLAND
1 NOTE 5th Earl of Northumberland. [GADD.GED]
1 NOTE 4th Earl of Northumberland. He was confined in the Tower from the death of his Father in 1461 until 27 Oct 1469, when the titles etc were restored to him. He fell a victim to the avarice of King Henry VII in 1489. He was murdered 
2 CONC with some attendants as a result of that disagreement. He married Maud, daughter of the First Earl of Pembroke and was succeeded by his only son, Henry Algernon, 5th Earl. {Burke�s Peerage} [GADD.GED]
