1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anne Percy1 
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #4264, b. before 27 July 1485, d. 1552
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=7 Nov 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Anne Percy was born before 27 July 1485.1 She was the daughter of Henry Percy, 3rd Earl of Northumberland and Lady Maud Herbert.1 She married William FitzAlan, 18th Earl of Arundel, son of Thomas FitzAlan, 17th Earl of Arunde
2 CONC l and Margaret Woodville, on 15 February 1510/11.1 She died in 1552.1 Her will (dated 4 March 1551/2) was probated on 14 December 1552.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      From 15 February 1510/11, her married name became FitzAlan.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Anne Percy and William FitzAlan, 18th Earl of Arundel
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Fitzalan, 19th Earl of Arundel+ b. 23 Apr 1512, d. 24 Feb 1579/801
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT [S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinct 
2 CONC or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 250. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/LLH7-6R5
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Percy-236
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/63270167/anne-fitzalan
2 CONT
2 CONT She was Countess of Arundel by virtue of her marriage to the Earl of Arundel. Her will was dated 4 Mar 1551-2, pr. 14 Dec 1552 (Source: Cokayne. The Complete Peerage (1887), volume 1, pages 150-151).
