2 _MARNM Touchet
2 NICK Margery
2 NICK Widow of John Touchet
1 NAME Maud de Grey, Baroness Audley
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1342
2 ADDR
3 CTRY England
1 DEAT
2 DATE BEF 3 NOV 1405
2 ADDR
3 CTRY England
1 TITL Lady
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Tuchet, 4th Baron Audley was the son of Sir John Tuchet, called "Baron Audley", and his wife Maud, widow of Sir Richard de Willoughby.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From [https://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1386-1421/member/dabrichecourt-sir-john-1415 DABRICHECOURT, Sir John (d.1415), of Markeaton, Derbys.] s. of Sir Sanchet Dabrichecourt (d.c.1360) KG. Bro. of Sir Nicholas*. m. 
2 CONC by Sept. 1378, Maud, wid. of Sir John Tuchet (d.1371), of Markeaton, 1s. 5da.; 2s. illegit. Kntd. by Oct. 1375; KG 20 Mar. 1413
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1014.htm#i30456
2 CONT
2 CONT Margery de Grey was born circa 1342; Relationship to parents shown is suggested, not proved.1,4 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Sir John Touchet, 1st Lord Audley, son of Sir John Touchet and Joan de Audley, before 1371; They had 1 son (Sir John, 4th Lord Audley).1,2,3,4 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margery de Grey married Sir John Dabridgecourt, Keeper of the Tower of London & Calais Castle, son of Sir Nicholas III d' Auberchicourt, Seigneur d'Auberchicourt & Bugnicourt, before September 1378; They had 1 son (Robert) and 5 d
2 CONC aughters (Joan, wife of Hugh Willoughby; Joan, wife of Sir John Cokayne; Marion; Agnes; & Philippe). He had 2 additional sons (illegitimate) (John; & William).1,3,4 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margery de Grey died before 3 November 1405; She had married (1) Sir Richard de Willoughby (d. 2 June 1369).3,4
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1
2 CONT *Sir John Touchet, 1st Lord Audley b. c 1350, d. 23 Jun 1372 Child	
2 CONT *Sir John Touchet, 4th Lord Audley, Keeper of Llandovery & Brecknock Castles+3,4 b. 23 Apr 1371, d. 19 Dec 1408 Family 2
2 CONT *Sir John Dabridgecourt, Keeper of the Tower of London & Calais Castle
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Citations
2 CONT # [S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 721.
2 CONT # [S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 765-766.
2 CONT # [S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. IV, p. 215-216.
2 CONT # [S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. V, p. 193-194 .
