2 CONT >IGI shows this Sir Humphrey as third son of Edmund de Stafford, 1st Lord. ''BE1883'' shows him as the heir of Sir John (son of William of Bromshull) and elder brother of the Ralph who was ancestor of the Staffords of Grafton and 
2 CONC also those of Blatherwycke. We follow ''BE1883'' which identifies his wife merely as daughter and heir of _ Greinvill. IGI identifies her as ... <Elizabeth Greville, daughter of Adam Greville.>"
2 CONT
2 CONT ==sources==
2 CONT * [https://archive.org/stream/somersetmedieva01weavgoog#page/n338/mode/2up Will] of Humphry Stafford, knight, senior, dated 5 April 1413, proved 29 November 1413. <br>
