2 CONT mentions: Elisabeth my wife <br>
2 CONT A codicil dated 30 October 1413 <br>
2 CONT mentions: Humphry Stafford my son, and Elisabeth his wife
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000073361173593& Inquisitions Post Mortem] for Humphrey Stafford, knight, Writ 5 Nov. 1413. <br>
2 CONT mention: Alice his late wife <br>
