1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anne Margaret Dutton (Tuchet) is a direct descendent and bloodline of the kings of England, Scotland, France, and Norse Kings from Denmark/Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Margaret's identified family bloodline runs to the Plantagenet kings through her mother's line, starting with English King Edward III (her 2nd Great Grandfather), and traveling through the English monarchy to Kings Edward II 
2 CONC (Plantagenet) and Edward I (Plantagenet) "Longshanks" of England (reign 1272-1307ad) her 4th great grandfather. Through this bloodline, Anne Margaret Dutton is a direct descendent and blood line of the House of Mercia, House of We
2 CONC ssex, House of Normandy, and the House of Plantagenet (Angevin). (King Edward I of England; King Edward II; King Edward III; Edmund Plantagenet, KG, of Langley, 1st Duke of York; Constance Plantagenet, Duchess of Gloucester; Elean
2 CONC or (de Holland) Tuchet, Baroness of Audley; Anne Margaret (Tuchet) Dutton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Data:
2 CONT
2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1107.htm#i33259
