2 CONT *Mother Margaret Roos1 b. c 1400, d. bt Sep 1423 - 14 Feb 1430 
2 CONT *''''''     Margaret Touchet married Sir Thomas Dutton, son of Sir John Dutton and Margaret Savage.1 Margaret Touchet married Hugh Done, son of John Done, Esq. and Anne Heiton. Margaret Touchet was born circa 1424 at of Heleigh, S
2 CONC taffordshire, England.2,3 She died in 1503.
