1 NAME Sir Humphrey Audley, Kt.
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1434
2 ADDR
3 CITY Heleigh
3 STAE England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 4 MAY 1471
2 ADDR
3 CITY Tewkesbury
3 STAE England
