1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sir James Luttrell1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8
2 CONT *'''M, #39113, b. circa 1427, d. 17 February 1461
2 CONT *Father      Sir John Luttrell9,10,2,11,12 b. c 1394, d. 30 Jun 1430
2 CONT *Mother     Margaret Touchet9,10,2,11,12 b. 1399, d. 1 Jun 1438
2 CONT *'''     Sir James Luttrell was born circa 1427 at of Dunster, Somersetshire, England; Age 3 or 4 in 1430. 2nd son, but 1st surviving son.1,2,4 He and Elizabeth Courtenay obtained a marriage license in 1450; They had 2 sons (Alexa
2 CONC nder; & Sir Hugh) and 1 daughter (Jane, wife of George Stewkley).1,13,2,14,3,4,5,6,7,8 Sir James Luttrell died on 17 February 1461 at 2nd battle of St. Albans, Hertfordshire, England.2,4,5,7,8
2 CONT *'''Family      Elizabeth Courtenay b. c 1428, d. 1 Sep 1493
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **Sir Hugh Luttrell, Sheriff of Somerset & Dorset+15,16,2,4,7 b. c 1456, d. 1 Feb 1521
2 CONT *Citations
