2 CONT * 2.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 470.
2 CONT * 3.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 31.
2 CONT * 4.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 62.
2 CONT * 5.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. IV, p. 219.
2 CONT * 6.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. II, p. 403.
