2 CONT * 9.[S11583] The Wallop Family and Their Ancestry, by Vernon James Watney, p., 512.
2 CONT * 10.[S11572] The Lineage and Ancestry of H.R.H. Prince Charles, Prince of Wales, by Gerald Paget, Vol. II, p. 457.
2 CONT * 11.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 61-62.
