2 CONT '''Cicely Arnold'''1 
2 CONT F, #27974, '''d. between July 1558 and November 1558'''
2 CONT Last Edited=18 Sep 2004
2 CONT '''     Cicely Arnold married, firstly, Richard Rowdon before 1526.1 She married, secondly, Thomas Berkeley, 5th Lord Berkeley''', son of Sir Maurice Berkeley and Isabel Meade, '''in 1526.1 She died between July 1558 and November 
2 CONC 1558 at Bristol, EnglandG.1 She was buried at St. Augustine's, Bristol, England'''G.1
2 CONT '''     From before 1526, her married name became Rowdon.1 Her married name became Berkeley.'''
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT [S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinct 
2 CONC or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume II, page 137. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT https://www.thepeerage.com/p2798.htm#i27974
