2 CONT
2 CONT When Sir Roger Vaughan Baron of Bredwardine was born in 1377 in Bredwardine, Herefordshire, England, his father, Sir, was 36 and his mother, Dame, was 32. He had one son with Gwladus Verch. Star of Abergavenny. Dafydd. Baroness of
2 CONC  Bredwardine. in 1400. He died on October 25, 1415, in Pas-de-Calais, France, at the age of 38.
2 CONT
