2 CONT When Lady Elizabeth Whitney was born in 1447 in Kent, England, her father, Sir, was 29, and her mother, Lady, was 18. She had one daughter with John II (O the Mende) Pye in 1487. She died in 1495 in her hometown at the age of 48.
