2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34684669615 Sir Edward Littleton, of Pillaton]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-76928723 Sir Edward Littleton II of Pillaton, MP]; [https://www
2 CONC .geni.com/profile-34733318266 Mary Littleton]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on January 23, 1625 in England. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT [S2] The Plantagenet Roll - Essex Volume, The Marquis of Ruvigny and Raineval, (Genealogy Publishing Company - reprint 1994), Special table showing desc of the Rev Arthur Rollinson Dolphin, M.M. (Reliability: 2), 15 Jul 2019. Marg
2 CONC aret Devereux, yr. da. and co-h married Sir Edward littleton of Pillaton, M.P. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
