1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * John WALWYNPrint Family Tree
2 CONT * Born in 1462 - Herefordshire, England
2 CONT * Deceased - Herefordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT * Parents
2 CONT * Thomas WALWYN, born after 1431 - Herefordshire, England, Deceased 23 November 1471 - Kent, England Married to
2 CONT * Agnes ( Eleanor) MILBOURNE, born in 1428 - Herefordshire, England, Deceased - England
2 CONT
2 CONT * Spouses, children and grandchildren
2 CONT * Married in 1485, Herefordshire, England, to 
2 CONT * Wife
2 CONT * Gladys Verch (MORGAN) DAFYDD, born about 1464 - Trallong, Breconshire, Wales, Deceased in 1516 - Herefordshire, England aged about 52 years old (Parents : M Dafydd (Ap Gwilym) MORGAN 1448-1520 &  F Mary (Ann) de la (Lady ARXTON)
2 CONC  HAYE ca 1452-) with
2 CONT * Children
2 CONT * M John Walwyn ca 1485-
2 CONT * M Thomas WALWYN ca 1486-1516  married to Eleanor (Verch John) VAUGHAN 1486-1529 with
2 CONT * M Nicholas WALWYN 1508-1558 married to Eleanor Lingen 1514-
2 CONT * F Elizabeth Walwyn ca 1489-
