2 CONT
2 CONT Jonet married Jenkin "John" BASSETT of Beaupre, Gent., son of John BASSETT of Beaupre and Gwenllian ferch IEUAN. (Jenkin "John" BASSETT was born in 1445 in Beaupre, St. Hilary, Glamorgan, Wales and died on 24 May 1492.)
