2 CONT *Father Thomas Breynton b. c 1440 
2 CONT *Mother (Miss) Harper b. c 1444 
2 CONT *''''''     John Breynton was born circa 1466 at of Stretton Sugwas. He married Sybil Milbourne, daughter of Simon Milbourne, Esq., Sheriff of Herefordshire and Jane Baskerville, circa 1487.2,3
2 CONT *''''''Family Sybil Milbourne b. c 1468, d. 26 Nov 1537 
