1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sybil Milbourne1,2
2 CONT *'''F, b. circa 1468, d. 26 November 1537
2 CONT *Father Simon Milbourne, Esq., Sheriff of Herefordshire2 b. c 1435, d. 14 Aug 1522 
2 CONT *Mother Jane Baskerville2 b. c 1451 
2 CONT *'''     Sybil Milbourne was born circa 1468 at of Eardisley, Hereford, England. She married Richard Hackluyt, son of Henry Hackluyt and (Miss) Cassy, circa 1483.3,2 Sybil Milbourne married John Breynton, son of Thomas Breynton an
2 CONC d (Miss) Harper, circa 1487.4,2 Sybil Milbourne died on 26 November 1537.
2 CONT *'''Family 1 Richard Hackluyt b. 1460, d. 1486 
2 CONT *'''Family 2 John Breynton b. c 1466 
