1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==John Hall==
2 CONT * BIRTH: c1570 Bradford on Avon, Wiltshire 
2 CONT * DEATH: 1631 Bradford on Avon, Wiltshire  
2 CONT * FATHER:  John Hall l 
2 CONT * MOTHER: Dorothy Rogers 
2 CONT * WIFE: Elizabeth Brune c1572-1/12/1633 
2 CONT * WIFE'S FATHER:  Henry Brune 
2 CONT * WIFE'S MOTHER:  Elizabeth Martyn
2 CONT * MARRIED: c1592 Puddletown, Dorset 
2 CONT * DESCENDING SON: John Hall III 
2 CONT
2 CONT CHILDREN:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. Brune Hall, Bp 1593 Holy Trinity Ch, Wiltshire d. 1593 Wiltshire.
2 CONT * 2. Elizabeth Hall, Bp 1594 Holy Trinity Ch. m 1620 John Cottrell s/o John of Wingfield.
2 CONT * 3. Edward Hall, Bp 1598 Holy Trinity Ch, Wiltshire, d. 1601 Wiltshire.
2 CONT * 4. Thomas Hall, son/heir, Bp 1600 Holy Trinity Ch, Wiltshire, m. c1621 Catherine d/o Sir Edward Seymour.
2 CONT * 5. Jane Hall, Bp 1601 Holy Trinity Ch, Wiltshire, unmarried 1631 (father’s will).
2 CONT * 6. Mary Hall, Bp 1604 Holy Trinity Ch, Wiltshire, d. 3/24/1641 Wiltshire m. Christopher Bailey 6/14/1622 Wiltshire.
2 CONT * 7. John Hall, Bp 1605 Holy Trinity Ch, Wiltshire, m. possibly Elizabeth Rogers.
2 CONT * 8. Dorothy Hall, Bp 1608 Holy Trinity Ch, Wiltshire, unmarried 1631 (father’s will).
2 CONT * 9. Nicholas Hall, Bp 1609 Holy Trinity Ch, Wiltshire, d. 1610
2 CONT * 10. Anne Hall, Bp Holy Trinity Ch 1612, unmarried 1631 (father’s will).
2 CONT * 11. Henry Hall, Bp Holy Trinity Ch 1614, d. 1614 Wiltshire.
2 CONT * 12. William Hall, b. c1613, not on Holy Trinity Ch bp records, but listed on John’s 1631 will as his son. It is believed he was adopted after infant death of two sons.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes== 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://home.comcast.net/~wdegidio/Hall/hallfamily4.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of John Hall (1540-1620) & Dorothy Rogers:
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:  
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1.  Thomas Hall, b. c1566 Wiltshire d. c1600, eldest son.
2 CONT * 2.  John Hall II b. c1570 Wiltshire d. 3/19/1631 m. Elizabeth Brune, dau. of Henry of Athelhampton, co., Dorset.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
