1 NAME Alice /Toose/
2 GIVN Alice
2 SURN Toose
2 _MARNM Hill
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 1499
1 DEAT
2 DATE AFT 1531
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Hill-2291
2 CONT
2 CONT Roger Hill is said to have had two wives. In about 1515 he first married Alice (Alicia), the older daughter of John Toose of Taunton and Johanna Combes, his wife. They had two children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Joan Hill, b. ca. 1516 
2 CONT * John Hill, b. ca. 1518 
2 CONT
2 CONT Both were named in their father's 1544 Will but apparently neither had an heir as the family estate at Poundisford was inherited by Robert Hill, Roger's first-born by his 2nd wife, Margery Toose, younger sister of Alice (Toose) Hi
2 CONC ll, who must have died between 1518 and 1522.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: John Hill of Dorchester, Mass., 1633, and five generations of his ... edited by J. Gardner Bartlett  https://archive.org/details/johnhillofdorche00bart https://archive.org/stream/johnhillofdorche00bart#page/n106/mode/1up P
2 CONC g.95
