1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''William Hill  ''' 
2 CONT * Birth:	 1470 Taunton, Somersetshire, England  
2 CONT * Death:	 May 24, 1532 Tauton, Somersetshire, England, United Kingdom
2 CONT * Son of Roger Hill & Alice Wood
2 CONT * Husband of Eleanor 
2 CONT * Father of Joane Hill; Roger Hill, of Taunton
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''The Antiquary, Volume 32 edited by Edward Walford, John Charles Cox, George Latimer Apperson
2 CONT *http://books.google.com/books?id=J9gzAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA223&lpg=PA223&dq=Dionisia+Durborough&source=bl&ots=9HZS1PA7H0&sig=OGAFpKBSA9AuWYlgudB84Xt4hfU&hl=en&ei=WL6CTYKqGJLCsAPi8sT-AQ&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=9&ved=0CEcQ6AEw
2 CONC CA#v=onepage&q=Dionisia%20Durborough&f=false
2 CONT *'''   (1) William Hill (d. 1450-1510). probably a grandson of Robert Hill, of Spaxton, settled at Taunton. He married Eleanor ___, and was succeeded by his son,
2 CONT *   (2) Roger Hill, of Taunton, who married Margery ___, by whom he had three sons and two daughters. One son, Robert, resided at Yard, or Yard House, near Taunton; a name suggestive of the manor of Yarde, in Combe Flory, held by 
2 CONC Robert Hill, of Spaxton, one of the few properties in the long list of his possessions (Cal. Inq. Post Mortem, iv., 70), which may have been patrimonial. This Robert Hill, of Taunton, was twice married; one son, Hugh, is described
2 CONC  as "of Splot," and had a son James. Another of Roger's sons, apparently the younger, was .... etc.
2 CONT *___________________
2 CONT **'Hill06'
2 CONT *'''William Hill m. Eleanor
2 CONT ** 1. Roger Hill of Taunton Visitation (Weaver, Somerset, 1551+1575+1595, Hill) identifies Roger's wife and mother of her children as Alice Towse, Visitation (1623) shows the mother of Roger's children as a Margery so we prsume th
2 CONC at Alice Towse was Roger's 2nd wife. m1. Margery
2 CONT **'''  m2. Alice Towse (dau of John Towse of Somerset (by Joan Combes), m2. Sir Thomas Grenville of Cornwall)
2 CONT *From: http://www.stirnet.com
2 CONT *____________
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://peasesawyer.com/Pease/hills.html 1. WILLIAM**(-4)1 HILL was born Bet. 1440 - 1450 in TAUNTON, SOMMERSET, ENGLAND; or ca 1440-50. He married ELEANOR (?) HILL. She was born 1450 in TAUNTON, SOMMERSET, ENGLAND.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of WILLIAM**(-4) HILL and ELEANOR HILL is:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. i. ROGER**(-32 )HILL, b. Abt. 1485, TAUNTON, SOMMERSET, ENGLAND;or ca 1470-75; d. 1546, TAUNTON, SOMMERSET, ENGLAND?.
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband: William Hill (H400)
