2 CONT John Hill(4) (William3, Roger2, William1) was the youngest child of the family according to the Visitation, but was of age in 1592, so was born probably abt 1570. By his father's will in 1592, he received L10, and from the will of
2 CONC  his brother, Thomas Hill, it appears that this John(4) Hill was married and had, at least, sons John(5) and Jonathan(5).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Per J. Gardner Bartlett's "John Hill of Dorchester, Mass., 1633 , and Five
2 CONT Generations of His Descendants" (c.1904), John was the younges t of 14
2 CONT children of his father (of 4 by LUCY). Bartlett states that "kn owledge of
2 CONT his residence or marriage has not yet been secured."
