2 CONT ** Married to Dionise BOURMAN, 
2 CONT *** born in 1497 - Hemyock, Devon, England, 
2 CONT *** Deceased in 1523 - Devon, England age at death: 26 years old 	
2 CONT '''Spouses and children:'''
2 CONT * '''Married''' 12 February 1561, Shoreditch, Middlesex, England, to '''Winifred Leigh''', 
