2 CONT ===  . Winifred13 Leigh (Thomas14, Roger15,  ===
2 CONT . Winifred13 Leigh (Thomas14, Roger15, Richard (Lee)16, Ralph17 Lee, Robert18, Robert19, Robert20, John21, John22, Reginald23, Thomas24, John25) was born in Staneleigh, England ABT 1533. She married George Bond. George was born AB
2 CONC T 1529 in Buckland, ENG. George was the son of William Bond and dau. of Hill. George died 1562 at 33 years of age.(1672) (See George Bond for the children resulting from this marriage.) 665. John22 Lee (Reginald23, Thomas24, John2
2 CONC 5)(1889) was born in Langley, England about 1291. He married Matilda de Erdington ABT 1310 in of Roden, Shropshire, ENG. Matilda was born ABT 1295 in Co. Warwick, ENGLAND. Matilda(1890) was the daughter of Henry de Erdington. His 
2 CONC parents are listed as Thomas De La Lee and Petronilla De Stanton in ver. 4.15 of the Mormon's Ancestral File. (F-438) John Lee and Matilda de Erdington had the following children: + 657 i. John21 Lee was born about 1317. ___ . Tho
2 CONC mas14 Leigh (Roger15, Richard (Lee)16, Ralph17 Lee, Robert18, Robert19, Robert20, John21, John22, Reginald23, Thomas24, John25)(1739) was born in Stoneleigh, England about 1509. Thomas died 17 Nov 1572 at 63 years of age. He marri
2 CONC ed Alice Barker BEF 1533. Alice was born EST 1509 in Wolverton, Buckinghamshire, England. Alice(1740) was the daughter of John Barker and Elizabeth Hill. Thomas Leigh and Alice Barker had the following child: + 545 i. Winifred13 L
2 CONC eigh was born ABT 1533. ____ http://www.ancestory.com/forte/nindex.htm#sx   9-9-1998
2 CONT
