1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Ann-Strong/6000000123480862167
2 CONT *Ann Bond may be the wife of George Strong's sibling. Further research needed.*
2 CONT * George Strong's son Walter Strong married an Ann Bond according to http://minerdescent.com/2011/10/12/george-strong/
2 CONT * Also, George Bond's will names a daughter Ann who married Richard Martin. There is no mention of a Walter Strong or George Strong, both of whom were still living when Bond died in 1592. 
2 CONT * Ann and Richard Martin were married in 1586, when both Strongs were still living. If either of them were Ann's second husband, it would probably show them as marrying Ann Martin rather than Ann Bond.
