1 OCCU Countess of Huntingdon
1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Lucy Davies was born on 20 January 1612 at Dublin, County Dublin, Ireland.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of '''Sir John Davies''' and '''Eleanor Touchet'''.1,3 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married '''Ferdinando Hastings, 6th Earl of Huntingdon''', son of Henry Hastings, 5th Earl of Huntingdon and Lady Elizabeth Stanley, on 7 August 1623.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 14 November 1679 at age 67.3
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name became Hastings. As a result of her marriage, Lucy Davies was styled as Countess of Huntingdon on 14 November 1643.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children of Lucy Davies and Ferdinando Hastings, 6th Earl of Huntingdon===
2 CONT
2 CONT #     * Lady Mary Hastings+1
2 CONT #     * Lady Elizabeth Hastings1 d. 28 Mar 1664
2 CONT #     * Lady Alice Hastings3
2 CONT #     * Lady Eleanor Hastings3
2 CONT #     * Lady Christiana Hastings3 d. 1681
2 CONT #     * Henry Hastings, Lord Hastings1 b. 16 Jan 1630, d. 24 Jun 1649
2 CONT #     * John Hastings1 b. 3 Aug 1632, d. Dec 1639
2 CONT #     * Ferdinando Hastings1 b. 16 Feb 1637, d. 8 May 1647
2 CONT #     * Theophilus Hastings, 7th Earl of Huntingdon+1 b. 10 Dec 1650, d. 30 May 1701
2 CONT # 
