1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Lady Anne Stanley:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p4755.htm#i47549
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Anne Stanley [1]
2 CONT *F, #47549, 
2 CONT *b. May 1580, 
2 CONT *d. circa October 1647
2 CONT *Last Edited=6 Mar 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Anne Stanley was born in May 1580.[1] She was the daughter of Ferdinando Stanley, 5th Earl of Derby and Alice Spencer.[2],[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, firstly, Grey Brydges, 5th Baron Chandos of Sudeley, son of William Brydges, 4th Baron Chandos of Sudeley and Mary Hopton, on 28 February 1607/8.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, Mervyn Tuchet, 2nd Earl of Castlehaven, son of George Tuchet, 1st Earl of Castlehaven and Lucy Mervyn, on 22 July 1624 at Harefield, London, England.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died circa October 1647 at Ruislip, London, England.[1],[2] She was buried on 11 October 1647 at Harefield, London, England.[2] She died intestate and her estate was administered on 2 March 1654/55.[2]
2 CONT *As a result of her marriage, Lady Anne Stanley was styled as Baroness Chandos of Sudeley on 28 February 1607/8. From 28 February 1607/8, her married name became Brydges. 
2 CONT *From 22 July 1624, her married name became Tuchet.[1] As a result of her marriage, Lady Anne Stanley was styled as Countess of Castlehaven on 22 July 1624.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Anne Stanley and Grey Brydges, 5th Baron Chandos of Sudeley
2 CONT *1. Elizabeth Brydges [3] d. c Mar 1678/79
2 CONT *2. Hon. Robert Brydges [4] d. b 20 Jun 1611
2 CONT *3. George Brydges, 6th Baron Chandos of Sudeley+[5] b. 9 Aug 1620, d. Feb 1654/55
2 CONT *4. William Brydges, 7th Baron Chandos of Sudeley [5] b. a 1620, d. c Aug 1676
2 CONT
