2 CONT
2 CONT Death:	May 24 1551 - Rivington, Lancashire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:	Robert Pilkington Of Rivington, Joan Janet Or Pilkington Of Rivington (born Tyldesley)
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings:	Alice Croston (born Pilkington Of Rivington), Elizabeth Pilkington Of Rivington (Spinster), Miss Pilkington, <Private> Lockwood Of Horwich (born Pilkington Of Rivington)
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife:	Alice Pilkington (born Asshawe)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:	George Pilkington Of Rivington, Rt Rev James Pilkington Pilkington Of Rivington, Bishop Of Durham, Francis Pilkington Of Rivington, John Pilkington, D.d., Archdeacon Of Durham, Rev Leonard (5th Son) Pilkington ,d.d., Cha
2 CONC rles Pilkington, Catherine Shaw Of Anderton (born Pilkington Of Rivington), Janet Cowburn Of Ayes, Near Blackburn (born Pilkington Of Rivington), Margaret Ashawe (born Pilkington Of Rivington), Alice Pilkington Of Rivington, Unkno
2 CONC wn Pilkington Of Rivington, Lawrence Pilkington, Nn Pilkington
2 CONT
