2 CONC  History Online, pp. 88–92, retrieved 2010-09-22 ^ Jump up to: a b c d e Pilkington 1912, pp. 359 Chart ^ Jump up to: a b Pilkington 1912, pp. 89 Chart Jump up ^ Pilkington 1912, pp. 23–31 ^ Jump up to: a b Pilkington 1912, pp. 32
