2 CONT maiden name of Joan Goring born abt 1450, second wife of John Goring Born abt 1448, was HEWSTER. Her father was Humphrey Hewster. She was the widow of John Goring, her second husband's father [i.e. her second husbands step father]
2 CONC  [hence her name at the time of her marriage would indeed be Joan Goring]
