2 CONT
2 CONT Sir William Kingsmill was born in 1526.3 He was the son of Sir John Kingsmill and Constance Goring.2 He married Bridget Raleigh.2 He died circa December 1592.3 He was buried on 11 December 1592.3 Sir William Kingsmill lived at Syd
2 CONC monton, Hampshire, England.4
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir William Kingsmill
2 CONT * Eleanor Kingsmill+5
2 CONT * Sir William Kingsmill+3 d. 30 Jun 1618
2 CONT * Constance Kingsmill+5 d. a Apr 1587
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Sir William Kingsmill and Bridget Raleigh
2 CONT * Francis Kingsmill+2 b. 1569, d. 1620
