3 CITY Sibmanton
3 STAE Hampshire
3 CTRY England
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1600
1 BURI
2 DATE 5 OCT 1600
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.genealogy.com/forum/surnames/topics/kingsmill/15/
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Kingsmill was the daughter of Sir John Kingsmill and Constance Goring.She was the tenth of 17 children.Mary had been born at Sidmonton in Hampshire, England.?She died in Hampshire, England in 1600, and was subsequently buried
2 CONC  at East Woodhay 8 October 1600.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Edward Goddard, son of John Goddard and Mary Winchcombe. Edward was ?"of" East Woodhay in Hampshire, Eng.He later died in 1616 in Hampshire, Eng. with his will being probated on 20 April 1616. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward and Mary had seven children that I know of.
2 CONT
2 CONT *?1. Edward b. "of" East Woodhay, Hampshire, Eng. m. Elizabeth Whitehead in Eng.
2 CONT *2. Nicholas b. "of" East Woodhay, Hampshire, Eng. m. Anne Winchcombe in Eng.
2 CONT *3. William b. "of" East Woodhay, Hampshire, Eng. 
2 CONT *4. Constance b. "of" East Woodhay, Hampshire, Eng. m. John Flower in Eng.
2 CONT *5. Ellinor b. "of" East Woodhay, Hampshire, Eng.
2 CONT *6. Bridget b. "of" East Woodhay, Hampshire, Eng. m. William Corderoy in Eng. d. in Eng.
2 CONT *7. Anne b. "of" East Woodhay, Hampshire, Eng.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT >"Here lyeth buried Edward Godard Esq who married Mary Kingsmill daughter of Sir John Kingsmill of Sidmonton. Buried Mary Godard daughter of Sr John Kingsmill Kt wife of Edward Godard Esq 8 Oct 1600"
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Earl of Winchilsea's 1709 notes noted in the Kingsmill Records
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Links 
2 CONT * https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Kingsmill-7#_ref-1
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: c 1560 East Woodhay, Hampshire, England
