2 CONC John Hawley." https://books.google.com/books?id=GmqlIibS95IC&pg=PA224.
2 CONT # [^2]: "John Coplestone, III," Geni.com, accessed March 9, 2026. "Husband of Joan Coppleton; Father of Anne Copplestone and Agnes (Coplestone) Maggs." https://www.geni.com/people/John-Coplestone-III/6000000006110677998.
2 CONT # [^3]: "Anne Copplestone," Geni.com, accessed March 9, 2026. "Daughter of John Coplestone, III and Joan Coppleton." https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Copplestone/6000000006110931664.
2 CONT # [^4]: "Agnes Maggs (Coplestone)," Geni.com, accessed March 9, 2026. "Daughter of John Coplestone, III and Joan Coppleton; Wife of [—] Maggs." https://www.geni.com/people/Agnes-Maggs/6000000006110963604.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
