1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 2. John CHURCHILL of Dorchester was born about 1512 in Dorchester, Dorsetshire, England. He owned Lands in Dorset in 1549 in Dorchester, Dorsetshire, England. He died between 15 Apr 1557 and 25 Aug 1557.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Edith BOND (daughter of William BOND of Herringston and Lutton and Elizabeth PROWZ of Bridy) about 1540 in Dorchester, Dorsetshire, England. Edith BOND was born in 1519 in Lutton, Isle of Purbeck, Dorset, England
2 CONC . 
2 CONT
2 CONT John CHURCHILL of Dorchester and Edith BOND had three children. The eldest was:
2 CONT
2 CONT # William CHURCHILL of Dorchester (born in 1541).  Married Missy Swayne.
2 CONT
