1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===James Gould===
2 CONT * Birth	1517 
2 CONT * Death:	before August 13, 1558 in "England" 
2 CONT * Father:	John Gould (c1476-bef1526) 
2 CONT * Mother:	Katherine Preston (c1480-1529) 
2 CONT * Married unknown 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT * Alice Gould (c1548-?).  Married Matthew Churchill of Bradford, co. Dorset, ancestor of the Duke of Marlborough.		
2 CONT * Joan Gould (c1550-?).  Unmarried in 1558.  		
2 CONT * George Gould (c1552-1620) of Little Hempstead.  Married Agnes Austin.	
2 CONT * James Gould (c1554-) of Dorchester & Fordington.    Married Joan Leshdoz.  d.s.p.		
2 CONT
2 CONT Matthew Churchill of Bradford, whose Wife was Alice, Daughter to James Gould of Dorchester, and by her he had Jasper Churchill of Bradford
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT * [http://books.google.com/books?id=IkhAAAAAYAAJ&lpg=PA191&ots=ul23pCmAxi&dq=Bartholomew%20Cherchile&pg=PA192#v=onepage&q=Bartholomew%20Cherchile&f=false Collin's Peerage]
2 CONT * [http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~fordingtondorset/Files2/BailiffsofDorchester.html List of Bailiffs of Dorchester] (1394-1834)
2 CONT ** research note: from http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~fordingtondorset/Files/FordingtonDorchesterCo2.html#jamesgould
2 CONT ***James GOULD [GOOLD] (1593-1676) He was the grandson of John GOULD (d1606) of Staverton listed in the Dorset Visitation of Devon held in 1620.  
2 CONT * [https://books.google.com/books?id=NuBBAQAAMAAJ&pg=PA62&lpg=PA62&dq=thomas+Gould+1511&source=bl&ots=swMw_J-ZQG&sig=SvxHodp4VoLSQFMDXHMPa4RHJ6Q&hl=en&sa=X&ei=UixyVarKNsmiNuSUgNAH&ved=0CCcQ6AEwAw#v=onepage&q&f=true "Pedigree of Go
2 CONC uld"] Visitation of England and Wales, Volume 5  edited by Joseph Jackson Howard, Frederick Arthur Crisp.  Page 62.  John Gould of Staverton (d bef 1526) & Katherine Preston (d 1529). Their children: Thomas, Robert, James, Richard
2 CONC , John, Agnes
2 CONT * [https://books.google.com/books?id=NuBBAQAAMAAJ&lpg=PA62&ots=swMw_J-ZQG&dq=thomas%20Gould%201511&pg=PA63#v=onepage&q&f=true "Pedigree of Gould"] Visitation of England and Wales, Volume 5  edited by Joseph Jackson Howard, Frederi
2 CONC ck Arthur Crisp.  Page 63.  Died before 15 Aug 1558
2 CONT * [https://books.google.com/books?id=GmqlIibS95IC&lpg=PA420&ots=wiKvM7-9aN&dq=James%20Gould%201558&pg=PA420#v=onepage&q&f=true "Gould."] The Visitations of the County of Devon: Comprising the Herald's Visitations of 1531, 1564, & 
2 CONC 1620, Volume 1, Pages 1-452.  John Lambrick Vivian. For the author, by H. S. Eland, 1895 - Devon (England) - 899 pages.  Page 420.  Married unknown. Father of Alice (m Matthew Churchill), Joan, George (m Agnes Austin),  James (m J
2 CONC oan Leshdoz)
2 CONT * [http://www.vagenweb.org/mecklenburg/crusader.htm Descendants of John Gold the Crusader] Submitted by Patricia Henderson-London  13 January 1999 Updated 15 May 1999.  born 1545.  Comment: this birth date is after father's death 
