2 CONT
2 CONT From  [http://books.google.com/books?id=IkhAAAAAYAAJ&lpg=PA191&ots=ul23pCmAxi&dq=Bartholomew%20Cherchile&pg=PA192#v=onepage&q=Bartholomew%20Cherchile&f=false Collin's Peerage]
2 CONT
2 CONT Jasper Churchill of Bradford; who marrying Elizabeth, Daughter to John Chaplet of Herringfton, in the County of Dorset, had John his Heir, and another Son named '''Jasper, Father of Sir John Churchill''', an eminent Council in the
2 CONC  Reign of King Charles II ....
