2 CONC p. 602. 20. Harl. 781, f. 21v. 21.APC, 1621-3, p. 308; C78/431/7; CSP Dom. 1619-23, p. 609. 22.CSP Dom. 1623-5, pp. 11, 121. 23. DCO, ‘Prince Charles in Spain’, f. 33v. 24.Procs. 1626, ii. 195, 216. 25. Birch, i. 97, 396; APC, 162
2 CONC 6, p. 87. 26.CD 1628, iii. 214. 27. Ibid. 398. 28. Ibid. iv. 128. 29. Ibid. 302. 30. Ibid. 320. 31. Ibid. 390. 32. Birch, i. 419. 33. Add. 70002, (Harley to Eure, 16 Nov. 1632); C78/431/7; E401/2640; Richard Symonds’s Diary of Mar
