2 CONT
2 CONT Sir William Croft gained the rank of Colonel. He held the office of Member of Parliament (M.P.) for Malmesbury in 1623. He held the office of Member of Parliament (M.P.) for Malmesbury in 1625. He fought in the Battle of Stokesay 
2 CONC Castle on 9 June 1645, where he was mortally wounded, and rode his horse home before collapsing.
