1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rt. Rev. Herbert Croft was born on 18 October 1603. He was the son of Sir Herbert Croft and Mary Bourne. He married Ann Brown, daughter of Very Rev. Jonathan Brown. He died on 18 May 1691 at age 87.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Rt. Rev. Herbert Croft was ordained in 1626 Roman Catholic priest. He reverted to the Church of England and became an Anglican parson. He was educated at Christ Church, Oxford University, Oxford, Oxfordshire, England. He held
2 CONC  the office of Dean of Hereford. He held the office of Bishop of Hereford in 1662. He was Chaplain to King Charles II. He held the office of Dean of the Chapel-Royal in 1667.
