1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Family and Education bap. 18 Dec. 1581,2 2nd but 1st surv. s. of Sir William Uvedale of Wickham and Mary, da. of (Sir) Richard Norton† of Tisted, Hants.3 educ. Queen’s, Oxf. 1598; M. Temple 1600; embassy, Brussels 
2 CONC 1605.4 m. (1) c.1607 (with £2,000),5 Anne (bur. 5 Sept. 1627),6 da. of Sir Edmund Carey* of Culham, Oxon., 2s. d.v.p. 4da. (1 d.v.p.);7 (2) 29 Feb. 1640,8 (with £4,000),9 Victoria (d.1694), da. of Sir Henry Carey I*, 1st Visct. Fa
