2 CONC ood fines 1630;28 constable of Porchester Castle and lt. of South Bere forest, Hants 1630-49;29 commr. sewers, Hants and Wilts. 1630, I.o.W. 1631;30 lt. of New Forest, Hants by 1634-at least 1642;31 commr. piracy, Hants and I.o.W.
