1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.swgdezign.com/wirtgriesbach/images/parr.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT JOHN2 PARR (WILLIAM MARQUESS OF1) was born Abt. 1362 in Salisbury, Wiltshire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married AGNES CROPHULL, daughter of THOMAS CROPHULL and ELIZABETH DELEBERE. She was born Abt. 1366 in Salisbury, Wiltshire, England, and died Aft. 1421.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of JOHN PARR and AGNES CROPHULL is: 3. i. THOMAS3 PARR, b. Abt. 1411, Salisbury, Wiltshire, England; d. 1464.
