2 CONT *Last Edited=17 Jul 2010
2 CONT *'''     Thomas de Crophill was born circa 1350.1 He was the son of Sir John Crophill and Margery de Verdun.1 He married Sibyl de la Bere, daughter of Sir John de la Bere, circa 18 October 1371.1 He died on 18 November 1381.1
2 CONT *'''     He was also known as Thomas de Crophull.2
2 CONT *'''Child of Thomas de Crophill and Sibyl de la Bere
