3 STAE England
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Elizabeth Milbourne''' was the daughter of Sir Simon Milbourne of Incom & Tillington and wife Jane Baskerville. She was born in Herfordshire, England c.1470. She married twice and had eight children. She died af
2 CONC ter 1514. Her sister, Blanche Herbert, was a member of the Royal Household in charge of the children of Henry VIII.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married (1) Sir Thomas Mornington, son of Richard Monington and Ellen Walwyn. They had four children. He died between 1496 and 1508. Elizabeth married (2) John Whittington, son of William Whittington and Elizabeth Arunde
2 CONC ll. They had four children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Milbourne and 1st husband Sir Thomas Mornington:
2 CONT *Thomas MONINGTON (b. ABT 1488 - d. 17 Jan 1551) 
2 CONT *Richard MONINGTON (b. ABT 1490 - d. AFT 1551)
2 CONT *John MONINGTON (b. ABT 1492 - d. AFT 1551)
2 CONT *Sybil MONINGTON (b. 1496)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Milbourne and 2nd husband John Whittington:
2 CONT *Alexander WHITTINGTON (b. ABT 1508)
2 CONT *Margery WHITTINGTON (b. ABT 1510)
2 CONT *John WHITTINGTON (b. ABT 1512)
2 CONT *Blanche WHITTINGTON (b. ABT 1514)
2 CONT
2 CONT See also:
2 CONT *http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/MILBOURNE.htm#Sybil MILBOURNE1
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ===Elizabeth Milbourne===
2 CONT * F, #54307, b. 1470, d. 1525
2 CONT * Father	Simon Milbourne, Esq., Sheriff of Herefordshire7,4,8,6 b. c 1435, d. 14 Aug 1522
2 CONT * Mother	Jane Baskerville1,7,8 b. c 1451
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Milbourne was born in 1470 at Burghill, Herefordshire, England; Age 59 in 1530.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT married 
2 CONT # Sir Thomas Monington, son of Richard Monington and Ellen Walwyn, before 1 February 1476; They had 3 sons (Thomas, Esq; Richard; John) and 1 daughter (Sibyl, wife of Edward Trye, Esq.).9,2,3,4,5,6 
2 CONT # John Whittington, son of William Whittington and Elizabeth Arundel, after 5 November 1491 at of Solers Hope, Herefordshire, England; They had 3 sons (Thomas; John; & Alexander) and 2 daughters (Margery, wife of Edward Welsh; & J
2 CONC ane, wife of William Harper).10,2,3,5 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Milbourne died in 1525.1,3,5
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Comments==
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ww/whittington1.php  (subscription required to view without interruption)
2 CONT
2 CONT Visitation provides 2 pedigrees for this family, the first shows John 's parentage and shows him as married twice, to Elizabeth Milborne (mother of John, Alexander & Christopher) and to Elizabeth Croftes (mother of Thomas & Willia
2 CONC m). The second starts with John and does not mention the marriage to Elizabeth Croftes, showing Elizabeth Milborne as mother of Thomas, John, Alexander, Margery & Jane. We provisionally combine these as shown below but this is sub
2 CONC ject to review.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
