1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://books.google.com/books?id=L1pNAAAAcAAJ&pg=PA11-IA2&dq=john+leighton+of+wattlesborough&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwjbos-X6rzjAhUHOs0KHR9bA8MQ6AEIQjAF#v=onepage&q=john%20leighton%20of%20wattlesborough&f=false
