2 CONT *'''Matilda Harewell1
2 CONT *F, #496933
2 CONT *Last Edited=17 Nov 2013
2 CONT *'''     Matilda Harewell was the daughter''' of John Harewell.1 '''She married John Leighton''', son of Sir Thomas Leighton and Elizabeth Devereux.1 '''She died, without issue.1
2 CONT *'''      Her married name became Leighton.
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1. [S37] BP2003 volume 2, page 2294. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p49694.htm#i4969
2 CONT
