2 CONC t or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume XII/2, page 845. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT 2.[S1916] Tim Boyle, "re: Boyle Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 16 September 2006. Hereinafter cited as "re: Boyle Family."
2 CONT 3.[S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume XII/2, page 846.
2 CONT 4.[S34] BP1970 page 641. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S34]
