2 CONT '''Elizabeth Hopton Stanley'''
2 CONT '''Birth	1445'''
2 CONT '''England'''
2 CONT '''Death	22 Jun 1498 (aged 52–53)'''
2 CONT '''England'''
2 CONT '''Burial	Burial Details Unknown'''
2 CONT Find a Grave Memorial ID: 104929892
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Hopton Corbet Tiptoft Stanley, Countess of Worcester'''
2 CONT '''Daughter of '''Sir Thomas Hopton and Eleanor Lucy. '''Grand daughter of''' Sir Walter Hopton, descendant of King Henry II, Sir Walter Lucy and Eleanor L'Arcedeken.
2 CONT '''Wife of Sir Robert Corbet''', son of Robert Corbet and his wife, Margaret. '''They were married before 1448, and had two sons and four daughters:'''
2 CONT * Sir Richard, married Elizabeth Devereux
2 CONT * Robert
2 CONT * Anne, wife of Thomas Sturry, Esq
2 CONT * Mary, wife of Thomas Thornes
2 CONT * Jane, wife of Thomas Cressett
2 CONT * Elizabeth, wife of Sir Richard Cholmondeley.
2 CONT '''Sir Roger died 08 Jun 1467 after 19 years of marriage.'''
2 CONT '''Elizabeth married secondly, Sir John Tiptoft, Earl of Worcester. They married at Ludlow about Sept 1467, and received a pardon for marrying without a license dated 09 May 1468. They had one son''', Edward Tiptoft.
2 CONT '''Sir John was beheaded on Tower Hill 18 Oct 1470, buried at Grey Friars, Ludgate.'''
2 CONT '''Elizabeth married thirdly to Sir William Stanley, as his second wife, married before 07 Dec 1471. Sir William was Chamberlain to King Henry VII, Sheriff of Flintshire, Contable of Beaumaris''', son of Sir Thomas Stanley and Joa
2 CONC n Goushill. '''They had one son and two daughters:'''
2 CONT * William
2 CONT * Wife of Sir John Warburton
2 CONT * Katherine, wife of Thomas Cocat
2 CONT '''Sir William was found guilty of treason, as he supported Perkin Warbeck, and beheaded on Tower Hill 16 Feb 1495.'''
2 CONT '''Elizabeth died 22 June 1498.'''
2 CONT Family Members
