3 TEXT Inquisitions Post Mortem for Elizabeth late the wife of William Stanley, knight.
4 CONT She died 22 June last [1498]. One Robert Corbet, esquire, is her cousin [grandson] and heir, viz. son and heir of the said Richard Corbet, her son and heir. The said Robert Corbet is son and heir of the said Richard of his body be
4 CONC gotten, and is also cousin [grandson] and heir of the said Roger, viz. son of the said Richard, son of the said Roger, and he is aged 21 and more.
