1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==changes to be made by a curator==
2 CONT * Name/Suffix: '''of Moreton Corbet
2 CONT * Name/Display Name: (blank)
2 CONT * Place of Birth/State/Province: (blank)
2 CONT * Place of Birth/Country: '''England
2 CONT * Place of Death/State/Province: (blank)
2 CONT * Place of Death/Country: '''England
2 CONT
2 CONT ==brief biography==
2 CONT Potholed, but known to have inherited his father's estates in 1439 and to have sat in Parliament in 1439 and 1447.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Surname has also been reported to be [https://www.geni.com/surnames/corbett Corbett].
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been (erroneously?) reported to be June 5, 1467 at Moreton Corbet, Shropshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==sources==
2 CONT * "Close Rolls, Edward IV: 1468-1469", in Calendar of Close Rolls, Edward IV: Volume 2, 1468-1476, ed. W H B Bird and K H Ledward (London, 1953), pp. 1-6. British History Online http://www.british-history.ac.uk/cal-close-rolls/edw
2 CONC 4/vol2/pp1-6 [accessed 9 September 2017].
2 CONT
2 CONT ==links==
2 CONT * http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1386-1421/member/corbet-robert-1383-1420
2 CONT
