1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *Elizabeth Hopton1,2,3,4,5,6 
2 CONT *F, b. circa 1427, d. 22 June 1498
2 CONT *Father      Sir Thomas Hopton2,7,4,8 b. c 1399, d. a 1445
2 CONT *Mother     Eleanor Lucy2,7,4,8 d. b 1460
2 CONT *     Elizabeth Hopton was born circa 1427 at of Staunton-on-Arrow, Herefordshire, England; Age 34 in 1461.9,3,4,5 She married Sir Roger Corbet, son of Robert Corbet, Esq., Sheriff of Shropshire and Margaret Mallory, before 1448; 
2 CONC They had 2 sons (Sir Richard; & Robert) and 4 daughters (Anne, wife of Thomas Sturry, Esq; Mary, wife of Thomas Thornes, Esq; Jane, wife of Thomas Cresssett, Esq; & ''''''Elizabeth, wife of Sir Richard Cholmondeley).2,3,4,5'''''' 
2 CONC Elizabeth Hopton married Sir John Tiptoft, 1st Earl of Worcester, 2nd Lord Tiptoft, Lord High Treasurer, Constable of England & the Tower of London, son of Sir John Tiptoft, 1st Lord Tiptoft, Speaker of the House of Commons, Chief
2 CONC  Butler, Treasurer of the Exchequer, Seneschal of Landes & Aquitaine and Joyce de Cherleton, circa September 1467 at Ludlow, Shropshire, England; Pardon for marrying without a license granted 9 May 1468. They had 1 son (Edward, 2n
2 CONC d Earl of Worcester, 3rd Lord Tiptoft).10,2,3,4,5 Elizabeth Hopton married Sir William Stanley, Sheriff of Flintshire, son of Sir Thomas Stanley, Lord Lieutenant of Ireland, Lord of Latham and Knowsley, 1st Lord Stanley, Constable
2 CONC  & Justice of Chester and Joan Goushill, before 7 December 1471; They supposedly had 1 son (William) and 2 daughters (Joan & Katherine).11,2,3,4,5,6 Elizabeth Hopton died on 22 June 1498.2,4,5
2 CONT *Family 1      Sir Roger Corbet b. c 1415, d. 8 Jun 1467
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Jane Corbet+3,12,5,13 b. c 1447
2 CONT **Mary Corbet+14,3,15,5 b. c 1449
2 CONT **Sir Richard Corbet+16,5 b. 1451, d. 6 Dec 1493
2 CONT *Family 2      Sir John Tiptoft, 1st Earl of Worcester, 2nd Lord Tiptoft, Lord High Treasurer, Constable of England & the Tower of London b. 8 May 1427, d. 18 Oct 1470
2 CONT *Family 3      Sir William Stanley, Sheriff of Flintshire d. 16 Feb 1495
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **Jane Stanley+17,3 b. c 1472
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S2810] Unknown author, The Complete Peerage, by Cokayne, Vol. VIII, p. 263; Lineage and Ancestry of HRH Prince Charles by Paget, Vol. II, p. 445; Plantagenet Ancestry of 17th Century Colonists, by David Faris, p. 103.
2 CONT * 2.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 200.
2 CONT * 3.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 472-473.
2 CONT * 4.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 451.
2 CONT * 5.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 67-68.
