1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See Peter Bartrum, http://cadair.aber.ac.uk/dspace/bitstream/handle/2160/5373/BLEDDYN%20AP%20MAENYRCH%202%28A2%29_166.png?sequence=3&isAllowed=y (August 14, 2017; Anne Brannen, curator)
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Cornwall was born in 1493. He was the son of Sir Thomas Cornwall and Anne Corbet. He married Janet Wogan, daughter of Henry Wogan. He died in 1569.  Richard Cornwall succeeded to the title of 9th Baron of Burford, Shropshi
2 CONC re [feudal barony] in 1538. He also had two daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT src: http://thepeerage.com/p32804.htm#i328034
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Richard Cornwall and Janet Wogan:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.Edmund Cornwall b. 1537, d. 1585
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.Thomas Cornwall b. 1538, d. 1615
2 CONT
2 CONT Other children need documentation.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://archive.org/stream/houseofcornewall00live#page/n262/mode/1up
2 CONT
2 CONT Shows the children of Richard & Janet as:
2 CONT
2 CONT *1. Edmund, 10th Baron, s.p.
2 CONT * 2. Thomas, 11th Baron, married Katherine Harley, widow of John Cresset
2 CONT *3.  Mary, married James Warmcombe, M.P.
2 CONT * 4. Anne, married Francis Walsh
