1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Elizabeth Vernon'''
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Elizabeth VERNON
2 CONT *'''Born: ABT 1479, Haddon Hall, Derbyshire, England
2 CONT *'''Died: 29 Mar 1563, Moreton Corbet, Shropshire, England
2 CONT *Father: Henry VERNON of Tong (Sir Knight)
2 CONT *Mother: Anne TALBOT
2 CONT *'''Married: Robert CORBET (Sir Knight) (b. ABT 1477 - d. 11 Apr 1513) (son of Richard Corbet and Elizabeth Devereux) 1497, Haddon Hall, Derbyshire, England
2 CONT *Children: 
2 CONT **1. Dorothy CORBET (b. ABT 1500) (m. Sir Richard Mainwaring)
2 CONT **2. Roger CORBET (b. 1502 - d. 20 Dec 1538) (m. Anne Windsor)
2 CONT **3. Margery CORBET (b. BET 1510 / 1519)
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/VERNON.htm
2 CONT *______________
2 CONT *The royal lineage of our noble and gentle families. Together with their paternal ancestry .. Vol. 1
2 CONT *http://www.archive.org/stream/royallineageofou01fost#page/n100/mode/1up/search/Hill
2 CONT *'''SIR ROBERT CORBET, of Moreton Corbet, and of Dallington, Northants, sheriff Salop, 1507, died 11 April, 1513, Buried a Moreton; he married Elizabeth, daughter and heir of Sir Henry Vernon, of Haddon, co. Derby; she died 29 Mar
2 CONC ch, 1563, having been a widow 50 years, and having lived to see 233 descendants of her own body, and left behind her the character of an amiable and virtuous lady;" she had, with 4 daughters, 3 sons. 
2 CONT *[1] Sir Roger, of Moreton Corbet, Knt., sheriff Salop, 1530 died 20 Dec., 1538; he married Anne, daughter of Andrew Lord Windsor, of Stanwell, Middlesex; her will proved July, 1543; Had, with other issue, a son, . . . 
2 CONT *___________________________
2 CONT *'''Sir Robert Corbet1
2 CONT *'''M, #149122, d. 11 April 1513
2 CONT *Last Edited=3 Jun 2008
2 CONT *'''Sir Robert Corbet died on 11 April 1513.2
2 CONT *''' Sir Robert Corbet lived at Moreton Corbet, Shropshire, England.1 He held the office of Sheriff of Shropshire in 1501.2
2 CONT *'''Children of Sir Robert Corbet 
2 CONT **1.Ann Corbet+1
2 CONT **2.Sir Roger Corbet+2 d. 1538
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 1, page 481. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Pe
2 CONC erage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT *2.[S34] Peter Townend, editor, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 105th edition (London, U.K.: Burke's Peerage Ltd, 1970), page 641. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Peerage, 105th ed.
2 CONT *From: http://thepeerage.com/p14913.htm#i 149122
2 CONT *_____________
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Robert Corbett (1476 - 1513)
2 CONT
