2 CONT '''Mother'''	Elizabeth Vernon b. c 1479, d. 29 Mar 1563
2 CONT '''     Roger Corbet was born on 24 June 1501 at of Moreton Corbet, Shropshire, England. He married Anne Windsor''', daughter of Sir Andrew Windsor, 1st Lord Windsor of Stanwell, Keeper of the Great Wardrobe, Steward of New Windso
2 CONC r, Trier of Petitions in the House of Lords and Elizabeth Blount, '''circa 1520.1 Roger Corbet died on 20 December 1538 at Lyncheslade, Buckinghamshire, England, at age 37'''.
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''Anne Windsor''' b. c 1501, d. b 1543
