1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William Corbet, son of John le Corbet and Margaret, dau. of Sir Thomas le Blount m. Alice, dau. of Thomas Lacon of Willey.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Thomas LACON b 1477 d1533 Willey,Salop and Maria CORBET of Moreton Corbet, Salop. have a daughter:
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice LACON b abt 1533 Willey,Salop d 8 May 1573 Worthen, Salop. She married William CORBET. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Their son was Thomas CORBET of Aston Co. Salop married Elizabeth WILLIAMS, daughter of Thomas williams of Willaston, sheriff of Montgomeryshire in 1560 and of Salop in 1582. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Their daughter Is Ann CORBET. Richard GRIFFITHS (Recorder of Powys) d1613 m Ann CORBETT b 1Nov 1568 Worthen, Shropshire Richard GRIFFITHS (attorney)b 1605 d10 May 1685 Glanhavren,
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
