2 CONT *Notes: See his Biography.
2 CONT *Father: William BOURCHIER (V. Bourchier)
2 CONT *Mother: Anne WOODVILLE (V. Bourchier/C. Kent)
2 CONT *'''Married: Mary BLOUNT (C. Essex) ABT 1498
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. Anne (Claire) BOURCHIER (16° B. Bourchier)
