1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Mary Grey1,2
2 CONT *'''F, #48645, b. circa 1494, d. 22 February 1538
2 CONT *Father      Sir Thomas Grey, 1st Marquess of Dorset, Lord Ferrers, Constable of the Tower of London & Ruthland Castle3,2 b. c 1455, d. 30 Aug 1501
2 CONT *Mother     Cecily Bonville3,2 b. 1461, d. 12 Apr 1530 or 12 May 1530
2 CONT *'''     Mary Grey was born circa 1494 at of Groby, Leicestershire, England.1 She married Sir Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford, son of John Devereux, 3rd Lord Ferrers and Cicely Bourchier, before 3 May 1501.1 Mary Grey died 
2 CONC on 22 February 1538; Buried at Church of Stowe, Chartley.1
2 CONT *'''Family      Sir Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford b. 1491, d. 17 Sep 1558
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Sir Richard Devereux+4 b. c 1516, d. 13 Oct 1547
2 CONT **Sir William Devereux+5 b. c 1525, d. b 2 Nov 1579
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S11568] The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom, by George Edward Cokayne, Vol. V, p. 326-327.
2 CONT * 2.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 359.
2 CONT * 3.[S11568] The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom, by George Edward Cokayne, Vol. V, p. 327.
2 CONT * 4.[S11568] The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom, by George Edward Cokayne, Vol. V, p. 140, notes.
2 CONT * 5.[S11568] The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom, by George Edward Cokayne, Vol. VI, p. 478-9.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1618.htm#i48645 __________________
2 CONT *'''Lady Mary Grey
2 CONT *'''F, #183417, d. 22 February 1534
2 CONT *Last Edited=2 May 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.51%
2 CONT *'''     Lady Mary Grey was the daughter of Thomas Grey, 1st Marquess of Dorset and Cecilia Bonville, Baroness Bonville and Harington.1 She married Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford, son of John Devereux, 2nd Lord Ferrers (of
2 CONC  Chartley) and Cicely Bourchier, before 15 December 1530.2 She died on 22 February 1534.3
2 CONT *'''      From before 15 December 1530, her married name became Devereux.
2 CONT *'''Children of Lady Mary Grey and Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford
2 CONT ** 1.Sir Richard Devereux+3 d. 13 Oct 1547
2 CONT ** 2.Sir William Devereux+1
2 CONT ** 3.Henry Devereux3
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S3470] Marian Hastings, "re: Hastings Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 31 Deember 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Hastings Family."
2 CONT * 2.[S37] BP2003 volume 2, page 1875. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT * 3.[S37] BP2003. [S37]
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p18342.htm#i183417 ___________________
