1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *NOTE THAT WIKIPEDIA LISTS MARGARET GARNEYS AS THE DAU. OF ROBERT GARNEYS IN WILLIAM WILLOUGHBY, 1ST BARON WILLOUGHBY'S BIO ANDTHE DAU. OF JOHN GARNEYS IN WALTER DEVEREUX, 1ST VISCOUNT HEREFORD'S BIO  _____________
2 CONC __________
2 CONT *'''Margaret Garneys
2 CONT *'''F, #67731, b. circa 1520, d. after 12 February 1594
2 CONT *Father      Robert Garneys
2 CONT *Mother     Ann Bacon
2 CONT *'''     Margaret Garneys was born circa 1520. She married Sir Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford, son of John Devereux, 3rd Lord Ferrers and Cicely Bourchier, after 22 February 1538; His 2nd wife.1 Margaret Garneys died after
2 CONC  12 February 1594.
2 CONT *'''Family      Sir Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford b. 1491, d. 17 Sep 1558
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **Sir Edward Devereux+ b. 3 Aug 1558, d. 22 Sep 1622
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S74] Brent Ruesch's Research Notes.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2254.htm#i67731 ______________________
2 CONT *'''Walter DEVEREUX (1° V. Hereford)
2 CONT *Born: 1488, Chartley, Staffordshire, England
2 CONT *Acceded: 1550
2 CONT *Died: 17 Sep 1558, Chartley
2 CONT *Buried: Stowe Church, Chartley, Staffordshire, England
2 CONT *Notes: Knight of the Garter. B. Ferrers of Chartley. The Complete Peerage vol.V, pp.326-328. Present at the capture of Boulogne.
2 CONT *Father: John DEVEREUX (2º B. Ferrers of Chartley)
2 CONT *Mother: Cecille BOURCHIER (B. Ferrers of Chartley)
2 CONT *Married 1: Mary GREY BEF 15 Dec 1503
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. Richard DEVEREUX (Sir Knight)
2 CONT **2. Edward DEVEREUX
2 CONT **3. William DEVEREUX (Sir)
2 CONT **4. Catherine DEVEREUX
2 CONT **5. Henry DEVEREUX
2 CONT *'''Married 2: Margaret GARNEYS (V. Hereford) (m.2 William Willoughby, Lord Parham) ABT 1557, England
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **6. Edward DEVEREUX
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/DEVEREUX.htm#Walter DEVEREUX (1° V. Hereford) ______________________
2 CONT *'''William WILLOUGHBY (1° B. Willoughby of Parham)
2 CONT *Born: ABT 1515, Parham, Suffolk, England
2 CONT *Acceded: 20 Feb 1547
2 CONT *Died: 30 Jul 1570, Minting Park, Lincolnshire, England
2 CONT *Buried: 15 Aug 1570, Parham Church, Suffolk, England
2 CONT *Notes: See his Biography.
2 CONT *Father: Christopher WILLOUGHBY of Parham (Sir)
2 CONT *Mother: Elizabeth TALBOYS
2 CONT *Married 1: Elizabeth HENEAGE (B. Willoughby of Parham) ABT 1535
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. Charles WILLOUGHBY (2° B. Willoughby of Parham)
2 CONT **2. Mary WILLOUGHBY
2 CONT *'''Married 2: Margaret GARNEYS (V. Hereford) (w. of Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford) AFT 20 Aug 1559 
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/WILLOUGHBY2.htm#William WILLOUGHBY (1° B. Willoughby of Parham) ____________________________
2 CONT *'''Walter DEVEREUX (1° V. Hereford)
2 CONT *Born: 1488, Chartley, Staffordshire, England
2 CONT *Acceded: 1550
2 CONT *Died: 17 Sep 1558, Chartley
2 CONT *Buried: Stowe Church, Chartley, Staffordshire, England
2 CONT *Notes: Knight of the Garter. B. Ferrers of Chartley. The Complete Peerage vol.V, pp.326-328. Present at the capture of Boulogne.
2 CONT *Father: John DEVEREUX (2º B. Ferrers of Chartley)
2 CONT *Mother: Cecille BOURCHIER (B. Ferrers of Chartley)
2 CONT *Married 1: Mary GREY BEF 15 Dec 1503
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. Richard DEVEREUX (Sir Knight)
2 CONT **2. Edward DEVEREUX
2 CONT **3. William DEVEREUX (Sir)
2 CONT **4. Catherine DEVEREUX
2 CONT **5. Henry DEVEREUX
2 CONT *'''Married 2: Margaret GARNEYS (V. Hereford) (m.2 William Willoughby, Lord Parham) ABT 1557, England
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **6. Edward DEVEREUX
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/DEVEREUX.htm#Walter DEVEREUX (1° V. Hereford) ____________________
2 CONT *'''Margaret Garneys1
2 CONT *'''F, #438023, d. 1599
2 CONT *Last Edited=18 Jul 2010
2 CONT *'''Margaret Garneys was the daughter of John Garneys.1 She married, firstly, Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford, son of John Devereux, 2nd Lord Ferrers (of Chartley) and Cicely Bourchier.1 She married, secondly, William Willo
2 CONC ughby, 1st Baron Willoughby of Parham, son of Sir Christoppher Willoughby and Elizabeth Talboys.1 She died in 1599.1
2 CONT *'''     Her married name became Willoughby.1 Her married name became Devereux.1
2 CONT *'''Children of Margaret Garneys and Walter Devereux, 1st Viscount Hereford
2 CONT **1.Sir Edward Devereux, 1st Bt.+2 d. 22 Sep 1622
2 CONT **2.Katherine Devereux1
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 2, page 1876. Hereinafter cited as Burke's P
2 CONC eerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT *2.[S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT *From: http://thepeerage.com/p43803.htm#i438023 ____________________
