2 CONT *http://books.google.com/books?id=u6IaAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA626&lpg=PA626&dq=Edward+Devereux+1622&source=bl&ots=5n3hw1Kxqt&sig=UOhFYMa3GBJoLAQgFcV--BMkbdg&hl=en&ei=MhC0TK2JIYi-sAOY7KWeCA&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=3&ved=0CBsQ6AE
