2 CONT *Pg.1001 ____________________
2 CONT *'''Peerage of England. ... By Arthur Collins
2 CONT *http://books.google.com/books?id=yFI5AAAAMAAJ&pg=PA18&lpg=PA18&dq=Edward+Devereux+1622&source=bl&ots=nSAZflRMtL&sig=I0NcpiAbDkPygT8fmi5_s4q4q9Y&hl=en&ei=lgu0TLG7HYPAsAOTxd3jCA&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=10&ved=0CC8Q6AEw
2 CONC CTgK#v=onepage&q=Edward%20Devereux%201622&f=false
