1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sir David Owen, was a Constable of Winchester, Sheriff of Hampshire born c 1459.  His wife was Mary Bohun born  c 1468, d. bt 1495 - 1500 Sourve - http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2832.htm#
