2 CONT Father	Owen ap Meridith ap Tudor Tudor, Esq.2,8,9 b. c 1400, d. 4 Feb 1461
2 CONT
2 CONT      Sir David Owen, Constable of Winchester, Sheriff of Hampshire was born illegitimate circa 1459 at of Pembrokeshire, England; He was illegitimate. Age 70 in 1529.10,2,8,9 He married Mary Bohun, daughter of John Bohun, Esq. and
2 CONC  Anne Arderne, before 1492; His 1st wife. They had 3 sons (Sir Henry; Sir Jasper; & Roger) & 1 daughter (Anne, wife of Sir Arthur Hopton).11,12,2,3,4,9,7 Sir David Owen, Constable of Winchester, Sheriff of Hampshire married Anne B
2 CONC lount, daughter of Sir William Blount, Sheriff of Nottinghamshire & Derbyshire and Margaret Echingham, before 1500; His 2nd wife. No issue.4,5,9 Sir David Owen, Constable of Winchester, Sheriff of Hampshire married Anne Devereux, 
2 CONC daughter of John Devereux, 3rd Lord Ferrers and Cicely Bourchier, before 1525; His 3rd wife. They had 2 sons (Henry; & John, Esq.) & 1 daughter (Elizabeth, wife of Sir Thomas Burgh).1,4,9,6 Sir David Owen, Constable of Winchester,
2 CONC  Sheriff of Hampshire left a will on 20 February 1530.2,4,6 He wrote a codicil on 6 May 1535.4,6 He was buried circa 27 September 1535 at Easebourne Priory, Sussex, England.4,6 His estate was probated on 13 May 1542; He also had 1
2 CONC  illegitimate son (William) & 1 illegitimate daughter (Barbara).4,6
2 CONT
