1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =HOWEL AP THOMAS HERBERT=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Sir Thomas ap Gwilym, Kt. and Mawd Morley 
2 CONT * See Peter Bartrum, http://cadair.aber.ac.uk/dspace/bitstream/handle/2160/4939/godwin%205.png?sequence=1&isAllowed=y (January 19, 2018; Anne Brannen, curator)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[http://the45thsurg.freeservers.com/Ancestors/Descendants%20of%20Charles%20I%20Charlemagne%20Emperor%20Holy%20Roman%20Empire%20Carolingian%20Mothers%20Lineage%202.pdf Descendants of Charles I (Charlemagne) Emperor Holy Roman Emp
2 CONC ire Carolingian]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Generation 20'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''20. THOMAS AP WILLIAM HERBERT''' (#20)  Guillem Ap Jenken,( #19), Jenken Ap Adam, (#18) Adam Ap, (#17) Reginald, Reginald (#16), Sir Reginald FitzPiers (#15), Piers PeterFitzHerbert (#14), Herbert FITZHERBERT( #13), Herbert Fit
2 CONC zHerbert,Lord of Bladen (#12), Herbert The Chamberlain DeWinchester (#11), Peter Piers DeVermandois ( #10), Otto Eudes of Vermandois (#9), Hubert III Vermandois(  #8), Albert I Vermandois (#7), Herbert II Senlis Comte de Vermandoi
2 CONC s (#6), Heribert I Senlis Comte de Vermandois (#5), Pepin Quentin II Vermandois de Senlis (#4), Bernard "King of Italy (#3) Carolingian, Pepin I (Carloman) "'King of Italy" (#2) Carolingian, Charles I (Charlemagne) Emperor Holy Ro
2 CONC man EmpireCarolingian (#1).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''THOMAS AP WILLIAM HERBERT''' was born in 1372 in Perth Hir, Monmouthshire, Wales. He died on 04 July 1438 in Raglan Castle, Monmouthshire, Wales. '''He married Maud Morley''' in 1402 in Ragland, , Monmouthshire, England. She wa
2 CONC s born in 1381 in Ragland, Wales. She died on 04 Jul 1438 in Ragland Castle, Monmouthshire, Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Thomas ap William Herbert and Maud Morley had the following''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Child:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Generation 21'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * 21. i. '''HOWEL AP THOMAS HERBERT''' (#21) son of Thomas ap William Herbert and Maud Morley was born in 1405 in Raglan, Monmouthshire, Wales. He died in 1446 in Castle McPherson, Scotland. '''He married CATHERINE VERCH GRONOW AP
2 CONC  IVOR HIR.''' She was born in 1407 in Perth, Monomouthshire, Wales. She died in Apr 1965 in Perth Hir, Monmouthshire, Wales. '''He married (2) BLEDDYN AP MAENYRCH''' in 1421 in Hereford, Herefordshire, , England. She was born in 1
2 CONC 395 in Brecknock, Breconshire, , Wales. She died in 1454. '''He married (3) GWLADYS GAM''' in 1421 in Hereford, Herefordshire, , England. She was born in 1405 in Llan, Breconshire, , Wales. She died in 1454 in Priory Church, Aberg
2 CONC avenny, Monmouthshire, England. '''He married MISS HUNTLEY. She was born in 1405.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Catherine verch Gronow ap Ivor Hir had the following children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''HOPKIN POWELL HERBERT''' (son of Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Catherine verch Gronow ap Ivor Hir) was born in 1438 in Whitchurch, Buckinghamshire, , England. He died in 1478 in Whitchurch, Buckinghamshire, England. He married 
2 CONC CATHERINE HUNTLEY in 1465 in Perth Hir, Monmouthshire, Wales. She was born in 1440 in Perth Hir, Monmouthshire, , Wales. She died in Whitechurch, Buckinghamshire, , England.
2 CONT * '''RICHARD POWELL HERBERT''' (son of Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Catherine verch Gronow ap Ivor Hir) was born in 1430.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Bleddyn Ap Maenyrch had the following child:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * RICHARD HERBERT (son of Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Bleddyn Ap Maenyrch) was born in 1422 in , Monmouthshire, , Wales. He died in 1469 in , Oxfordshire, ,
2 CONT England.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Gwladys Gam had the following children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''MARGRED HERBERT''' (daughter of Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Gwladys Gam) was
2 CONT born in 1429 in Rhaglan, Usk, Monmouthshire, England. She died in 1519 in Y, Somme, Picardie, France.
2 CONT * '''THOMAS DAV HERBERT''' (daughter of Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Gwladys Gam) was born in 1429.
2 CONT * '''ELIZABETH VERCH WILLIAM HERBERT''' (daughter of Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Gwladys Gam) was born in 1427 in Ragland, Mingo, West Virginia, United States. She died in 1485 in Raglan, Monmouthshire, , Wales.
2 CONT * '''RICHARD HERBERT''' (son of Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Gwladys Gam) was born in 1425.
2 CONT * '''WILLIAM HERBERT''' (son of Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Gwladys Gam) was born in 1423 in Pembroke, Herefordshire, , England. He died in 1469 in Northampton, North Carolina, United States.
2 CONT * '''THOMAS HERBERT''' (son of Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Gwladys Gam) was born in 1422 in Ragland, , Mon, England. He died in Y, Somme, Picardie, France.
2 CONT * '''RICHARD HERBERT''' (son of Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Gwladys Gam) was born in 1412 in Coldbrook, , Abergavenny, England. He died in 1469 in Banbury, Northamptonshire, , England.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Miss Huntley had the following children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''HUGH POWELL''' (son of Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Miss Huntley) was born in
2 CONT 1425.
2 CONT '''* ROGER POWELL''' (son of Howel ap Thomas Herbert and Miss Huntley) was born in 1422.
