2 CONT * http://www.thepeerage.com/p10736.htm#i107358
2 CONT * https://histfam.familysearch.org//getperson.php?personID=I3552&tree=EuropeRoyalNobleHous
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Alt dealth date 1509
