1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT "Edward Stafford, 3rd Duke of Buckingham, KG (3 February 1478 – 17 May 1521) was an English nobleman. He was the son of Henry Stafford, 2nd Duke of Buckingham, and Katherine Woodville, whose sister, Queen Elizabeth Woodville, was 
2 CONC the wife of King Edward IV. He was convicted of treason, and executed on 17 May 1521."
2 CONT
