2 CONT *''''''Elizabeth Stafford1,2,3 
2 CONT *''''''F, d. between 1 January 1530 and 11 May 1532
2 CONT *Father    Sir Henry Stafford, 2nd Duke Buckingham, 7th Earl of Stafford, 8th Lord Stafford2,3 b. 4 Sep 1455, d. 2 Nov 1483
2 CONT *Mother    Katherine Woodville1,2,3 b. c 1458, d. 18 May 1497
2 CONT *''''''     Elizabeth Stafford married Sir Robert Radcliffe, 1st Earl Sussex, Viscount FitzWalter, 7th Lord FitzWalter, Great Chamberlain of England, son of Sir John Radcliffe, 6th Lord FitzWalter, Joint High Steward of England an
2 CONC d Margaret Whetehill, circa 23 July 1505; They had 3 sons (Sir Henry, 2nd Earl of Sussex; Sir Humphrey; & George, Esq.).1,4,2 Elizabeth Stafford died between 1 January 1530 and 11 May 1532; Buried finally at Boreham, Essex, Englan
2 CONC d.
2 CONT *''''''Family     Sir Robert Radcliffe, 1st Earl Sussex, Viscount FitzWalter, 7th Lord FitzWalter, Great Chamberlain of England b. c 1483, d. 27 Nov 1542
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **◦Sir Henry Radcliffe, 2nd Earl of Sussex, Viscount FitzWalter5 b. c 1507, d. 17 Feb 1557
2 CONT *Citations
