2 CONT * 3.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. I, p. 374.
2 CONT * 4.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 174-175.
2 CONT * 5.[S11568] The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom, by George Edward Cokayne, Vol. XII/1, p. 520.
2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1758.htm#i52837
2 CONT
