1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See Peter Bartrum, https://cadair.aber.ac.uk/dspace/bitstream/handle/2160/6197/BODENHAM_269.png?sequence=1&isAllowed=y (February 23, 2018; Anne Brannen, curator)
2 CONT
2 CONT Please see Peter Bartrum: Cydifor Fawr 14 (A1); https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173398954843 & Bodenham; https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173398963844 (Steven Ferry, May 17, 2025.)
2 CONT
