2 CONT ***	  m. John Clinton, 7th Lord (d 04.06.1515)
2 CONT ***	(4)+ other issue ( a 1491) - Philip, Lewis, William
2 CONT * .... etc.
2 CONT * 'Bodenham2'
2 CONT *Roger Bodenham of Rotherwas (d 1514)
2 CONT *  m. Joane Bromwich (dau of Thomas Bromwich in Hampton Bishop)
2 CONT **	1. Thomas Bodenham of Rotherwas (d 1538-9)
2 CONT **	   m. Jane Yorke (dau of John York of Ramesbury, sister of Thomas, m2. Stephen Parry of Morehampton)
2 CONT ***		A. Roger Bodenham of Rotherwas (d 1579)
2 CONT ***		  m. Jane Whyttington (dau of Thomas Whyttington or Whittington of Pauntley or Pantley)
2 CONT ****			i. Thomas Bodenham of Rotherwas (b 1544, dsp 1583)
2 CONT ****			ii. Sir Roger Bodenham of Rotherwas (b 1545)
2 CONT ****			  m. (1582) Bridget Baskerville (dau of Sir Humphrey Baskerville of Erdisley Castle)
2 CONT *****				a. .... etc.
2 CONT ****			iii. John Bodenham (d young)
2 CONT ****			iv. Elizabeth Bodenham (b 1543)
2 CONT ****			  m. Thomas Morgan of Machen
2 CONT ****			v. Margaret Bodenham
2 CONT ****			  m1. William Games
2 CONT ****			  m2. John Pye
2 CONT ***		B. John Bodenham of Hereford
2 CONT ***'''		C. Catherine Bodenham
2 CONT ***'''		  m. William Morgan of Tredeger (dsp before 27.06.1569)
2 CONT ***		D. Anne Bodenham
2 CONT ***		  m1. Walter Williams of Llanfwyst
2 CONT ***		  m2. William Price of Llanfwyst
2 CONT **	2. .... etc.
