2 CONC 32): 37t-379. ''Call. Top. el Gen''. 2 (1835):1 ó0–161 (Greystock ped: “Ralph Ld. Greystock t1] - Elizabeth, dau. of Wm. Lord Fitzhugh. = 2. EIiz. dau.of John Terell, sister of Sor James Terell") 5 (1838)! 313–317 (sub Greystoke).
