2 CONT * '''Children of Ralph Greystoke, Knt.. by Elizabeth Fitz Hugh.'''
2 CONT ** i. ROBERT GREYSTOKE, Knt. [See next].
2 CONT ** ii. MARGERY GREYSTOKE, married Thomas Gray, Knt. of Heaton (in Norham), Northumberland [see GRAY 11].[Ancestors of John Fenwick]
2 CONT ** iii. ELIZABETH GREYSTOKE, married (1st) THOMAS SCROPE, Knt., 5th Lord Scrope of Masham [see SCROPE 8]; [Ancestors of Anne Mauleverer] (2nd) GILBERT TALBOT, K.G., of Grafton, Worcestershire [see TALBOT 11].[Ancestors of Thomas R
