2 CONT *Mother	Elizabeth FitzHugh13,14,15 d. 20 Mar 1469
2 CONT *'''     Sir Robert Greystoke was born circa 1438 at of Greystoke, Cumberland, England. He married Elizabeth Grey''', daughter of Sir Edmund Grey, 1st Earl of Kent, 4th Baron Grey of Ruthin, Lord High Treasurer and Katherine Percy
2 CONC , '''circa 1470; They had 1 daughter''' (Elizabeth, wife of Sir Thomas, 3rd Lord Dacre of the North).2,16,4,5,6,9,10,11 '''Sir Robert Greystoke and Margaret Grey obtained a marriage license on 19 January 1475; Date of Dispensation
2 CONC  for being related in the 3rd degree of affinity. No issue.2,17,6,7,11,12 Sir Robert Greystoke died on 17 June 1483.2,6,11
2 CONT *'''Family 1     Elizabeth Grey b. c 1448, d. 18 Jul 1472
