2 CONT *'''Sir Robert de Greystoke1
2 CONT *'''M, #90, d. 17 June 1483
2 CONT *Last Edited=1 Nov 2014
2 CONT *'''     Sir Robert de Greystoke was the son''' of Ralph de Greystoke, 5th Lord Greystoke.2 '''He married Lady Elizabeth Grey''', daughter of Edmund Grey, 1st Earl of Kent and Lady Catherine Percy, '''before 1483.3 He died on 17 J
2 CONC une 1483, without male issue.1
2 CONT *'''Child of Sir Robert de Greystoke and Lady Elizabeth Grey
2 CONT **Elizabeth Greystoke, Baroness Greystoke+2 d. 1516
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinct
2 CONC  or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume VI, page 199. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT *[S37] BP2003 volume 1, page 1013. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
