2 CONT BIOGRAPHY
2 CONT
2 CONT The order in which he married his two wives has been wrongly recorded in the Complete Peerage. However, it is established by a dispensation in the Calendar of Papal Registers: Letters, vol 13, Pt 1 (1995): 425. The document reads 
2 CONC as follows: Date : 19 January 1474/5: 'Mandate to the bishop of Lincoln. Mandate to dispense Robert Greystoke, layman, and Margaret Grey, mulier, of the said bishop's diocese, to marry, notwithstanding that they are related in the
2 CONC  third degree of affinity, because the late Elizabeth Grey, also Robert's wife, was related to the said Margaret in the third degree of kindred.'
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 	1. [S00119]   The Lineage and Ancestry of H.R.H. Prince Charles, Prince of Wales, Edinburgh, 1977, Paget, Gerald, Reference: Q 116391
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. [S00120]   Cahiers de Saint Louis , Dupont, Jacques and Saillot, Jacques, Reference: 98,912
