2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Greystoke was the daughter of Ralph de Greystoke, 5th Lord Greystoke and Elizabeth FitzHugh.1 She married Edmund Hastings, son of John Hastings, on 5 July 1479.1 She died on 30 September 1496 at Roxby, Yorkshire, EnglandG.1
2 CONT
2 CONT From 5 July 1479, her married name became Hastings.1
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # https://www.thepeerage.com/p46142.htm#i461411
2 CONT ## [S3470] Marian Hastings, "re: Hastings Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 31 Deember 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Hastings Family."
