2 CONT Charles Somerset, 1st Earl of Worcester was born illegitimately circa 1460, the son of Henry Beaufort, 2nd Duke of Somerset and Joan Hill. He m(1)Elizabeth Herbert, Baroness Herbert, daughter of William Herbert, 2nd Earl of Pembro
2 CONC ke and Mary Wydeville, on 2 June 1492 and (2) Elizabeth West, daughter of Sir Thomas West, 8th Lord la Warre and Elizabeth Mortimer, after 1513 and (3) Eleanor Sutton, daughter of Edward Sutton, 2nd Lord Dudley and Cicely Willough
2 CONC by, after 1514. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Charles Somerset, 1st Earl of Worcester and Elizabeth West 
2 CONT 1.Lady Mary Somerset 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Charles Somerset, 1st Earl of Worcester and Elizabeth Herbert, Baroness Herbert  1.Henry Somerset, 2nd Earl of Worcester b. c 1496, d. 26 Nov 1549 
2 CONT
2 CONT  (Royal Ancestry) He died on 15 April 1526.3 He was buried at St. George's Chapel, Windsor Castle, Windsor, Berkshire, England.3 His will was proven (by probate) on 20 November 1526.
2 CONT
2 CONT Captain of the Yeoman of the Guard 1486 Knight for the Body to King Henry VII 1486-1503 Constable of Abergavenny, Cardiff, Helmsley, Monmouth, Montgomery, Pains, Ruthin and Usk Castles Captain and Admiral of the Fleet 1488-9 Vice-
2 CONC Chamberlain of the Household 1501 Steward of Ewyas Lacy and Monmouth 1503 Privy Councillor 1505 Lord Chamberlain of the Household 1508-26 Sheriff of Glamorgan 1509 Joint Steward of the Liberties of the Archbishop of Canterbury 150
2 CONC 9 Chancellor and Chief Forester of Glamorgan 1515 Lord Herbert
