2 NOTE very interesting note added about King Richard III:
3 CONT The scientific tests on the skeleton have been at the centre of an ongoing investigation. There has been a very interesting TV program using the skeleton to look in detail at how much Edward's significant disablement would affect 
3 CONC his ability to take part in a battle wearing heavy armour. A victim of scoliosis volunteered to take part in the study he was trained in battle techniques and a special suit of armour made. It was discovered that the rigid wooden 
3 CONC saddle that was common for armoured knights actually helped him and he was able to make accurate lance charges on horseback. It was shown, however, that once he was off his horse he was extremely vulnerable which suggests that Sha
3 CONC kespear's 'A horse, my Kingdom for a horse' may have had more substance than just literary value.
3 CONT
