1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.kentonline.co.uk/ashford/news/tomb-raiders-target-grave-of-99462/ According to research Richard Plantagenet was the illegitimate son of the last Yorkist king who fell at the Battle of Bosworth in 1485.
