2 CONT See Peter Bartrum, http://cadair.aber.ac.uk/dspace/bitstream/handle/2160/5005/GODWIN%208%28A2%29_781.png?sequence=11&isAllowed=y (February 1, 2018; Anne Brannen, curator)
