1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Elizabeth Grey1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9
2 CONT *'''F, #33670, b. circa 1448, d. 18 July 1472
2 CONT *Father	Sir Edmund Grey, 1st Earl of Kent, 4th Baron Grey of Ruthin, Lord High Treasurer2,3,4,10,6,7,11,9 b. 26 Oct 1416, d. 22 May 1490
2 CONT *Mother	Katherine Percy2,3,10,6,11,9 b. 28 May 1423, d. bt 2 May 1493 - 17 Oct 1493
2 CONT *'''     Elizabeth Grey was born circa 1448 at of Ruthin, Denbighshire, Wales, England. She married Sir Robert Greystoke''', son of Sir Ralph Greystoke, 7th Lord Greystoke, Lord FitzWilliam and Elizabeth FitzHugh, '''circa 1470; T
2 CONC hey had 1 daughter''' (Elizabeth, wife of Sir Thomas, 3rd Lord Dacre of the North).2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9 '''Elizabeth Grey died on 18 July 1472 at of Ruthin, Denbighshire, Wales, England.2,9
2 CONT *'''Family     Sir Robert Greystoke b. c 1438, d. 17 Jun 1483
2 CONT *Child	
2 CONT **Elizabeth Greystoke+12,2,4,7,9 b. 10 Jul 1471, d. 14 Aug 1516
2 CONT *Citations
