2 CONT *'''Lady Elizabeth Grey1
2 CONT *F, #327798
2 CONT *Last Edited=1 Nov 2014
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=1.94%
2 CONT *'''     Lady Elizabeth Grey is the daughter''' of Edmund Grey, 1st Earl of Kent and Lady Catherine Percy.1 '''She married Sir Robert de Greystoke''', son of Ralph de Greystoke, 5th Lord Greystoke, '''before 1483.1
2 CONT *'''      Her married name became Greystoke.1
2 CONT *'''Child of Lady Elizabeth Grey and Sir Robert de Greystoke
2 CONT **Elizabeth Greystoke, Baroness Greystoke+2 d. 1516
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *[S37] BP2003 volume 2, page 1666. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
