2 CONT *'''     John Hussey, 1st Lord Hussey was the son''' of Sir William Hussey.2 '''He married, secondly, Lady Anne Grey''', daughter of George Grey, 2nd Earl of Kent and Lady Catherine Herbert.1
2 CONT *'''     He gained the title of 1st Lord Hussey.
