1 NAME Bridget /Hussey/ Countess of Bedford
2 GIVN Bridget
2 SURN Hussey
2 NSFX Countess of Bedford
2 _MARNM Hussey
1 SEX F
1 OCCU unknown
2 PLAC Proxy for Queen Elizabeth as Chief mourner for Mary Queen of Scots
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1526
2 PLAC Old Sleaford, Lincolnshire, England
2 ADDR
1 BURI
2 DATE 12 JAN 1601
2 PLAC Of, Watford, Hertfordshire, England
