2 CONC  2012-07-08. 4. http://www.multiwords.de/genealogy/gascoigne02.htm 5. Lundy, Darryl. "p21259.htm#i212582". The Peerage.[unreliable source] 6. Noonan, Barry Christopher. "ruvignyplus/". www.angelfire.com/realm3/ruvignyplus/.[self-p
2 CONC ublished source][better source needed] 7. http://www.cracroftspeerage.co.uk/online/content/gascoigne.htm 8. Burke's Peerage , see page 564 of this edition (however, the book confuses this Margaret with William V's daughter Margare
2 CONC t, Lady Ogle) 9. Margaret or Margery 10. http://www.mathematical.com/ogleralph1468.html 11. Lundy, Darryl. "Elizabeth". The Peerage.[unreliable source] 12.Dorothy 13.Sir Ninian Markenfield
