1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Henry [Percy], jure uxoris 5th Baron Poynings later 2nd Earl of Northumberland born 25 Jul 1421 mar. c. 25 Jun 1435 Eleanor de Poynings, de jure suo jure Baroness Poyning
