2 CONT 2. Lady Eleanor Percy  “Eleanor, married Lord De la Warr”
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor Percy was born circa 1451 at of Leconfield, Yorkshire, England.1 She married Sir Thomas West, 8th Lord de la Warre, 5th Lord West, son of Sir Richard West, 7th Lord de la Warr, 4th Lord West and Katherine Hungerford, circa
2 CONC  1470; They had no known issue.1,2,3,4,5 Eleanor Percy died before 1478 at of Sussex, England.1,3
