1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Elizabeth Scrope Percy, Baroness Scrope of Bolton=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Henry Percy, 3rd Earl of Northumberland and Eleanor Poynings, Baroness Poynings 
2 CONT * Burial record:  https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/69457297/elizabeth-scrope
2 CONT * Parents: Henry [Percy], jure uxoris 5th Baron Poynings later 2nd Earl of Northumberland born 25 Jul 1421 mar. c. 25 Jun 1435 Eleanor de Poynings, de jure suo jure Baroness Poyning
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Sir Henry le Scrope, 6th Baron Scrope of Bolton''' He was the  son of John Scrope, 5th Lord Scrope of Bolton and Joane FitzHugh.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. '''Anne Scrope''' married John Vavasour, son of Henry Vavasour and Elizabeth Everingham, and had issue. Sir William Vavasour
2 CONT *2. '''Sir Henry Scrope,''' later 7th Baron Scrope of Bolton; He married, secondly, Mabel Dacre, daughter of Sir Thomas Dacre, 2nd Lord Dacre (of Gilsland) and Elizabeth Greystoke, Baroness Greystoke, and had issue.  John le Scrop
2 CONC e, 8th Lord Scrope of Bolton, Elizabeth le Scrope and Joan le Scrope.
2 CONT *3 '''John Scrope,''' of Spennithorne, co. York, and Hambleden, co. Buckingham (b. bef. 1498; d. bef. 27 Nov 1547), mar. Phyllis Rokeby, dau. of Ralph Rokeby, of Rokeby and Mortham, by his wife Margery Danby, dau. of Robert Danby,
2 CONC  of Danby, co. York, and had issue:  Margaret Scrope, John Scrope, Robert , Sir Adrian Scrope, Ann Scrope; Henry Scrope, of Spennithorne, Co York and Mary Scrope
2 CONT * 4. '''Agnes Scrope'''
2 CONT * 5. '''Elizabeth Scrope'''  (b. ABT 1500)
2 CONT * 6. '''Joan '''Scrope''' (B. Lumley)
2 CONT * 7. '''Eleanor Scrope''' (b. ABT 1504)
2 CONT * 8. '''Catherine Scrope''' (b. ABT 1506)
2 CONT * 9. '''Anne Scrope'''
