2 CONT *'''Henry Stafford, 1st Lord Stafford1
2 CONT *'''M, #107591, b. 18 September 1501, d. 30 April 1563
2 CONT *Last Edited=27 Jan 2013
2 CONT *'''     Henry Stafford, 1st Lord Stafford was born on 18 September 1501.2 He was the son of Edward Stafford, 3rd Duke of Buckingham and Lady Eleanor Percy.3 He married Ursula Pole, daughter of Sir Richard Pole and Margaret Planta
2 CONC genet, Countess of Salisbury, on 16 February 1518/19.4 He died on 30 April 1563 at age 61, with at least seven other children:.2
2 CONT *'''     He was granted by HENRY VIII several of his f's forfeited lands in Staffordshire and other counties, also the Manor and Castle of Stafford 1531 in 1522.2 He was Recorder Stafford , Bencher Middle Temple by 1551, Chamberla
2 CONC in Exchequer Feb 1553/4, Ld-Lt Staffordshire 1559, Ranger Cannock Forest 1560 in 1532.2 He gained the title of 1st Lord Stafford in 1547. In 1547 so created Nov-Dec.2 He was also restored in blood (but not his f's titles) and by H
2 CONC ouse Lds resolution /8 had back the precedency of the original Barony of Stafford on 12 February 1557.2
2 CONT *'''Children of Henry Stafford, 1st Lord Stafford and Ursula Pole
