2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Henry Stafford, 5th Baron Stafford (1621 -1637).
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Mary Stafford, 1st Countess Stafford (1619 -1693) who married William Howard, 1st Viscount Stafford in 1637; they had children. {Viscount Howard was also known as Baron Stafford).
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Dorothy Stafford (b. about 1572).
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Richard Stafford who married Mary Corbet, daughter of John Corbet and Anne Booth .
2 CONT
2 CONT They were parents to:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Roger Stafford (Floyde), 6th Baron Stafford (about 1572 -1640) who died very poor.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Jane Stafford (about 1581 after 1637.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Thomas Stafford (1531 - 4 May 1557) who was captured and executed for High Treason in Scarborough.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Walter Stafford (about 1539 -after 1571).
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. William Stafford.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Elizabeth Stafford who married Sir William Neville (b. about 1524).
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Dorothy Stafford (about 1526 -23 September 1603) who married Sir William Stafford of Grafton after July 1543.
