2 CONC e county of Cornwall By Maclean, John, Sir, 1811-1895. 1n. Publication date: 1875. Topics: genealogy. Publisher. Exeter, Eng., W. Pollard Collection. https://archive.org/details/parochialfamilyh00maclin/page/8/mode/2up Text discus
2 CONC sion on page 9. Pedigree image on page 52. https://ia802605.us.archive.org/14/items/parochialfamilyh00maclin/parochialfamilyh00maclin.pdf
2 CONT ______________
