1 NOTE {geni:about_me} REYNOLD DE GREY, Knt., 4th Lord Grey of Wilton, son and heir, born 1 Nov. 1311. He married before 10 Jan. 1327/8 MAUD BOTETOURT. They had one son, Henry, Knt. [5th Lord Grey of Wilton], and one daughter, Agnes. SIR
