2 CONT Maud Botetourt was born circa 1316 at of Mendlesham, Suffolk, England.3,4 She married Sir Reginald de Grey, 4th Baron Grey, son of Sir Henry de Grey, 3rd Baron Grey and Anne de la Rochelle, before 10 January 1328; They had 1 son (
2 CONC Sir Henry, 5th Lord Grey of Wilton) and 1 daughter (Agnes, wife of Sir Robert de Clifton).3,4,5,6 Maud Botetourt died on 14 September 1391 at Shirland, Derbyshire, England.2,4,6
