2 CONT
2 CONT She married Sir Robert de CLIFTON Knight on 1361 in Clifton, Nottinghamshire, England.  The son of Sir Gervase de CLIFTON Knight and Margaret de PIERREPONT, he was born 1335 in Clifton, Nottinghamshire, England. He died 16 Oct 137
2 CONC 6 in Clifton, Nottinghamshire, England.
