2 CONT ==content to clean up==
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Stafford''', 4th daughter of Sir Ralph de Stafford, Knight of the Garter and his first wife Katherine de Hastang, daughter of Sir John de Hastang of Chesbsey, Stafford by his wife Eve.
2 CONT
2 CONT >Ancestral Roots of Certain American Colonists Who Came to America before 1700, 8th Edition, 55:32-33:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ralph de Stafford married, as his first wife, '''probably about 1326-27''', Katharine, daughter of Sir John Hastang of Chebsey, co. Stafford, by Eve his wife. 141
2 CONT
2 CONT >Cockayne's Complete Peerage, (Stafford), Vol. XIIA, p. 176.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
