2 CONT *Mother     Katharine de Hastang2 d. b 6 Jul 1336
2 CONT *'''     Margaret Stafford was born circa 1330.2 She married Sir John de Stafford, son of Sir William Stafford and Isabella de Stafford, between 1340 and 1341.2,3,4
