2 CONT * Title: '''Sir
2 CONT * Name/Surname: '''Stafford
2 CONT * Name/Birth Surname: '''Stafford
2 CONT * Name/Suffix: '''of Sandon and Bramshall/Bromshull
2 CONT * Name/Display Name: (blank)
2 CONT * Also Known As: '''John de Stafford
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT 2nd cousin once removed of his wife Margaret Stafford
2 CONT
2 CONT ==links==
2 CONT * https://stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ss4tz/stafford03.php#top (membership required in order to view without interruption)
