2 CONT ==content to clean up==
2 CONT of Wickham
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: of Scales, Knt. of Amblecote and Bramshall, Stafford. Sir John Stafford, son of William Stafford, of Bromshull, county Stafford, and a descendant of Hervey Bagot and Milicent Stafford; which Sir John married Margaret, young
2 CONC est daughter of Ralph Stafford, 1st Earl of Stafford, and left issue, Sir Humphrey, his heir, a distinguished soldier in the martial reign of King Edward III, and one of the retinue of the Black Prince, who married the dau. and he
2 CONC ir of John Grenvil; and Ralph, who married Maud, daughter and co-heir of Sir John Hastang, and was ancestor of the Staffords of Grafton, county Worcester, and of the Staffords of Blatherwycke, county Northampton. [Sir Bernard Burk
2 CONC e, Dormant, Abeyant, Forfeited, and Extinct Peerages, Burke's Peerage, Ltd., London, 1883, p. 501, Stafford, Barons Stafford, of Suthwyk, Earl of Devon].
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Norfolk Knight
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sir John De Stafford was born on 1320 in England to John De Stafford and Unknown MNU Stafford.  Sir John married Unknown MNU and had a child:  Margaret De Stafford.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John De Stafford is my 22nd great grandfather.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sir John De Stafford was born on 1320 in England.  Sir John married Unknown MNU and had a child:  Margaret De Stafford.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John De Stafford is my 22nd great grandfather.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT * 1.  Kathy Franklin-Hamilton
2 CONT * 2.  [http://www.warrenfamilyhistory.com/Docs/Our%20Warrens%20in%20England.htm]
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Father Sir William Stafford d. a 1318 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother Isabella de Stafford d. a 1309 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John Stafford was born at of Bramshall, Staffordshire, England. He married Elizabeth Somerville, daughter of Sir Philip Somerville, Lord Whichnor and Margaret Pipe, circa 1331. Sir John Stafford married Margaret Stafford, daug
2 CONC hter of Sir Ralph de Stafford, 1st Earl Stafford, 2nd Lord Stafford and Katharine de Hastang, between 1340 and 1341.2 Sir John Stafford died circa 1370.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 Margaret Stafford b. c 1330 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 
2 CONT
2 CONT ◦Ralph Stafford+3 d. 1 Mar 1410
2 CONT
2 CONT ◦Sir Humphrey Stafford, Sheriff of Staffordshire, Somersetshire, & Dorsetshire+ b. c 1343, d. 31 Oct 1413 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 2 Elizabeth Somerville b. c 1310 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child 
2 CONT
2 CONT ◦Maud de Stafford4 b. c 1340, d. a 1386
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.[S3178] Unknown author, Magna Charta Sureties, 1215, by F. L. Weis, 4th Ed., p. 32; The Ancestry of Dorothea Poyntz, by Ronny O. Bodine, p. 85; Wallop Family, p. 715.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 671-672.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 383.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.[S15] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, p. 6-7.
2 CONT
