2 CONT http://books.google.com/books?id=3tkEAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA286&lpg=PA286&dq=John+Stafford+1337&source=bl&ots=mwx5BwDW2n&sig=fO2e9xpBHoRkrOqVhNeQL2hyb1Q&hl=en&ei=sLLQTNSOBIG-sAPtoLDbCA&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=2&ved=0CBUQ6AEwAT
