2 CONT mention: Maud his late wife <br>
2 CONT He died on 1 March [1410]. Humphrey his son and heir was aged 26 years and more.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Family and Education
2 CONT 2nd s. of Sir John Stafford† (d.c.1370) of Bramshall, Staffs. by his 2nd w. Margaret, 4th da. of Ralph, earl of Stafford (d.1372); bro. of Sir Humphrey I*. m. c. Aug. 1373, Maud (b. 2 Feb. 1359), da. and coh. of Sir John Hastang (
2 CONC d.1366) of Leamington Hastang, Warws. and Grafton, prob. 2s.1 inc. Humphrey*.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography
2 CONT [http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1386-1421/member/stafford-ralph-1410 History of Parliament Online]
