3 TEXT Last Name
3 TEXT To the bishop of Lincoln. Mandate to absolve from excommunication incurred, enjoining a salutary 
4 CONT
4 CONT penance, James Tuchet, donsel, nobleman, son of the late John Tuchet, lord Audeley, and Margaret, 
4 CONT
4 CONT damsel, noblewoman, daughter of the late William lord Roos, of the dioceses of Lichfield and 
4 CONT
4 CONT Lincoln, who contracted marriage, but did not consummate it, not in ignorance that they were 
4 CONT
4 CONT related in the third and fourth degrees of kindred, and to dispense them to contract marriage anew 
4 CONT
4 CONT and to remain therein. Oblate nobis.
