2 CONT      Margaret Arundel is the daughter of John d'Arundel, 1st Lord Arundel and Eleanor Mautravers, Baroness
2 CONT  Mautravers.1 She and William de Ros, 6th Lord de Ros of Helmsley obtained a marriage license on 9 October 1394.2
2 CONT
