2 CONT ==Sir John Roos, 7th Lord Roos, Captain of Chateau Gaillard & Mantes1,2,3,4,5,6==
2 CONT Last Edited	10 Feb 2014
2 CONT '''M, #45940, b. 1 October 1396, d. 22 March 1421'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Sir William Roos, 6th Earl Roos, Lord Treasurer of England3,7,5,8 b. c 1370, d. 1 Sep 1414
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Margaret Arundel3,7,5,8 d. 3 Jul 1438
2 CONT '''Sir John Roos, 7th Lord Roos, Captain of Chateau Gaillard & Mantes was born on 1 October 1396 at of Helmsley, Yorkshire, England; Age 17 in 1414, & 17 or 18 in in 1415.3,4,5,6 He and Margery le Despenser obtained a marriage lic
2 CONC ense on 13 September 1404; Date of Papal Dispensation for consanguinity. No issue.3,4,5,6 Sir John Roos, 7th Lord Roos, Captain of Chateau Gaillard & Mantes died on 22 March 1421 at Battle of Bauge, Bauge, Pays de la Loire, Maine-
2 CONC et-Loire, France, at age 24; d.s.p. Buried at Belvoir Priory, Leicestershire.'''9,3,4,5,6
2 CONT '''Family	Margery le Despenser''' b. c 1398, d. 20 Apr 1478
2 CONT Citations
