1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 6º B. Cobham of Olditch. Succeeded to the title in 1442.  Staunch Yorkist. He fought in the Battle of St. Albans on 23 May 1455. He fought in the Battle of Northampton on 10 Jul 1460.
