2 CONT *''''''M, b. circa 1415, d. circa 7 July 1464
2 CONT *Father   Sir Thomas Brooke, Sheriff of Devonshire1,4,3 b. c 1392, d. 12 Aug 1439
2 CONT *Mother   Joan Braybrooke1,4,3 b. c 1396, d. 25 Nov 1442
2 CONT *''''''     Sir Edward Brooke, 6th Lord Cobham was born circa 1415 at of Cobham, Kent, England; Age 24 in 1439.2,3 He married Elizabeth Touchet, daughter of Sir James Touchet, 5th Lord Audley and Margaret Roos, before 2 February 1
2 CONC 437.1,5,2 Sir Edward Brooke, 6th Lord Cobham died circa 7 July 1464.1,2,3
