2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Humphrey Touchet Sir 6th Lord Audley b: ABT 1435 in Heighley Castle, Audley, Staffordshire, England c: in Heighley Castle, Audley, Staffordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Elizabeth Courtenay Baroness of Audley b: ABT 1440 in Powderham Castle, Powderham, Devon, England
