2 CONT *     Sir Robert Whitney, Sheriff of Herefordshire was born circa 1418 at of Whitney, Herefordshire, England. He married Constance Touchet, daughter of Sir James Touchet, 5th Lord Audley, Chief Justice & Chamberlain of South Wales
2 CONC  and Eleanor Holand, circa 1449; They had 2 daughters (Joan (Jane), wife of Sir Roger Vaughan; & Eleanor, wife of Sir Thomas Vaughn.2,5,3,4 Sir Robert Whitney, Sheriff of Herefordshire married Elsbeth Vaughan, daughter of Thomas V
2 CONC aughan and Ellen (Ellena) Gethin, circa 1451; They had 4 sons (James, Esq., John, Robert, & Hugh) and 3 daughters (''''''Ellen, wife of John Puleston''''''; Sibyl, wife of Roger ap Richard Vaughan; & Elizabeth, wife of John Pye).2
2 CONC ,3 Sir Robert Whitney, Sheriff of Herefordshire died circa 6 October 1494.3
