2 CONT  Maxwell Lyte, Sir Henry, A History of Dunster and of the Families of Mohun and Luttrell, Part I, London, 1909, p. 105
2 CONT  Beaumont, Edward T., The Beaumonts in History. A.D. 850-1850. Oxford, c. 1929, (privately published), Chapter 5, pp. 56–63, The Devonshire Family, pp. 62–3
2 CONT  Beaumont, Edward T, Chapter 5, p. 62, quoting: Transactions of the Devon Society, Vol.45, p. 263
2 CONT  Beaumont, Edward T, Chapter 5, p. 62, quoting: Transactions of the Devon Society, Vol.45, p. 262
