2 CONC .Somerville, Duchy, i. 539, 541, 546. DL29/402/6451 makes clear that it was not Montgomery (as Somerville states) but his son and namesake who became steward of Tutbury in 1416. 3.C47/2/49, f. 6. 4.Derbys. Chs. no. 931; CP25(1)39/
