2 CONT
2 CONT * Sir Thomas Berkeley, 5th Lord Berkeley, Mowbray, & Segrave1,2,3,4,5,6
2 CONT * Last Edited	8 Feb 2014
2 CONT * M, #20154, b. 1472, d. 22 January 1533
2 CONT * Father	Sir Maurice Berkeley, 4th Lord Berkeley1,7,8 b. c 1435, d. Sep 1506
