2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Thomas Berkeley, 5th Lord Berkeley, Mowbray, & Segrave was born in 1472 at of Hovingham, Yorkshire, England.1,9,4 He married Eleanor Constable, daughter of Sir Marmaduke Constable, Sheriff of Staffordshire & Yorkshire, Ambassa
2 CONC dor to Scotland and Joyce Stafford, circa 1504; They had 2 sons (Sir Thomas, Lord Berkeley; & Maurice, Esq.) and 2 daughters (Muriel, wife of Sir Robert Throckmorton; and Joan, wife of Sir Nicholas Poyntz).1,10,9,2,3,4,5,6 Sir Tho
2 CONC mas Berkeley, 5th Lord Berkeley, Mowbray, & Segrave left a will on 11 January 1533.9,4 He died on 22 January 1533 at Mangotsfield, Bristol, Gloucestershire, England; Buried at St. Augustine's, Bristol, Gloucestershire.1,9,4 His es
2 CONC tate was probated on 6 June 1533.9,4
2 CONT
