2 CONT
2 CONT Dame Anne Margaret Devereux
2 CONT
2 CONT 1345–1403
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth 1345 • Leominster, Hertfordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Death 1403 • Hertford, Hertfordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT When Dame Anne Margaret Devereux was born in 1345, her father, Sir, was 45, and her mother, Anne, was 33. She had one son with Sir Roger I Vaughan Lord Bredwardine in 1377. She died in 1403 in Hertford, Hertfordshire, England, at 
2 CONC the age of 58.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth
2 CONT
2 CONT Dame Anne Margaret Devereux was born in 1345 to Anne Barre, age 33, and Sir William IV (Lord Chancelor of Ireland) Devereux, age 45.
2 CONT
2 CONT Leominster, Hertfordshire, England  1345 • Leominster, Hertfordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT ~
2 CONT
2 CONT 1376, Age 31 Death of Father
2 CONT
2 CONT Her father Sir William IV (Lord Chancelor of Ireland) passed away in 1376 in Hereford, Herefordshire, England, at the age of 76.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hereford, Herefordshire, England 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir William IV (Lord Chancelor of Ireland) Devereux
2 CONT
