2 CONT     Research Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT Technically, his surname was not VAUGHAN (anglicised form of the Welsh "Fychan" meaning "the younger").
2 CONT
2 CONT    Marriage Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT Roger married Anne DEVEREUX, daughter of Sir William DEVEREUX of Bodenham and Anne BARRE. (Anne DEVEREUX was born in Bodenham, Herefordshire, England.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:	 circa 1377  Bredwardine, Herefordshire, England   Death:	 October 25, 1415 (38)  Battle Agincourt, Agincourt, Pas De Calais, France   Immediate Family:	 Son of Roger Vaughan and Anne Devereux Husband of Margaret Touchet; E
