2 CONT * ....  He was twice married. ''''''The first wife was Denise, daughter of Thomas ap Philip Vaughan of Talgarth, and she was the mother of the heir (Sir) Thomas Vaughan, Roger Vaughan-see Vaughan family of Porthaml-and four daught
2 CONC ers who married into prominent families, the wives of Robert Raglan, Henry Donne,  Morgan Gamage, and Morgan ap Thomas ap GrufFudd ap Nicolas''''''. His second wife was Margaret, lady Powis, daughter of James, lord Audley, by his 
2 CONC second wife, Eleanor, illegitimate daughter of Edmund, earl of Kent.  (Her first husband, Sir Richard Grey, lord Powis, d. 17 Dec. 1466. She was dead before 2 Feb. 1480/1.) She had one daughter by Sir Roger, the wife of Humphrey K
