2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of James and Blanche (Milbourne) Whitney, order likely but uncertain:
2 CONT
2 CONT i.	Robert Whitney, b. about 1491, Whitney, Herefordshire,[13] m. Margaret Wye
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://wiki.whitneygen.org/wrg/index.php?title=Family:Whitney,_Robert_(s1491-1541)
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Whitney (James, Robert, Eustace, Robert, Robert, Robert, Eustace, Eustace, Robert, ...), son of James and Blanche (Milbourne) Whitney,[1] born say 1491, Whitney, Herefordshire;[2] died between 10 May 1541 and 11 Jun 1541, w
2 CONC hen his will was dated and proved, Icomb, Gloucestershire.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, say 1515, Margaret Wye,[4] daughter of Robert Wye.[5] She was born say 1494, in Gloucestershire,[6] and died after 1541, when she was mentioned in her husband's will.[7]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Robert and Margaret (Wye) Whitney, sons in order, daughters in order, but overall order uncertain:
2 CONT * i.	(Sir) Robert Whitney, b. say 1517, Icomb, Gloucestershire;[10] m. Sybil Baskerville.
2 CONT * ii.	John Whitney, b. say 1520, Icomb, Gloucestershire; probably the "bed-felloe" of Roger Ascham.[11]
2 CONT * iii.	Elizabeth Whitney, b. say 1521, Icomb, Gloucestershire; m. William Bastard of Banbury, Oxfordshire. She is listed as a daughter in visitation pedigrees, but not in her father's will, possibly because she was already married
2 CONC  and had received her portion.[12]
2 CONT * iv.	Charles Whitney, b. say 1523, Icomb, Gloucestershire; no further record.[13]
2 CONT * v.	George Whitney, b. say 1526, Icomb, Gloucestershire;[14] m. Julian -----.
2 CONT * vi.	Blanche Whitney, b. say 1527, Icomb, Gloucestershire; no further record.[15]
2 CONT * vii.	William Whitney, b. say 1529, Icomb, Gloucestershire; living 1587.[16]
2 CONT * viii.	James Whitney, b. say 1532, Icomb, Gloucestershire.[17] In 1574 he was involved in a Star Chamber suit regarding the manor of Nyles in Risington, Gloucestershire.[18]
2 CONT * ix.	Mary Whitney, b. say 1533, Icomb, Gloucestershire; no further record.[19]
2 CONT * x.	Richard Whitney, b. say 1535, Icomb, Gloucestershire; no further record.[20]
2 CONT
2 CONT Illegitimate sons of Robert Whitney, mother(s) unknown:
2 CONT * xi.	Anthony Whitney, b. aft. 1523, d. after 1541. He was listed as being at Icombe in his father's will.
2 CONT * xii.	Charles Whitney, b. aft. 1523, d. after 1541. He was listed as being with Master Willis in his father's will.
