2 CONT *'''PAKINGTON, JOHN (by 1488-1551), of Hampton Lovett, Worcs. and London.
2 CONT *'''b. by 1488, 1st s. of John Pakington by Elizabeth, da. of Thomas Washborne of Stanford-le-Teme, Worcs.; bro. of Robert*. educ. I. Temple. m. by 1530, Anne, da. of Henry Dacres of London, wid. of Robert Fairethwatt of London, a
2 CONC t least 1 s. d.v.p. 2 da. Kntd. 23 Nov. 1546/9 Feb. 1547.3
