1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Bridget Packington 
2 CONT *'''F, b. circa 1522
2 CONT *Father     Sir John Packington b. c 1490, d. 1560
2 CONT *Mother     Alice Dacres b. c 1492
2 CONT *'''     Bridget Packington was born circa 1522 at of Hampton Lovet, England. She married Sir John Lyttleton, son of John Lyttleton, Esq. and Elizabeth Talbot, circa 1545.
2 CONT *'''Family      Sir John Lyttleton b. 28 Oct 1519, d. 15 Feb 1589
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1580.htm#i47502 ___________
2 CONT *'''Bridgett Packington1
2 CONT *F, #407053
2 CONT *Last Edited=21 Nov 2009
2 CONT *'''     Bridgett Packington married Sir John Lyttelton, son of Sir John Lyttelton and Elizabeth Talbot.1
2 CONT *'''     Her married name became Lyttelton.1
2 CONT *'''Child of Bridgett Packington and Sir John Lyttelton
2 CONT ** 1.Gilbert Lyttelton+1 d. 1 Jun 1599
2 CONT *Citations
