2 CONC I. Atherton, John, 1st Visct. Scudamore 1601-71, p. 34; Sidney Letters ed. A. Collins, ii. 28. 4. S. and E. Usherwood, Counter-Armada, 1596, p. 147. 5. C142/374/85. 6. C231/1, f. 36; 231/4, f. 30; C66/2174. 7. I. Atherton, Ambitio
