1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Catharine was a great-great-granddaughter of
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Somerset, second Earl of Worcester, whose father was Charles Somerset, first Earl of Worcester, his mother was Elizabeth Herbert. Charles Somerset's father was Henry Beaufort, third duke of Somerset, his mother was Joan Hill
2 CONC . Henry Beaufort's father was Edmund Beaufort, 2nd Duke of Somerset, and Eleanor Beauchamp, daughter of Richard Beauchamp, Earl of Warwick Edmund Beaufort's father was John Beaufort, 1st Earl of Somerset, and his mother was Margar
2 CONC et Holland. John Beaufort's father was John of Gaunt, his mother Katherine Swynford. John of Gaunt's father was King Edward III of England and his mother, Philippa of Hainault.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Somerset was a grandson of Henry
2 CONT
2 CONT Plantagenet Beaufort, beheaded in 1463, and the latter was a
2 CONT
2 CONT great-great-grandson of Edward III, King of England, and his wife, Philippa,
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter of William III, Count of Hainault and Holland, by his wife Joanna,
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter of Charles of Valois, son of King Philip of France.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Marriage Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT Catrin married Dafydd ap IEUAN of Castell Nedd, son of Ieuan ap DAFYDD of Castell Nedd and Lleucu ferch MORGAN GWYN.
2 CONT --------------------
