2 CONT *MORGAN, William III (c.1525-1602), of Chilworth, Surr.
2 CONT *b. c.1525, o.s. of Richard Morgan of Chilworth by Joan, or Jane, da. of Robert Wintershall of Wintershall, nr. Bramley. m. (1)1 Elizabeth, da. of John Thetcher of Presthawes, Westham, Suss., 1s. 4da.; (2)2 Katherine, da. of Sir R
2 CONC oger Lewknor, wid. of John Mills of Grentham. Suss., 1da.; (3) by 1585 Julian(a).3
2 CONT *Morgan’s grandfather, '''Henry Morgan of Pencoed, moved to Surrey on his marriage to a Gunter heiress. Their main property was the manor of Chilworth, near Guildford, and they also held Tyting manor in the same parish, Utworth ma
2 CONC nor at Cranleigh, and Puttenham manor, near Loseley.''' ....
2 CONT *From: http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1558-1603/member/morgan-william-iii-1525-1602
