2 CONT *'''Sir William Morgan1,2 
2 CONT *'''M, #67840, b. circa 1483, d. 25 October 1542
2 CONT *Father      Sir Thomas Morgan b. c 1443
2 CONT *Mother     Jane Herbert b. c 1457
2 CONT *'''     Sir William Morgan was born circa 1483 at of Pencoed Manor, Wales. He married Florence Brugge, daughter of Sir Giles Brugge, Sheriff of Gloucestershire and Isabell Baynham, circa 1509. Sir William Morgan died on 25 Octobe
2 CONC r 1542.
2 CONT *'''Family      Florence Brugge b. c 1493
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **Anne Morgan+1,2 b. 1512
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 241.
2 CONT * 2.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. III, p. 58.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2257.htm#i67840
2 CONT *______________
2 CONT *'''William MORGAN (Sir Knight)
2 CONT *'''Born: ABT 1483, Pen-coed, Llanfarthin, Monmouthshire, England
2 CONT *'''Died: 25 Oct 1542
2 CONT *Father: Thomas MORGAN (Sir Knight) 
2 CONT *Mother: Jane HERBERT 
2 CONT *'''Married: Florence BRYDGES 1509
2 CONT *Children: 
2 CONT **1. Margaret MORGAN (b. ABT 1510) 
2 CONT **2. Mary MORGAN 
2 CONT **3. Anne MORGAN 
2 CONT **4. Thomas MORGAN (Sir Knight) 
2 CONT **5. John MORGAN (b. ABT 1518) 
2 CONT **6. Andrew MORGAN (b. ABT 1519) 
2 CONT **7. Henry MORGAN (b. ABT 1521) 
2 CONT **8. Morgan MORGAN (b. ABT 1523) 
2 CONT **9. Alice MORGAN (b. ABT 1525) 
2 CONT **10. Giles MORGAN 
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/MORGAN.htm#William MORGAN (Sir Knight)1
2 CONT *__________________
2 CONT *MORGAN, Sir Thomas (by 1509-65), of Pencoed, Mon.
2 CONT *b. by 1509, 1st s. of '''Sir William Morgan of Pencoed''', and bro. of Giles Morgan. m. by 1543, Cecily, da. of (Sir) George Herbert of Swansea, Glam., 5s. inc. Sir William† 1da.; 2da. illegit. suc. fa. 1542. Kntd. 30 Sept. 1544.
2 CONC 1
2 CONT *From: http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1509-1558/member/morgan-sir-thomas-1509-65
2 CONT *_________________
2 CONT *MORGAN, Giles (by 1515-70), of Newport, Mon.
2 CONT *b. by 1515, 2nd s. of '''Sir William Morgan of Pencoed by Florence, da. of Sir Giles Brydges''' of Coberley, Glos.; bro. of Sir Thomas†. m. by 1558, Emma or Mary, da. of Thomas Brague or Brayne of Little Dean, Glos. 3s.2
2 CONT *From: http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1509-1558/member/morgan-giles-1515-70
2 CONT *________________
2 CONT *LEWIS, Thomas III (by 1533-94), of The Van, Glam.
2 CONT *b. by 1533, 1st s. of Edward Lewis of The Van by Anne, da. of '''Sir William Morgan of Pencoed, Mon.''' m. (1) by 1561, Margaret, da. of Robert Gamage of Coity, Glam., wid. of Miles Mathew of Llandaff, Glam., 3s. inc. George† 4da
2 CONC .; (2) Catherine, da. of (Sir) George Mathew of Radyr, Glam. suc. fa. 1573/75.1
2 CONT *From: http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1509-1558/member/lewis-thomas-iii-1533-94
2 CONT *_______________
2 CONT *HERBERT, Walter I (by 1509-50/51), of St. Julian's, Mon. and Dunraven, Glam.
2 CONT *b. by 1509, s. of Sir George Herbert of St. Julian’s by Sibyl, da. of Sir Richard Croft† of Croft Castle, Herefs. m. (1) by 1530, Mary, da. of '''Sir William Morgan of Pencoed, Mon.''', 3s. inc. George† and William Herbert IV 3da
2 CONC .; (2) by 1544, Sibyl, da. of Sir Thomas Monington of Sarnsfield, Herefs., wid. of Arnold Butler of Dunraven. suc.fa. aft. 1504. Kntd. 10 Nov. 1549.1
2 CONT * .... After fighting in the Boulogne campaign he was himself elected with Charles Herbert in 1545, and two years later he helped to return his brother-in-law Sir Thomas Morgan and cousin Thomas Herbert. ....
2 CONT *From: http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1509-1558/member/herbert-walter-i-1509-5051
2 CONT *______________
2 CONT *HERBERT, William IV (by 1530-67), of St. Julian's, Mon.
2 CONT *b. by 1530, 1st s. of Sir Walter Herbert of St. Julian’s by 1st w. Mary, da. of '''Sir William Morgan of Pencoed'''; bro. of George†. m. (1) by 1554, Jane, da. and coh. of Edward Gruffydd of Penrhyn, Caern., 1s. William†; (2) by 
2 CONC 1567, Dorothy. suc. fa. Sept. 1550/Feb. 1551.1
2 CONT *William Herbert’s father died during his year as sheriff and there can be little doubt that it was Herbert who completed the term. He was not to enjoy the power and prestige accorded to his father in South Wales and he makes only
2 CONC  occasional appearances in the records. Of his Membership of the Parliament of 1555 all that is known is that he was not among those who opposed one of the government’s bills, unlike his fellow-knight and relative William Morgan. 
2 CONC According to Herbert the pair were re-elected to the following Parliament, in 1558, but the sheriff returned Morgan and Francis Somerset, who was a son of the 2nd Earl of Worcester. As Herbert’s father had been in Worcester’s serv
2 CONC ice, the earl perhaps counted on Herbert’s acquiescence in Somerset’s return, ....
2 CONT * .... The will, which was witnessed by Mathew Herbert, Giles Morgan and William Morgan, was proved on 7 Feb. 1567, Herbert having died on 13 Jan. possessed of lands in Monmouthshire ....
2 CONT *From: http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1509-1558/member/herbert-william-iv-1530-67
2 CONT *_____________
2 CONT *HERBERT, George (d.1580), of Newport, Mon.
2 CONT *2nd s. of Sir Walter Herbert† of St. Julian’s by Mary, da. of '''Sir William Morgan of Pencoed'''. unm., at least 1ch.
2 CONT * .... In September 1578 he was one of the ‘gentlemen, soldiers and mariners’ who, under Miles Morgan of Tredegar, joined Sir Humphrey Gilbert in an expedition to America whose departure was delayed by charges of piracy brought ag
2 CONC ainst Gilbert. This led to energetic measures against piracy in the western ports, in the course of which Herbert was examined. Nothing serious being proved against him, he duly set sail. Miles Morgan was lost at sea, but Herbert 
2 CONC returned to carry on a brisk trade with Bordeaux, Rochelle, and Lisbon, importing salt and iron, and exporting lead, wax, cloth, hides and flax. ....
2 CONT *From: http://www.historyofparliamentonline.org/volume/1558-1603/member/herbert-george-1580
