2 CONT *****			(i) Thomas Morgan of Machem and Tredegar
2 CONT *****			  m. Elizabeth Bodenham (b 1543, dau of Roger Bodenham of Roderwas)
2 CONT ******				(a) Sir William Morgan of Tredegar (d before 13.09.1653)
2 CONT ******				  m1. (1598) Elizabeth Wintour (dau of Sir William Wintour of Lidney)
