2 CONT Added     2-12-2012            www.familytreemaker.com  Anne Goddard (b. 1512, d. 1612) Anne Goddard was born 1512 in Oxenham, Wiltshire, England, and died 1612 in Stavewyke, Berkshire, England.
2 CONT  She married Thomas Hinton on 1531 in Stavewyke, Berkshire, England, son of John Hinton and Joan Francklyn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: 1531, Stavewyke, Berkshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Anne Goddard and Thomas Hinton are:
2 CONT    1. +Anthony Hinton, b. 1532, Earlscote, Wanborough, Wiltshire, England, 
2 CONT            d. 07 May 1598,                 Earlescote, England.
2 CONT    2. Robert Hinton, b. 1534, Earlescote, England, d. date unknown.
2 CONT    3. William Hinton, b. 1536, Wanborough, Wiltshire, England, d. date unknown.
