2 CONT Child of Walter Goddard and Sibil Mychell is: +	2	  i.	John Goddard was born Abt 1465 in Aldbourne, Wiltshire, England, and died Bet Feb 1557 and 1558 in Aldbourne, Wiltshire, England.
