2 CONT Descendant Register, Generation No. 2
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.	John Goddard (Walter Goddard6, John [Ii] Goddard5, John [I] Goddard4, John [Ii] Goderd3, John [I] Goderd2, Walter De Goderville1) was born Abt 1465 in Aldbourne, Wiltshire, England, and died Bet Feb 1557 and 1558 in Aldbourne, 
2 CONC Wiltshire, England. He married Elizabeth Berenger Abt 1510 in Aldbourne, Wiltshire, England, daughter of William Berenger. She was born Abt 1489 in Manningford, Bruce, Berkshire, England.
2 CONT
