2 CONT 3.	Anne Goddard (John Goddard7, Walter Goddard6, John [Ii] Goddard5, John [I] Goddard4, John [Ii] Goderd3, John [I] Goderd2, Walter De Goderville1) was born Abt 1512 in Oxenham, Wiltshire, England. She married Sir Thomas Hinton Ab
2 CONC t 1531 in Wiltshire, England, son of John De Hynton and Joan Or Jonne Francklyn. He was born Abt 1505 in Stanewych, Berkshire, England, and died 25 Dec 1568 in Earlscote, Wanborough, Wiltshire, England.
2 CONT
