2 CONT
2 CONT 4.	Sir Anthony Hinton (Anne Goddard8, John Goddard7, Walter Goddard6, John [Ii] Goddard5, John [I] Goddard4, John [Ii] Goderd3, John [I] Goderd2, Walter De Goderville1) was born Abt 1532 in Earlscott, England, and died 7 May 1598 
2 CONC in Wanborough, Wiltshire, England. He was buried in St. Johns Church, Wanborough, Wiltshire, England. He married Martha Warnford Abt 1573, daughter of John Warnborough and Susan Yates. She was born Abt 1544 in England, and died Ab
2 CONC t 1640 in Wanborough, Wiltshire, England.
2 CONT  	 Child of Sir Anthony Hinton and Martha Warnford is: +	5	  i.	Sir Thomas Hinton was born Abt 1563 in Parham, Somersetshire, England, and died Bet 1 Feb 1634 and 1635 in Wanborough, Wiltshire, England.
