2 CONT Descendant Register, Generation No. 5 5.	Sir Thomas Hinton (Sir Anthony Hinton9, Anne Goddard8, John Goddard7, Walter Goddard6, John [Ii] Goddard5, John [I] Goddard4, John [Ii] Goderd3, John [I] Goderd2, Walter De Goderville1) was
2 CONC  born Abt 1563 in Parham, Somersetshire, England, and died Bet 1 Feb 1634 and 1635 in Wanborough, Wiltshire, England. He was buried in St. Martin's, Chilton Foliat, Wiltshire, England. He married Catherine [@] Palmer Abt 1595 in P
2 CONC arham, Somersetshire, England, daughter of Sir John [@] Palmer and Elizabeth Varney. She was born 13 Sep 1579 in London, Middlesex, England, and died 10 Nov 1661 in Chilton Foliat, Wiltshire, England. She was buried in St. Martin'
2 CONC s, Chilton Foliot, Wiltshire, England.
