2 CONC in Cecil Co, MD. +	8	  iii.	John Chapman [Md @] Hinton was born 10 Jul 1603 in Chilton Foliat, Wiltshire, England, and died 10 Oct 1682 in St. Martin-In-The-Fields, London, Middlesex, England.
2 CONT
