2 CONC  Walter De Goderville1) was born Abt 1592 in England, and died 1657 in Elbert Co, GA. She married Samuel [I Cpt @] Mathews, son of Tobias [@] Mathews and Frances Barlow. He was born 1 Feb 1583 in Durham, England, and died 13 Mar 1
2 CONC 660.
