2 CONC ncis [@] Mathews was born Abt 1633 in Matthews Manor, York Co, VA, and died 16 Feb 1673 in York Co, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7.	Thomas [@] Hinton (Sir Thomas Hinton10, Sir Anthony Hinton9, Anne Goddard8, John Goddard7, Walter Goddard6, John [Ii] Goddard5, John [I] Goddard4, John [Ii] Goderd3, John [I] Goderd2, Walter De Goderville1) was born 1600 in Eng
2 CONC land, and died 20 Sep 1683 in Cecil Co, MD. He married Elizabeth Farrar, daughter of Sir Robert Farrar. She was born Abt 1600, and died 20 Sep 1658.
2 CONT
