2 CONT 8.	John Chapman [Md @] Hinton (Sir Thomas Hinton10, Sir Anthony Hinton9, Anne Goddard8, John Goddard7, Walter Goddard6, John [Ii] Goddard5, John [I] Goddard4, John [Ii] Goderd3, John [I] Goderd2, Walter De Goderville1) was born 10
2 CONC  Jul 1603 in Chilton Foliat, Wiltshire, England, and died 10 Oct 1682 in St. Martin-In-The-Fields, London, Middlesex, England. He married Elizabeth (Dilke) Duke 1622 in Netherlands, daughter of Ambrose Duke and Elizabeth Calthorpe
2 CONC . She was born 1605 in Benhall, Suffolk, England, and died 1656 in England.
