2 CONT *''''''Margaret Wye1
2 CONT *''''''F, b. circa 1495
2 CONT *Father Robert Wye b. c 1470 
2 CONT *Mother Jane 
2 CONT *''''''     Margaret Wye was born circa 1495 at of Icomb, Gloucestershire, England. She married Robert Whitney, son of James Whitney and Blanche Milbourne, circa 1518.2
2 CONT *''''''Family Robert Whitney b. c 1494 
2 CONT *Children 
2 CONT **◦Sir Robert Whitney+ b. c 1520, d. 5 Aug 1567
2 CONT **◦Blanch Whitney2 b. c 1522
2 CONT **◦James Whitney2 b. c 1524
2 CONT **◦John Whitney2 b. c 1526
2 CONT **◦Richard Whitney2 b. c 1528
2 CONT **◦Charles Whitney2 b. c 1530
2 CONT **◦Mary Whitney2 b. c 1532
2 CONT **◦George Whitney2 b. c 1534
2 CONT **◦William Whitney2 b. c 1536
2 CONT **◦Elizabeth Whitney2 b. c 1538
