2 CONT
2 CONT Melville says about him the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT >Turning now to Robert Whitney, the elder brother, we find that he married Margaret, the daughter of Robert Wye of Gloucestershire, thus allying himself to one of the best families of that county, and took up his abode, quite like
2 CONC ly before his father's death, in the manor-house, at Icomb.
