1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Robert Greville1
2 CONT *''''''M, b. circa 1537, d. 17 March 1612
2 CONT *Father Sir Fulke Greville, Sheriff of Warwickshire & Leicestershire2 b. b 1505, d. 10 Nov 1559 
2 CONT *Mother Elizabeth Willoughby2 b. c 1512 
2 CONT *''''''     Robert Greville married Blanch Whitney, daughter of Sir Robert Whitney and Sybil Baskerville.1 Robert Greville was born circa 1537 at of Thorpe Latimer, Lincolnshire, England.1 He died on 17 March 1612 at of Thorpe Lat
2 CONC imer, Lincolnshire, England.2
2 CONT *''''''Family Blanch Whitney b. c 1548 
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S11588] Some Early English Pedigrees, by Vernon M. Norr, p. 146.
2 CONT *2.[S61] Unknown author, Family Group Sheets, SLC Archives.
2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1278.htm#i38395
2 CONT *______________________ From Jorge Castell's page on the Grevilles:
2 CONT *''''''Robert GREVILLE
2 CONT *''''''Born: BET 1537 / 1539, Thorpe Latimer, Lincolnshire, England
2 CONT *''''''Died: 17 Mar 1612/13
2 CONT *''''''Buried: Helpringham, Lincolnshire, England
2 CONT *''''''Notes: Servant/Attendent to Queen Elizabeth I 16 Dec 1594. Devised the Land at Thorpe Latimer for life from father Fulke.
2 CONT *Father: Fulke GREVILLE of Beauchamp's Court (Sir)
2 CONT *Mother: Elizabeth WILLOUGHBY
2 CONT *''''''Married: Blanche WHITNEY (b. ABT 1541 - d. 19 Dec 1612) (dau. of Sir Robert Whitney and Sybill Baskerville) ABT 1574, Thorpe Latimer, Lincolnshire, England
2 CONT *Children: 
2 CONT **1. Fulke GREVILLE of Wadsworth
2 CONT **2. Anne GREVILLE
2 CONT **3. Blanche GREVILLE (b. 19 Aug 1578)
2 CONT **4. Dorothy GREVILLE
2 CONT *http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/GREVILLE.htm#Robert GREVILLE1
2 CONT *______________________ From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Robert Greville:
2 CONT *''''''Robert Greville1
2 CONT *M, #19106
2 CONT *Last Edited=3 Jun 2008
2 CONT *''''''Robert Greville was the son of Sir Fulke Greville and Elizabeth Willoughby, Baroness Willoughby de Broke.1
2 CONT *''''''Robert Greville lived at Thorpe Latimer, Lincolnshire, England.1 Ancestor of the Earl of Warwick.
2 CONT *''''''Child of Robert Greville and Blanche Whitney
2 CONT **1.Fulke Greville+1 d. 1632
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extin
2 CONC ct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume II, page 333. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT *http://thepeerage.com/p1911.htm#i19106
2 CONT *___________________ From the Celtic Casimir online family tree:
