2 CONT *''''''Born: Abt 1537, of Thorpe Latimer, Lincolnshire, ENG 
2 CONT *''''''Died: 1612 
2 CONT *General Notes:
2 CONT *''''''!NOTE: Named in the will of his father (q.v.). 
