2 CONT *''''''     Fulke Greville was the son of Robert Greville and Blanche Whitney.1 He married Mary Copley, daughter of Christopher Copley, on 15 May 1602. He died in 1632.
2 CONT *''''''     He lived at Thorpe Latimer, Lincolnshire, England.1
2 CONT *''''''Children of Fulke Greville and Mary Copley
