2 CONT Alleged Royal Ancestry of John Whitney  Whitney Family Groups > John Whitney Family > Alleged Royal Ancestry of John Whitney  Descents of John1 Whitney from the kings of England. There are also descents from David I, King of Scotl
2 CONC and, Louis VI, King of France, Alfonso IX, King of Leon, various kings of Ireland and princes of Wales, and multiple descents from Charlemagne.  This information is from the following web site: The Phillips, Weber, Kirk, & Staggs 
2 CONC families of the Pacific Northwest
2 CONT
