2 CONT *'''     Joan Beaufort was born illegitimately circa 1402 at Westminster, London, England.1,2 She was the daughter of Henry de Beaufort and Alice FitzAlan.1 She married Sir Edward Stradling, son of Sir William Stradling and Isobel
2 CONC  St. Barbe.1 She died circa 1453.2
2 CONT *'''      Her married name became Stradling.1
2 CONT *'''Child of Joan Beaufort and Sir Edward Stradling
