2 CONT
2 CONT      Sir Edward Stradling was born in 1474 at St. Donats, Glamorgan, Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT  He was the son of Thomas Stradling and Janet Matthew.
2 CONT
2 CONT  He married Elizabeth Arundell, daughter of Thomas Arundell and Catherine Dynham.
2 CONT
2 CONT  He died on 8 May 1535.
2 CONT
2 CONT      He was the ancestor of the Stradlings, Baronets of St. Donats.
2 CONT
