2 CONT *''''''     Jane Stradling was born circa 1477 at of St. Donats, Glamorganshire, Wales.2 She married Sir William Griffith, High Sheriff of Carnarvonshire, Deputy Justice & Chamberlain of North Wales, son of Sir William Griffith, C
2 CONC hamberlain of North Wales and Jane Troutbeck, circa 1500; They had 5 sons (William; Edward, Esq; Sir Rhys; John; & Hugh) and 8 daughters (Grace, wife of Sir William Stanley; Jane, wife of Thomas Mostyn; Elen/Elinor, wife of Hugh C
2 CONC onway, Esq; Catrin/Catherine, wife of Sir Richard Bulkeley; Anne, wife of Hugh Lewis, Esq; Elizabeth, wife of John Philipps, Esq; Dorothy, wife of William Williams, Esq; & Margaret, wife of Peter Mytton, of Thomas Griffith, & of H
2 CONC ugh Thelwall).2,3,4 Jane Stradling died before 1520.2,3
