2 CONC s, Hugh and John, and three daughters, Margaret (wife of William ap Tudor), Elizabeth, and Anne. He married (1st) ELEN FERCH TUDUT FYCHAN. He was living 1541-2.
2 CONT **Pg. 297
2 CONT **17. JOHN NANNAU alias JOHN AP GRUFFUDD, of Dyffydan (in Dolgelly), Merionethshire. He married ELSBETH FERCH DAFYDD LLWYD, of Trawvynydd. They had one son, Lewis, and two daughters, Ellen and Jane. He held land in the township of
2 CONC  Dyffrydan in Dolgelly, Merionethshire.
2 CONT ***18. LEWIS AP JOHN AP GRUFFUDD, Gent., of Dyffrydan (in Dolgelly), Merionethshire. He married ELLIN FERCH HYWEL AP GRUFFUDD They had two sons, Rees and Owen. LEWIS AP JOHN AP GRUFFUDD was living 28 August 1654. _________________
