1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Genealogy of the family of Samborne or Sanborn in England and America. 1194-1898 (1899) Vol. 1
2 CONT *http://www.archive.org/details/genealogyoffamil01sanb
2 CONT *http://www.archive.org/stream/genealogyoffamil01sanb#page/39/mode/1up
