1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 5/11/2020 Edit Uploaded pdf to Media Tab documents <br/>
2 CONT '''The English Ancestry of New England Settlers Joshua and Anthony Fisher, by Myrtle Stevens Hyde and John Plummer, NEHGR 1997 Vol 151 p 171+'''
2 CONT
2 CONT William Fisher and Margerie (Bert) Fisher (John and Christian (NN) Fisher's grandson) were grandparents of settlers Joshua and Anthony.  The article also provides information on this profile's sons William and Robert and grandson 
2 CONC William. Contrary to numerous publications, this profile's parents are UNKNOWN and husband John's parents are UNKNOWN.  He WAS NOT the son of Robert Fisher Jr., who was executed over a decade later. This is the profile formerly mi
2 CONC staken for William's grandfather John.   https://www.geni.com/people/Saint-John-Fisher/6000000000223284091?through=6000000008827915461
2 CONT
2 CONT The 1997 article uses original doc research and corrects some of the main 2 sources cited.<br/>
2 CONT --The Fisher Genealogy by Philip A. Fisher (Everett, Mass, 1898)<br/>
2 CONT --Descendants of Richard Fiske of Laxfield by Jack Own Jevons (Boulder, Colo,, 1987)<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>
