2 CONT From thePeerage.com:
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Cave is the son of Thomas Cave and Thomasine Passamer. He married, firstly, Elizabeth Marvyn, daughter of John Marvyn. He married, secondly, Margaret Saxby, daughter of Sir Thomas Saxby.
2 CONT
2 CONT He also had a daughter by his first wife, and another daughter by his second wife. He lived at Stanford, Northamptonshire, England. He was also known as Roger.
