2 CONT *'''     Richard Cave is the son''' of Thomas Cave and Thomasine Passamer.2 '''He married, firstly, Elizabeth Marvyn''', daughter of John Marvyn.1 '''He married, secondly, Margaret Saxby''', daughter of Sir Thomas Saxby.1
2 CONT *'''      He also had a daughter by his first wife, and another daughter by his second wife.1 He lived at Stanford, Northamptonshire, England.1 He was also known as Roger.1
2 CONT *'''Child of Richard Cave and Elizabeth Marvyn
2 CONT **Edward Cave+2
2 CONT *'''Children of Richard Cave and Margaret Saxby
