1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Edward Cave1
2 CONT *'''M, #51210, b. circa 1491, d. 1533
2 CONT *Father	Richard Cave, Esq. b. c 1470, d. 20 Apr 1538
2 CONT *Mother	Elizabeth Marvin b. c 1470, d. 9 Aug 1493
2 CONT *'''     Edward Cave was born circa 1491 at of Winwick, Northamptonshire, England.1 He married Dorothy Mallory''', daughter of Nicholas Mallory, circa 1512 at of Northamptonshire, England.1 Edward Cave died in 1533.
2 CONT *'''Family     Dorothy Mallory b. c 1493
2 CONT *Child	
2 CONT **Katherine Cave+1 b. c 1515, d. 18 Aug 1555
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *[S61] Unknown author, Family Group Sheets, Family History Archives, SLC.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1704.htm#i51210 ___________________
2 CONT *'''Edward Cave1
2 CONT *M, #210215
2 CONT *Last Edited=5 Nov 2006
2 CONT *'''     Edward Cave is the son''' of Richard Cave and Elizabeth Marvyn.2
2 CONT *'''     He lived at Wenwick, Northamptonshire, England.1
2 CONT *'''Children of Edward Cave
2 CONT **Catharine Cave1
2 CONT **Margaret Cave1
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *[S37] BP2003 volume 1, page 725. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
