1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Family and Education b. by 1532, 2nd s. of John, 1st Baron Mordaunt, of Turvey, Beds. by Elizabeth, da. and coh. of Sir Henry Vere of Great Addington Northants., bro. of Sir John. educ. M. Temple. unm.2
