1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Strangeways-60
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor Trenchard formerly Strangeways
2 CONT Born about 1506 in Melberrie Sampford, Dorset
2 CONT ANCESTORS 
2 CONT Daughter of Giles Strangways and Jane (Mordaunt) Strangways
2 CONT Sister of Henry Strangways
2 CONT Wife of Thomas Trenchard — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT DESCENDANTS 
2 CONT Mother of Thomas Trenchard
2 CONT Died after 1564 in Wolfeton House Dorsetmap [uncertain]
2 CONT Profile manager: Susan ScarcellaProfile last modified 22 Nov 2019 
2 CONT Created 6 Apr 2016
2 CONT This page has been accessed 676 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT Eleanor was born in 1500.
2 CONT
2 CONT 'Strangeways01'Index links to: Lead / Letter Families covered: Strangeways of Harsley, Strangways of Ormesby
2 CONT
2 CONT This family's names is spelt in modern times as either Strangeways or Strangways. It appears from the Visitation records that, generally speaking, the Yorkshire branch used Strangeways and, later on at least, the Dorset branch use
2 CONC d Strangways. However, cross-references from other sources are not fully consistent with this. Henry Stranguyshe 1. James Stranguyshe m. Jone Orrell (dau of Nicholas Orrell) A. Sir James Strangways of Harsley Castle (Speaker of th
2 CONC e House of Commons) m1. Elizabeth Darcy (dau of Philip Darcy, 6th Lord) i. Sir Richard Strangeways of West Harsley (d 13.04.1488) m. Elizabeth Nevill (dau of William Nevill, Earl of Kent, Lord Fauconberg) a. Sir James Strangeways 
2 CONC of Harsley (d 16.12.1521) m1. (07.09.1472) Alice Scrope (dau of Thomas Scrope, 5th Lord of Masham and Upsal) (1) Sir Thomas Strangeways (d before 08.10.1525) m. Ann Dacre (dau of Humphrey, Lord Dacre) (A) Thomas Strangeways (B) (S
2 CONC ir) James Strangeways 'of Harsley Castle' (dsp 26.04.1541) m. Elsabeth Pygot (dsp, dau/heir of Thomas Pygot of North Hall 'of Clotherholme') (2) Richard Strangeways (3) James Strangeways m. Elsabeth Ratclyff (sister of Sir Edward 
2 CONC Ratclyff) (4) Margaret Strangeways m. John Dawnay (5) Jane Strangeways (d 15.11.1546) m1. John Bygott (son of Sir Raff) m2. (c11.1522) Sir William Mauleverer or Maleverer of Wothersome (d 11.08.1551) (6) Mary Strangeways m. Robert
2 CONC  Roos or Ross of Ingmanthorpe (d 05.1530, son of James) m2. Margaret Danby (dau of Sir James Danby) (7)+ other issue b. Joan Strangeways m. Randolff Pygot c. Margery Strangeways m. George Savage (brother of the Archbishop of York)
2 CONC  d.+ other issue (d young) - William, Thomas, Elsabeth ii. Sir James Strangeways of Smeton The following is supported by FMG (vol 2, MS261, 'Strangways', p631). m. Ann Conyers (d 03.1517-7, dau of Robert Conyers "of Horneby in Cly
2 CONC veland (Ormesby)") a. James Strangwayes of Ormesby (d 03.1526-7) m. Ann Trafford (dau of Sir Edmund Trafford) (1) James Strangwayes of (Southhouse & Pickering and) Ormesby (d 01.1547-8) m. Agnes Danby (dau/coheir of Ralph Danby of
