2 CONC es him Thomas and shows only 1 wife, a dau of Sir John Wadham (m2. John Strangwayes), implying that she was mother of Giles, John & Mary. We provisionally follow Visitation (1563-4) which names him Henry and shows his 2nd wife Dor
2 CONC othy as mother of his surviving children. m1. (sps) _ Wadam (dau of Sir John Wadam or Wadham) m2. Dorothy Arundell (dau of Sir John Arundell) a. Sir Giles Strangeways of Melbury m. Jane Mordaunt (dau of Sir John Mordaunt) b.+ othe
