2 CONT '''Margaret Hody'''1 
2 CONT F, #670683, '''b. circa 1440'''
2 CONT Last Edited=5 Nov 2015
2 CONT '''Margaret Hody was born circa 1440.1 She was the daughter''' of Sir John Hody and Elizabeth Jewel.1 '''She married Thomas Baynham''', son of Robert ap Eynon and Margaret Abrahall, '''circa 1458.'''1
2 CONT '''From circa 1458, her married name became Baynham.'''1
2 CONT '''Child of Margaret Hody and Thomas Baynham'''
2 CONT 1. Alexander Baynham+1 b. c 1459, d. 25 Sep 1524
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT 1. [S3268] Hans Harmsen, "re: Chester  Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 21 August 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Chester Family."
2 CONT From: https://thepeerage.com/p67069.htm#i670683
