1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Edmund was a son of Michael Cooper & Elizabeth Page.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Cooper-1311
2 CONT
2 CONT ===
2 CONT Edmund Cooper (bef. 1542 - bef. 1619)===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Edmund Cooper aka Cowper
2 CONT
2 CONT Born before 1 Dec 1542 in Arlesey, Bedfordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Michael Cooper and Elizabeth (Paige) Cooper
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Agnes Cooper, Judith Cooper, Olyver Cooper, George Cooper, John Cooper, Richard Cooper and Jasper Smythe [half]
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Mary (Wyne) Cooper — married 14 Aug 1564 in Arlesey, Bedfordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Elizabeth Cowper, Joan Cowper, Michael Cowper, Benjamin Cooper, Martha (Cooper) Samson, James Cooper, John Cooper, Thomas Cooper, Agnes (Cooper) Tilley, Mary Cooper and Robert (Cowper) Cooper
2 CONT
2 CONT Died before 4 Jan 1619 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 25 Jul 2020 | Created 27 Mar 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Edmund Cooper, styled later as gent. of Henlow, was baptized on 1 Dec 1542 at Arlesey, Bedfordshire, England, the son of Michael Cooper, with, as was usual at that time, no mother named.[1][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT In his father's will dated 2 Jul 1556, Edmund was devised a house and land in Henlow, Bedfordshire, which adjoins Arlesey..
2 CONT
2 CONT Edmund married on 14 Aug 1564 at Arlesey, Mary Wyne.[2][3] She was buried on 22 May 1598 at Henlow.[2][4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Edmund Cooper and Mary Wynne
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Edmund and Mary:[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Cooper, bpt 9 Sept 1565 Henlow
2 CONT Joan Cooper, bpt 2 Aug 1567, bur 25 Aug 1567 Henlow
2 CONT Michael Cooper, bpt 9 Dec 1571; m 1) Alice Squire, 2) Elizabeth Moorton
2 CONT Benjamin Cooper, bpt 28 Aug 1575, bur 25 May 1657 Henlow
2 CONT Martha Cooper, bpt 15 Mar 1577/8
2 CONT John Cooper, bpt 29 Jun 1580
2 CONT Thomas Cooper, bpt 20 May 1583
2 CONT Agnes Cooper, bpt 7 Nov 1585
2 CONT Mary Cooper, bpt 12 May 1588
2 CONT Robert Cooper, bpt 24 Jan 1591/2
2 CONT Edmund married 2nd on 30 Jan 1599/1600 at Henlow, Dorothy Manfield.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Edmund was buried on 4 Jan 1618/9 at Henlow, Bedfordshire, England.[2][5]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ "The Parish Register of Arlesey, 1538-1812", transcribed by Bedfordshire Archives and Records Service, publisher Bedfordshire County Council 1977
2 CONT ↑ 2.0 2.1 2.2 2.3 2.4 2.5 Ward, Robert Leigh, "English Ancestry of Seven Mayflower Passengers, Tilley, Sampson and Cooper." The American Genealogist. New Haven, CT: D. L. Jacobus, 1937-. AmericanAncestors.org NEHGS (Vol 52, Pages 
2 CONC 205-6).
2 CONT ↑ "The Parish Register of Arlesey, 1538-1812"
2 CONT ↑ "The Parish Register of Henlow, 1558-1812", transcribed by Bedfordshire Archives and Records Service, publisher Bedfordshire County Council
2 CONT ↑ "The Parish Register of Henlow, 1558-1812"
2 CONT The American Genealogist, vol. 52 (1976) pages 198 to 208; The Genealogist, vol.6 (1985) pages 166-186, Robert Leigh Ward
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Edmund Cooper 
2 CONT *BIRTH	1 Dec 1542 Arlesey, Central Bedfordshire Unitary Authority, Bedfordshire, England *DEATH	4 Jan 1619 (aged 76) Henlow, Central Bedfordshire Unitary Authority, Bedfordshire, England 
2 CONT *BURIAL	 St Mary Churchyard Henlow, Central Bedfordshire Unitary Authority, Bedfordshire, England  
2 CONT *PLOT	NO GRAVESTONE [Separatists] MEMORIAL ID	44835439
2 CONT
2 CONT Edmund was a son of Michael Cooper & Elizabeth Page.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was baptised on 1 Dec 1542 at Arlesey, Bedfordshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married on 14 Aug 1564 at Arlesey, Bedfordshire, England to Mary Wyne.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had 10 children: . Elizabeth Cooper (1565) . Joan Cooper (1567 - 1567) . Michael Cooper (1571 - 1598) + sp: Alice Squier + sp: Elizabeth Morton . Benjamin Cooper (1575 - 1657) + sp: Rose Haggis . Martha Cooper (1578) + sp: Ja
2 CONC mes Sampson . John Cooper (1580) + sp: Mary . Thomas Cooper (1583 - 1675) + sp: Mary Raynor + sp: Sarah Slye . Agnes Cooper (1585 - 1621) + sp: Edmund Tilley . Mary Cooper (1588 - 1590) . Robert Cooper (1591) + sp: Joan Gresham
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of his 1st wife, he was married 2nd on 30 Jan 1600 at Henlow, Bedfordshire, England to Dorothy Mansfield.
2 CONT
2 CONT Edmund was buried on 4 Jan 1619 at Henlow, Bedfordshire, England. [4 Jan 1618 Old Style]
2 CONT
2 CONT Gravesite Details Sources: The American Genealogist, vol. 52 (1976) pages 198 to 208; The Genealogist, vol.6 (1985) pages 166-186, Robert Leigh Ward
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members Parents Michael Cooper 1510–1556
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Page Cooper 1515–1569
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse Mary Wyne Cooper 1543–1598 (m. 1564)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children Elizabeth Cooper 1565 – unknown Joan Cooper 1567–1567 Michael Cooper 1571–1598 Benjamin Cooper 1575–1657 Martha Cooper Samson 1578–1654 John Cooper 1580 – unknown Thomas Cooper 1583–1675 Agnes Ann Cooper Tilley 1585–1621 
2 CONC Mary Cooper 1588–1590 Robert Cooper 1591–1620 Thomas Cooper
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Reference
2 CONT *56. Ward, Robert Leigh, English Ancestry of Seven Mayflower Passengers: Tilley, Sampson and Cooper, American Genealogist, 52, (1976), pp. 198-208, available in the Newberry Library.
2 CONT * http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~ktupper/ps03/ps03_022.html
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=44835439 www.findagrave.com
