2 CONT ===  [sims .ftw] Any number of people have w ===
2 CONT [sims .ftw] Any number of people have written about this Sims family. A partial list of books and people who have worked on this family:  Henry Upton Sims---The Genealogy of the Sims Family;  Paul H Arnot---Notes on the Sims of Ha
2 CONC nover-Louisa Counties;  William H Back and William W. Jones---Walton-Sims of Eastern Virginia;  Billie Louise and Robert Jones Owen---Sims Kin, The Decedents of William Symes of Poundford;  Rev. E. M. Sharp---A History of the Sims
2 CONC  Family.      See also 1992 International Genealogical Index , WFT Pedigree Chart 0683, Vol 5
2 CONT
