2 CONT *CHILDREN of Isabella Fychet & Robert Hill
2 CONT **      John, b. before 1402; d. Oct. 21 (? 14), 1434. = Cicely, dau. of John Stourton, of Preston, near Yeovil, by his second wife (? Joan, dau. of Wm. Banastre, of Radstock); coheir of father and mother. She mar. (2) Sir Thomas 
2 CONC Keryell, of Westonhanger, near Dover (exec. 1461); d. April 18, 1472.
2 CONT **CHILDREN of Cicely Stourton and John Hill
