2 CONT *   We now return to John, fecond fon of Sir John Cole, Knt. who married Jane, daughter of Robert Meryot of Devon, and had two fons, viz. Simon his heir; and William of whom prefently.
2 CONT *   Simon Cole the eldeft fon was feated at Slade in county of Devon, and marrying Alice, daughter and coheir to —— Leure, had a daughter Johan married to William Hele of Copney-Wood in Devon, Efq.; and a fon, John of Slade, who d
2 CONC ied 21 November 1543 (35 Hen. VIII.) 1 having had iffue by his wife Thomazine daughter and heir to —— Walcott, a '''fon and heir Thomas, who married firft Joan, daughter''' of William Stourton, Efq. and '''having no iffue by her, 
2 CONC he married fecondly Joan, daughter and heir''' to John Hill, of Buckland, Efq. '''and dying 3 : January 1541, (32 Hen. VIII.) left three fons viz.''' William his heir ; Richard* (of Buckland, county of Devon, who married Alice, da
2 CONC ughter of John Greinfield, Efq. of Exeter, and died 5 February 1572, (15 Eliz.) leaving a fon John, who married Catharine, daughter of —— Hele, and died 1 June 1582 (24 Eliz.) having had iffue John, who died 13 April 1595 without 
2 CONC iffue ; and two daughters, Alice the eldeft married to George, fon of Sir George Southcot, Knt. by whom he had a fon George, born in 1599 ; and Johan, the fecond, married Sir John Prideaux, † Knt,); Robert, the third fon of Thomas
2 CONC ,
