2 CONT When Edward Bond was born in 1530, in Buckland St Mary, Somerset, England, United Kingdom, his father, Willyam Bond, was 37 and his mother, Dionise Bourman, was 33. He married Florence Brandbridge in 1560. They were the parents of
2 CONC  at least 1 son. He died in 1592, in London, England, at the age of 62.
