2 CONT *https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Leigh_(Lord_Mayor) Sir Thomas Leigh (c. 1504 – 15 November 1571[2]) was an English merchant and Lord Mayor of London in 1558-59. He served as a City Alderman from 1552 until 1571.
