2 CONT *2. William Cony m. ___ Bell (dau of ___ Bell of Fishtoft)
2 CONT **    A. Richard Cony of Bassingthorpe (bur 12.04.1545) m. Jane Ellis (bur 05.07.1549. dau of Thomas Ellis of Paunton)
2 CONT ***'''         i. Thomas Cony of Bassingthorpe (b c 1529, bur 15.10.1611) m. Alice Leigh (d before 1621, dau of Sir Thomas Leigh, Lord Mayor of London)
2 CONT ****            a. Sir Thomas Coney of Bassingthorpe (bpt 15.09.1561, bur 22.11.1637) m1. Elizabeth Patten (dau of William Patten of Stoke Newington by Anne Johnson)
2 CONT ****                m2. (18.03.1591-2) Anne Upton (dau of Hamon Upton of Northelmeby-Wainfleet, widow of William Tyndall)
2 CONT ****            b. Sir Richard Coney of Whissendine (a 04.1607) m. Eleanor Harrington (d 1622, dau of John Harrington of Witham-on-the-Hill by Rose)
2 CONT ****            c. Peregrine Cony (bpt 30.10.1569, 4th son) m. Cecily Dillon of Ireland
2 CONT ****            d. Arthur Coney (bpt 30.06.1577) m. ___ Upton of Northolme
2 CONT ****            e. Chaworth Coney (bpt 03.03.1578-9) m. Anne Sheppard (dau of Alexander Sheppard of Peasemarsh)
2 CONT ****            f. Susan Coney (bpt 01.05.1568) m. (10.11.1584) Sir William Sutton of Averham
2 CONT ****            g. Rose Coney (bpt 14.06.1573) m. (16.04.1595) Thomas Butler of Paunton
2 CONT ****            h. Frances Coney (bpt 01.03.1574-5) m. (22.01.1599-1600) Augustine Earle of Stragglethorpe
2 CONT ****            i. Alice Coney m. Matthew Goche of Alvingham
2 CONT ****            j. Jane Coney m. (12.11.1576) Vincent Welby of Halstead in Stixwould
2 CONT ****            k.+ other issue - George, Marry (bpt 21.07.1566, bur 13.01.1567)      
