1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas Hale, son of William Hale, Esq., of King's Walden, and wife Rose Bond, was born May 15, 1606 in King's Walden, Hertfordshire, England. He was baptized in the parish church on May 25, 1606. Nothing more is kn
2 CONC own of him after the baptism. He is presumed to have died before his father, as he is not named in his father's will.
2 CONT
2 CONT This is not the Thomas Hale who emigrated to Newbury, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT See also:
2 CONT *''The New England Historical and Genealogical Register, Volume 35'' (available as Google e-book)
