2 CONT >John Churchill, eldest Son and Heir of Jasper, by Elizabeth Chaplet, was of the Society of the Middle-Temple, where, by his Proficiency in the Study of the Laws, he made an Addition to his Estate, and was seated at Mtntern in the
2 CONC  County of Dorset. He married Sarah, Daughter and Co-heir of Sir Henry Winston, of Standiston, in the County of Gloucester, by Dionifi his Wife, Daughter and Co-heir of Sir Thomas Bond, Kt. and by her was Father of Sir Winston Chu
2 CONC rchill, born at Wotton-Glanville in the County of Dorset
