2 CONT
2 CONT No record of his being knighted, although it may have been done privately by, or as a courtesy to, his father (by this time the Crown had the privilege firmly in hand).
2 CONT
2 CONT It is *extremely* unlikely that he had more than the one son - and that one may actually have been posthumous.
