1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Paulet,_2nd_Marquess_of_Winchester
2 CONT
2 CONT John Paulet, 2nd Marquess of Winchester (c. 1510 – 4 November 1576) was the son of William Paulet, 1st Marquess of Winchester and Elizabeth Capell.
2 CONT
2 CONT  He was married three times:
2 CONT
2 CONT  first to Elizabeth Willoughby, daughter of Robert Willoughby, 2nd Lord Willoughby de Broke and Dorothy Grey;
2 CONT
2 CONT  second to Elizabeth Seymour, daughter of Sir John Seymour and Margery Wentworth; 
2 CONT
2 CONT and thirdly to Winifred Brydges (1507-1586), daughter of Sir John Brugge (Lord Mayor of London 1520-21) and Agnes Ayloffe.
2 CONT
2 CONT [edit]Children
2 CONT
2 CONT by Elizabeth Willoughby
2 CONT
2 CONT William Paulet (born about 1532 – 24 November 1598)
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Paulet (1542 – 10 October 1592 married Henry Cromwell, 3rd Baron Cromwell of Oakham
2 CONT
2 CONT George Paulet (died May, 1608)
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Paulet
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Paulet
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Paulet
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
