2 CONT
2 CONT      John Paulett, 2nd Marquess of Winchester married Elizabeth Willoughby, daughter of Robert Willoughby, 2nd Lord Willoughby de Broke and Dorothy Grey.
2 CONT
2 CONT  He married Winifred Brydges, daughter of Sir John Brydges, before 14 May 1571.
2 CONT
2 CONT  He died on 4 November 1576.
2 CONT
2 CONT      John Paulett, 2nd Marquess of Winchester gained the title of 2nd Marquess of Winchester.
2 CONT
