1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Brief Life History of Elizabeth
2 CONT When Elizabeth Tuke was born about 1503, in Woolwich, Kent, England, her father, Brian Tuke, was 35 and her mother, Grissell Boughton, was 29. She married George Touchet 9th Lord Audley of Heleigh in 1518. They were the parents of
2 CONC  at least 2 sons and 3 daughters. She died on 4 September 1554, in Scot's Hall, Kent, England, at the age of 52.
