1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Maria Sneyd''' was born circa 1539. Her father was [https://www.geni.com/profile-83666906 Sir William Sneyd, of Bradwell, Knt.]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34665321414 John Delves, ESQ] in 1559. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34665321159 Henry Delves, Esq. of Duddington]. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Children : Henry, Laurence, William, Thomas, Ralph, John, Hugo, - Margaret, Anne, Allanora
