1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From [http://newsgroups.derkeiler.com/Archive/Soc/soc.genealogy.medieval/2014-02/msg00081.html link] to Royal Ancestry of Margaret Domville, wife of Richard Hatton and Richard Banks 2014 - email Gen-Med, Richardson
