2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 6 JAN 1587
2 PLAC Sudeley, , Gloucestershire, England
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 20 JAN 1633
2 PLAC Whitefriars, London, Middlesex, England
2 ADDR
1 BURI
2 DATE 9 FEB 1633
2 PLAC Ashby-De-La-Souc,Ashby-de-la-Zouc,Leicestershire,England
