2 CONT Under this Marble Stone thofe Afhes lye Which are ye Embers of Eternitye No Embers couch more marks of fire, then ihe Had lights of vertue now aileep they bee Butt yet lhall rife again & he whofe breath Firft rais'd her out of nou
2 CONC ght, ihall out of death. Then ihall thofe flames lhine brighter yn ye Sun And like it burne without Confumption. MS. Bowles..
