1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bridget Goddard was an ancestor of  Elizabeth II, Queen of England.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===family===
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://www.genealogy.com/forum/surnames/topics/cordray/152/
2 CONT
2 CONT Bridget Goddard,b.abt.1580 in Eastwoodhay,Hampshire,Eng. d/o Edward Goddard and Mary Kingsmill married William Cordray,b.abt.1575 in Bedfordshire, Eng.s/o Thomas Cordray and Jane Morris
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT * 1. William Cordray,b.abt.1601
2 CONT * 2. Edward Cordray,b.abt.1603
2 CONT * 3. Bridget Cordray,b.abt.1604 in Chute Co., Eng..m/ Samuel Ironmonger,b.July 23,1607;d.1650 in VA. M/ 23 July,1622 in Salisbury, Eng. Bridget died 1650 in Dennington,Suffolk Co.,Eng.Child of Bridget Cordray and Samuel Ironmonger
2 CONC  was Francis Ironmonger
2 CONT * 4. Anna Cordray,b.29 April,1609;d.1670 in Glocester Co.,VA. m/ Richard Bernard,b.abt.1608 in Turvey,Bedford,Eng..Mariage date..Nov.24,1634 in London, Eng.  Child of Anna Cordray and Richard Bernard was Anna Bernard,b.abt.1640.Is
2 CONC le of Wight, VA.d.April 14,1698 M/ John Smith.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT From https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Goddard-91
2 CONT
2 CONT >Bridget Goddard married 2nd to Jasper Mompesson, son of Drew Mompesson and Elizabeth Bridges, before 1636/7. Bridget Mompesson was buried on 9 March 1654 / 5 at Chute, Wiltshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===notes===
2 CONT
2 CONT Bridget did not marry a Reade. Following was posted as a comment:
2 CONT
2 CONT >"Per England & Wales Marriages, 1538-1940, Place: Haddenham, Cambridgeshire, England; Date Range: 1598 - 1627; Film Number: 1040479 Barbara Goddard married John Reade on e 25 Nov 1602 at Haddenham, Cambridgeshire, England, these 
2 CONC are the parents of Anne Reade. The mix up of Bridgett and Barbara is everywhere on the internet." See https://www.geni.com/people/Barbara-Reade/6000000071419448216?through=6000000000387033350
2 CONT
