1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Note: Jane Eltonhead (1621-1660), (daughter of Richard Eltonhead, gent (1580-1664), and his wife Anne Sutton (1590-1654)) who was born at Eltonhead in Lancashire. Her first husband was Capt Robert Moryson, and as his widow married
2 CONC  in 1649 to Cuthbert Fenwick, gent (1614-1655). Cuthbert Fenwick was likely the person of that same name born in 1614 in Ponteland Parish, Northumberland, to John Fenwick and Jenneta Pye. Fenwick Manor [2000-acre tract in Resurrec
2 CONC tion Hundred, Saint Mary's County (then Calvert County)] was surveyed in 1651 for Cuthbert, and granted with Court Baron privileges.
2 CONT
