2 CONC l acquainted with severall of ye said Sr. Richard Morrysons relacons & has been informed & is well satisfied yt ye said Sr Richard Moryson had five sonnes... Robert ye ffourth sonn... Jurat 28th die Decembr, 1698. Coram Myles Cook
2 CONC e. Recorded 22d of July 1699 P Cha : Jening s Cl Cur. Old Kecoughtan, Elizabeth City County, VA - Old Records; Wm. & Mary Qtrly, Vol. 9, No. 2.
