1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ===brief biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT from  Seldens of Virginia and Allied Families, Volume 1 By Mary Selden Kennedy [https://books.google.com/books?lpg=PA19&dq=rebecca+yeo+john+lear&pg=PA24&id=X6xRAAAAMAAJ&output=text page 24]
2 CONT
2 CONT >"One daughter, Lettice, married the celebrated Lucian Cary, Lord Falkland, the English Chevalier-Bayard, who was killed at the battle of Newberry, September 20, 1643. His wife was noted for her goodness and piety. John Duncan wro
2 CONC te a pamphlet on the 'Holy Life and Death of the Lady Lettice, Vicountess Falkland.' She died February, 1646, in her thirty-fifth year, leaving three sons, the eldest of whom, Harry, Lord Falkland, married Rachel, who survived her
2 CONC  husband." 
2 CONT
