1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Thomas Roper, 2nd Viscount Baltinglass1 
2 CONT *''''''M, #2687, b. before 1622, d. circa April 1666
2 CONT *Last Edited=25 Jan 2004
2 CONT *''''''     Thomas Roper, 2nd Viscount Baltinglass was born before 1622.1 He was the son of Thomas Roper, 1st Viscount Baltinglass and Ann Harington.1 He married Anne Temple, daughter of Sir Peter Temple, 2nd Bt. and Anne Throckmo
2 CONC rton, in 1637.1 He died circa April 1666, without issue.1 He was buried on 25 April 1666 at Thornborough, Buckinghamshire, England.2
2 CONT *''''''     He succeeded to the title of 2nd Viscount Baltinglass, co. Wicklow [I., 1627] on 18 February 1637/38.1 He succeeded to the title of 2nd Baron of Bantry, co. Cork [I., 1627] on 18 February 1637/38.1 In 1660 he petitione
2 CONC d for the command of a company of Foot, which he held before the Commonwealth.1
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Exti
2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 398. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT * 2.[S2] Peter W. Hammond, editor, The Complete Peerage or a History of the House of Lords and All its Members From the Earliest Times, Volume XIV: Addenda & Corrigenda (Stroud, Gloucestershire, U.K.: Sutton Publishing, 1998), pag
2 CONC e 61. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage, Volume XIV.
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p269.htm#i2687
2 CONT *___________________
