2 CONT Brief Life History of Robert
2 CONT Robert Swayne was born in 1535, in Dorset, England. He married Elizabeth Bond in 1562, in Wiltshire, England. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 4 daughters. He died in 1627, in England, at the age of 92.
