1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann Lewis (Lewys) was the daughter of Ann Sackville (the widow of Edward Seymour, Lord Beauchamp) and her second husband Edward Lewis. This marriage took place after 1619, therefore Ann was born after this date[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John Tregonwell MP about 1631 in Edington, Wiltshire. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had no children.
2 CONT
