2 CONT When Sir Francis (5th Baron Parham) Willoughby (6th Baron) Willoughby, (Sheriff of Nottinghamshire) and his twin brother Francis were born in 1547 in Wollaton, Nottinghamshire, England, their father, Sir, was 30, and their mother,
2 CONC  Lady, was 34. He married Lady Elizabeth Lyttleton, Countess of Lyttleton, Baroness Willoughby in 1565 in Nottinghamshire, England. They had seven children in 12 years. He died on November 16, 1596, in Nottinghamshire, England, at
2 CONC  the age of 49, and was buried in England.
2 CONT
