1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Rebecca (Reeves) Goodman''' was born circa 1670. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34675464922 Henry Cabel Reeves, I] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34675464936 Elizabeth (Izard) Reeves of Roquist Swamp, NC].  R
2 CONC ebecca married [https://www.geni.com/profile-58594275 Henry Goodman]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-30658269 Mary Elizabeth (Goodman) Whitfield].  She died in 1702.  ---- Muddled Geneaolog
2 CONC ies:   Family Search family tree shows wrong parents: William Ryves (1636-1695) and Elizabeth Pegram (1645-1702)
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebecca Goodman (born Reeves)<br/>
2 CONT  Birth:	1673 - Old Rappahannock County, Essex, VA<br/>
2 CONT Death:	1702 - Virginia<br/>
2 CONT Parents:	Henry Reeves,<br/>
2 CONT Not the mother:   Elizabeth Reeves (born Bagnall) <br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings:	Genia  Reeves, Joseph Reeves, James Reeves, Mary Monday (born Reeves), Henry Reeves, Jr., Joseph Reeves, Martha Moseley (born Reeves), Elizabeth Munday (born Reeves), Patience Reeves, Ann Coleman (born Reeves)<br/>
