2 CONC  11 Edw. IV... mar. Anne, da. and heir of John Bonville."
2 CONT * [^2]: Frederic Thomas Colby, ed., The Visitation of the County of Devon in the Year 1564 (Exeter: W. Pollard, 1881), 65. "Phillip Copleston, sonne and heyre to John... mar. Anne, daughter and heyre to John Bonville of Shute."
2 CONT * [^3]: Tristram Risdon, The Chorographical Description or Survey of the County of Devon (London: 1811; reprint of 1630 original), 210. "Tamerton-Foliot... came to the family of Coplestone by the marriage of Philip Coplestone with
