2 CONC  Elizabeth, da. and h. of John Hawley." https://books.google.com/books?id=GmqlIibS95IC&pg=PA224.
2 CONT * [^2]: "Walter Coplestone, of Yealmpton," Geni.com, accessed March 9, 2026. "Husband of Elizabeth Stone; Father of Thomas Coplestone, of Bowden and Margaret Coplestone." https://www.geni.com/people/Walter-Coplestone-of-Yealmpton/
2 CONC 6000000006110931652.
2 CONT * [^3]: John Lambrick Vivian, The Visitations of the County of Devon: Comprising the Herald's Visitations of 1531, 1564, & 1620 (Exeter: H.S. Eland, 1895), 224. "Thomas Coplestone of Bowden (son and heir of Walter)... mar. Catheri
2 CONC ne da. of John Vowell alias Hooker of Exeter." https://books.google.com/books?id=GmqlIibS95IC&pg=PA224.
2 CONT * [^4]: "Margaret Coplestone," Geni.com, accessed March 9, 2026. "Daughter of Walter Coplestone and Elizabeth Stone." https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Coplestone/6000000006110931671.
2 CONT
