2 CONT This memorial is dedicated to my ancestor Margaret Woodville. Margaret was the illegitimate daughter of Anthony Woodville, 2nd Earl Rivers and Gwentlian Stradling. 
2 CONT She married Sir Robert Poyntz, son of John Poyntz and Alice Cock.
2 CONT They were the parents of Anne Poyntz, who married John Walsh
