1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 16. John CHURCHILL of Stinsford and Muston, Dorset was born about 1566 in Dorchester, Dorsetshire, England. He graduated in 1587 in Hart Hall, Oxford. He was a Barrister in 1589 in the Middle Temple, London. He die
2 CONC d on 31 May 1621. He was buried in St. Peter's Church, Dorchester, England. He owned Muston Deeds in Piddlehinton, Dorset, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT * son of William CHURCHILL of Dorchester b 1541 & Missy Swayne
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Eleanor MILLER of Came (daughter of John MILLER of Winterborne, Kyme (Came) and Anne WINTERHAY of Chethall, Dorset) about 1595 in Dorchester, Dorsetshire, England. Eleanor MILLER of Came was born before 1575. She
2 CONC  died between 16 Apr 1641 and 10 Jul 1641. She had an estate probated on 10 Jul 1641. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John CHURCHILL of Stinsford and Muston, Dorset and Eleanor MILLER of Came had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # William  of Munston (born about 1596).
2 CONT # Anne  (born about 1597).
2 CONT # John was born about 1598 in Dorchester, Dorsetshire, England. He died an INFANT.
2 CONT # George Gervase  (born about 1599).
2 CONT # Richard (born in 1601).
2 CONT # Maximilian was born in 1602 in Dorchester, Dorsetshire, England. He died after 16 Apr 1641.
2 CONT # Reverend John R.,  Rector of Stinsford and Steeple M.A (born about 1603).
2 CONT # Jasper was born about 1604 in Dorchester, Dorsetshire, England.
2 CONT # Robert  was born about 1605 in Dorchester, Dorsetshire, England.
2 CONT # Edith  (born between 1589 and 1609).
2 CONT # Sarah
2 CONT # Thomas (born in 1612).
2 CONT # Matthew was born in 1615 in Dorchester, Dorsetshire, England. He was baptised on 9 Jun 1615 in Dorchester, Holy Trinity, Dorsetshire, England. He died after 16 Apr 1641.
2 CONT # Jane  (born between 1591 and 1615).
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://genforum.genealogy.com/churchill/messages/1168.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Slightly different:
2 CONT
2 CONT John Churchill was born in 1561 in Muston. He died May 31, 1621 and was buried June 3, 1621 in Muston.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Eleanor (Elinor) Meller in 1585 in England. She was the daughter of John Meller. Eleanor was born 1565 in Muston, and died May 31, 1621 in Muston. She was buried June 3, 1621, the same day her husband was buried.
2 CONT
2 CONT # Joseph Churchill, born about 1586 in Muston.  
2 CONT # Anne Churchill, born 1587 in Muston.  
2 CONT # Edith Churchill, born 1589 in Muston  
2 CONT # Jane Churchill, born 1591 in Muston  
2 CONT # Sarah Churchill, born 1593 in Muston  
2 CONT # Matthew Churchill, born 1596 in Muston  
2 CONT # Gervais Churchill, born 1597  
2 CONT # John Churchill, born 1599 in Muston, died in 1601 in Muston  
2 CONT # Richard Churchill, born 1601  
2 CONT # John Churchill, (*) born 1603  
2 CONT # Robert Churchill, born 1605, in Muston  
2 CONT # Jasper Churchill, born 1607, Muston  
2 CONT # Maxillian Churchill, born 1609, Musotn.  
2 CONT # Thomas Churchill, bonr1611, Muston  
2 CONT # William Churchill, born 1613 in Muston. 
2 CONT
2 CONT _________________
2 CONT
2 CONT John Churchill, the eldest son of William, was born about 1512. John married Edith Bond. He died between 15 April 1557 and 25 August 1557. He had three children, William, Elizabeth, and John
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT # [http://genforum.genealogy.com/churchill/messages/3023.html Re: Josiah (Josias) Churchill (ca. 1613 - 1686)] 2012 (msg from Malcolm Churchill)
2 CONT
