2 CONT **	GOULD.
2 CONT *John Gold, a crusader in Palestine, for his valour at the siege of Damietta 1217 was granted an estate at Seaborough, co. Somerset, by Ralph de Vallibut, A. D. 1220. Mon. eff. in Seaborough church. = ch: . . . .  Gold of Seaborou
2 CONC gh.
2 CONT **     . . .  Gold of Seaborough. = ch: Elias Gold
2 CONT ***          Elias Gold of Seaborough. Ped. fin. 1315, No. 99, Dorset. = ch: John (m. Joan _ ), Robert, William (m. Matilda _ ), Edward Gold
2 CONT ****               .... etc.
2 CONT ****               John Gold of Seaborough. Ped fin. 1320, No. 165, Dorset. Inq. p.m. 1320. = Joan, da. of . . .  Ped. fin. 1320, deat in 1323. Ped. fin. No. 179, Dorset. ; ch: John (m. Isabell _ ) Gold
2 CONT *****                    John Gold of Seaborough, son and heir, aged . . .  at his father's death, purchased the Manor of John de Rocheford 1320, presented to the Rectory of Seaborough 6 Mar. 1341. = Isabell, da. of . . . . . . . 
2 CONC , d. 1349. ; ch: Robert (m. Elizabeth _ ) Gold
2 CONT ******                         Robert Gold of Seaborough. Ped. fin. 1357, Somerset. = Elizabeth, da. of . . .  , named in ped. fin. 1357. ; ch: John Gold of Seaborough and Sampit.
2 CONT *******                              John Gold of Seaborough and Sampit, made a grant of land to the Church of Seaborough 14 Jan. 1414. Lay subs. 1427, named as dead. = ch: John (2 son), Robert (m. Idonea Mycheldever), Alice (m. W
2 CONC illiam Huddesfield) Gold
2 CONT ********                                   .... etc.
2 CONT ********                                   Robert Gould of Seaborough, deed 1436. = Idonea, da. of Thomas Mycheldever, named in deed 1436. ; ch: Thomas (m. Eleanor _ ) Gould
2 CONT *********                                        Thomas Gould of Seaborough, son & heir, deed 1436, d. 5 May 1502. Inq. p.m. = Eleanor, da. of , , ,  , living with her son John of Staverton 1522-4. ; ch: John (m. Katherine Preston
2 CONC ), James (m. Margaret Appleton), Thomas (m. Edith Appleton) Gould
2 CONT **********                                             John Gould of Staverton, deed 16 Ap. 1518. Lay subsid. 1522-4, d. before 1526. = Katherine, da. of Richard Preston of Staverton. Will 21 Feb. 1529, Peculiar, Bp. of Exeter. ; 
2 CONC ch: B Vide page 420.
2 CONT **********                                             .... etc.
2 CONT **********Pg.420
2 CONT ***********                                                 Vide page 418. B (children of Katherine (Preston) & John Gould)
2 CONT ***********                                                  Robert Gould of Fordington, co. Dorset. Will 13 Aug. 1558, pro. 14 June 1559, P.C.C. (Cheyney 27). = Elizabeth, da. of . . .  Petre, extrix. to her husband. ; ch: Joan, 
2 CONC (Alice (m. John Collyford) Gould.
2 CONT ************                                                      .... etc.
2 CONT ***********                                                 John Gold of Staverton, d. s.p. 2 Mar. 1562. M.I. at Staverton. Inq. p.m. Ashbarton 3 Aug. 1562.
2 CONT ***********                                                 Agnes, mar. John Bagwell, both named with issue in the will of her brother Robert, living 1558.
2 CONT ***********                                                 James Gould of Dorchester, named as deceased in the will of his brother Robert. = ; ch: Alice (m. Mathew Churchill), Joan, George (m. Agnes Austin), James (m. Joan Leddoz
2 CONC ) Gould
2 CONT ************                                                      .... etc.
