2 CONC ill of her husband. Will 23 Nov. 1609, pro. 21 Feb. 1609-10, Collated wills, Exeter. ; ch: Otho (m. Joan Leere), Roberta (d.1625) Gould
2 CONT ************                                                      .... etc.
2 CONT ***********'''                                                  Thomas Gould of Coombe in Staverton, son and heir. Admon. granted 6 July 1571 to his son William, Act Book, P.C.C. = Joan, da. of Giles Ball of Chudleigh, bur. 4 Mar.
2 CONC  1601-2 at Totnes3 ; ch:''' C Vide page 421. Amye (m. Lawence Harte), Eleanor, Katherine (m. John Tackyn & Richard Yarde), Alice (m. Richard Beere) Gould
