2 CONT *John Gould of Staverton, co. Devon (eldest son of Thomas Gould of Seaborough, co. Somerset, who died 5 May 1502) ; living 1522-24; died before 1526. = Katherine Preston, dau. of Richard Preston of Staverton. Will dated 21 Februar
2 CONC y 1529 (Peculiar of Bishop of Exeter). ; ch: '''Thomas (m. Joan Ball)''', Robert (m. Elizabeth Petre) Gould, (Pg.63 James (d. bef. 1558), Richard (m. Margaret Petre), John (d.1562), Agnes (m. John Bagwell) Gould)
2 CONT **'''	Thomas Gould of Coombe, in Staverton. Administration was granted 6 July 1571, to his son William Gould (P.C.C.) = Joan Ball, dau. of Giles Ball of Chudleigh, co. Devon; bur. at Totnes, co. Devon, 4 March 1601/2. ; ch:''' Joh
2 CONC n (m. Alice Trehawke), William (m. Bridget Duck) Gould, (Pg.63 Amy (m. Lawrence Harte), Eleanor, Katherine (m. John Tackyn & Richard Yarde), Alice (m. Richard Beere) Gould)
2 CONT ***		John Gould of Combe, in Staverton; executer of will of his brother, William Gould, 13 February 1597/8. Will proved September 1608 (lost) (Arch: Court of Exeter). = Alice Trehawke, dau. of John Trehawke of Trehawke, co. Cornwa
2 CONC ll; bur. at Staverton 20 August 1621. ch: .... etc.
2 CONT ***		William Gould of Staverton ; administrator to his father's will 6 July 1571. Will dated 7 May 1597, proved 13 February 1597/8 (P.C.C. 20 Lewyn). = Bridget Duck, sister of Richard Duck of Totnes; executrix to her husband's wil
2 CONC l 13 February 1597/8.
2 CONT **	Robert Gould of Fordington, co. Dorset. Will dated 13 August 1558, proved 14 June 1559 (P.C.C. 27 Chaynay). = Elizabeth Petre, executrix to her husband's will 14 June 1559. (had issue not listed)
2 CONT **https://archive.org/stream/visitationengla00unkngoog#page/n90/mode/1up
2 CONT **Pg.63
2 CONT **	James Gould of Dorchester, co. Dorset; died before 13 August 1558. (had issue not listed)
2 CONT **	Richard Gould of Marldon, co. Devon. Will dated 5 October, proved 28 October 1557 (Exeter C.C.) = Margaret Petre, dau of John Petre of Marldon; executrix to her husband's will 28 October 1557. Will dated 23 November 1609, prove
2 CONC d at Exeter 21 February 1609/10. (had issue not listed)
2 CONT **	John Gould of Staverton, co. Devon ; died 2 March 1562, bur. at Staverton. M.I.
2 CONT **	Agnes, living in 1558 ; marr. John Bagwell. (had issue not listed)
2 CONT ***'''B (children of Joan (Ball) & Thomas Gould
2 CONT ***		Amy, marr. Lawrence Hart of Staverton.
2 CONT ***		Eleanor Gould, living 13 August 1558.
2 CONT ***		Katherine, marr. 1stly John Tackyn ; marriage licence (Exeter) dated 12 March 1583/4. = Richard Yarde of Bradley, co. Devon ; living, but blind, aged 76, in 1620.
2 CONT ***		Alice, marr. at Chudleigh 16 January 1581/2 ; living in 1597. = Richard Beere of Chudleigh, co. Devon. _________________________
