2 CONC  D84 (official). 3. CSP Ire. 1660-2, p. 577; CSP Dom. 1668-9, p. 163; HMC Ormonde, n.s. vii. 185; Cal. Treas. Bks. viii. 1950. 4. N. and Q. for Som. and Dorset, xxvii. 190-2; Gen. Mag. xv. 110; Black Bk. L. Inn, ii. 458-63; SP23/1
