2 CONC , 543; Dorset RO, D124, box 235, bdle. 1, Fox to Marlborough, n.d.; Wood’s Life and Times (Oxf. Hist. Soc. xxi), 428; CSP Dom. July-Sept. 1683, p. 239. 11. CSP Dom. 1686-7, p. 134; Hutchins, iv. 471.
