2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Olds-253
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr Robert Old formerly Olds aka Ould
2 CONT Born 1645 in Sherbourne, Dorsetshire, Englandmap
2 CONT Ancestors ancestors
2 CONT Son of John (Olde) Olds and Elizabeth (Gatherest) Olds
2 CONT Brother of Andrew Ould, John Olds, Hanibal Olde and Francis Olde	
2 CONT Husband of Susannah (Hanford) Olds — married 31 Dec 1669 in Windsor, Connecticutmap
2 CONT Husband of Dorothy (Granger) Old — married 1 Apr 1689 in Suffield, Hartford Co., CTmap
2 CONT Descendants descendants
2 CONT Father of Benjamin Olds, Elizabeth Olds, Experience Olds, Patience Olds, Robert Olds, Jonathan Olds, Mindwell (Olds) Stockwell, Hanford Olds, William Olds, William Olds, Susannah Olds, Ebenezer Olds, Ebenezer (Olds) Old, John Olds
2 CONC , Josiah Olds, Jonathan Olds, Nathaniel Olds and Joseph Olds
2 CONT Died 16 Jan 1728 in Suffield, Hartford, Connecticutmap 
