2 CONT Katherine Throckmorton Chester was born 1512 at Coorse Court, Gloucestershire, England the daughter of Christopher and Joan Harley Throckmorton. She married in 1532 at Coorse Court, Gloucestershire, Sir Robert Chester, Knight, the
2 CONC  son of Edward Chester.
2 CONT
2 CONT Known Children:
2 CONT # Oliver Chester 1533- 
2 CONT # Frances Chester 1536-1590 Md Robert Filmer Died East Sutton, Kent, England 
2 CONT # Robert Chester 1537- 
2 CONT # Catherine Chester 1539- 
2 CONT # Edward Chester 1544-1577 
2 CONT
2 CONT
