1 NOTE {geni:about_me} His children converted to Catholicism but Walter Pye himself seems to have remained loyal to the Church of England and was described ‘equally a friend to the mitre and the Crown’ and ‘a great lover of ministers and
2 CONC  consecrated men’. .... His granddaughter brought the estate to her husband, Henry Gorges, who represented Herefordshire as a maverick Tory from 1698 to 1708.
