2 CONC sa/refserv/bulldog/bull97/html/bul11-17.html link]  Edward Pye's father, John Pye, son of Sir Walter and Joane (Rudhall) Pye, was baptized on 17 Dec 1620. He married Blanche, sister of ''Sir Henry Lingen of Stoke Edith''. John and
2 CONC  Blanche were the parents of "twenty-three children, and Blanche was 30 before she was married." One of these twenty-three was Edward.
