0 @N6000000003216108538@ NOTE Knighted by the Protector Somerset 1548.  Acquired the Manor of Compton Basset, Wilts, 1553.  M.P. for Wilts, 1554.
0 @N6000000003216108520@ NOTE M.P. for Wiltshire, 1572.  "Esquire for the body of the Queen's Majesty."  Knighted 1574.  Sometime Collector of Customs at Dartmouth, Devon.
