0 @N6000000002577293096@ NOTE 1- 8 Apr 1999: Entered from an Ancestral File report.
1 CONT 2- This Ancestral File has parents for this John Scudmore along with 10 of       his siblings. I was going to enter the family into our data base, but         found out that the oldest child was born 4 years before his parents and
1 CONC  7     others were born before the father was 10 years old. There needs to be        some in depth researsh done here.
