1 CONT June 1503 Com of oy & term. Lordships of Usk, Trelkill and Caerleon incl Sir George H & Wm H (of Troy)
1 CONT 1504 Commission issued to Sir Walter H kt, Sir George H kt, Wm H esq & others (probably these are Caldicott, St Julians and Troy - brothers)
1 CONT Sir Walter H of Caldicott settled estates on feeoffes incl Sir George (see Sir Walter)
1 CONT Uncertain over which is his mother
