0 @N6000000001578873576@ NOTE Greetings. Just a note to thank you for sharing your hard genealogical work with gencircles. I came across your data base while searching for the father of Constance Touchet (b. 1543). I found what I was looking for, and as I trac
1 CONC ed back, much more in the form of new links, new details.
1 CONT
1 CONT Constance is one of my 15th great grandmothers. She married Robert Whitney (b. abt 1436), the son of Eustace Whitney and Jennet Trussel.. Your line and my line go down together through the son of Constance and Robert, James. James
1 CONC  married Blanche Milbourne, and I am descended from their daughter, Elizabeth (b. abt 1497, Whitney, Herfordshire, England) who married Thomas Morgan (b. Axton, Kingstone, Herefordshire, England), the son of William ap Daffyd Morg
1 CONC an and Elsbeth Morgan.
1 CONT
1 CONT Thanks again for sharing. Much appreciated.
1 CONT
1 CONT Best regards,
1 CONT
1 CONT Rarihokwats
1 CONT
1 CONT fourarrows
